Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.00,0:00:21.20,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Hello? -  Hello.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:21.27,0:00:23.71,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Yes? - Who is this?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:23.77,0:00:26.77,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Who you trying to reach? - What number is this?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.84,0:00:29.78,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- What number are you trying to reach? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:29.85,0:00:32.28,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- I think you have the wrong number. - Do I?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:32.35,0:00:34.78,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,It happens. Take it easy.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.03,0:00:46.46,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Hello! - I'm sorry. I guess I dialed the wrong number.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.53,0:00:49.97,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- So, why'd you dial it again? - To apologize.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:50.03,0:00:53.73,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- You're forgiven. Bye, now. - Wait, wait! Don't hang up.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:53.80,0:00:56.14,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- What? - I wanna talk to you for a second.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:56.21,0:00:59.30,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,They've got 900-numbers for that. See ya.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.63,0:01:23.33,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Hello. - Why don't you want to talk to me?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.40,0:01:24.54,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Who is this?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.54,0:01:27.46,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You tell me your name, I'll tell you mine.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.54,0:01:30.47,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:30.54,0:01:32.80,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- What's that noise? - Popcorn.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:32.88,0:01:34.81,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- You're making popcorn? - Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:34.88,0:01:37.11,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I only eat popcorn at the movies.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:37.18,0:01:40.48,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Well, I'm getting ready to watch a video. - Really? What?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.55,0:01:42.54,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, just some scary movie.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.62,0:01:44.92,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- You like scary movies? - Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:44.99,0:01:47.05,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,What's your favorite scary movie?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:47.12,0:01:50.02,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Uh, I don't know. - You have to have a favorite.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.09,0:01:52.03,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,What comes to mind?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:52.10,0:01:54.03,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Um... "Halloween."
Dialogue: 1,0:01:54.10,0:01:56.46,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You know, the one with the guy in the white mask...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:56.53,0:01:59.40,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,who walks around and stalks baby-sitters.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:59.47,0:02:01.40,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,-  Yeah. - What's yours?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:01.47,0:02:05.91,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Guess. - Um... "Nightmare on Elm Street."
Dialogue: 1,0:02:05.98,0:02:08.74,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Is that the one where the guy had knives for fingers?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.81,0:02:11.25,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Yeah, Freddy Krueger. - Freddy, that's right.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:11.31,0:02:13.98,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I liked that movie. It was scary.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:14.05,0:02:16.58,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Yeah, the first one was, but the rest sucked.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:16.65,0:02:18.62,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,So, you got a boyfriend?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:18.69,0:02:21.92,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Why? You wanna ask me out on a date?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:21.99,0:02:24.55,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Maybe. Do you have a boyfriend?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:24.63,0:02:27.82,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Mm... no. - You never told me your name.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:27.90,0:02:29.83,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Why do you want to know my name?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:29.90,0:02:33.27,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,'Cause I wanna know who I'm looking at.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:33.34,0:02:38.10,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- What did you say? - I wanna know who I'm talking to.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:38.17,0:02:39.42,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,That's not what you said.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:39.42,0:02:41.11,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,What do you think I said?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:43.25,0:02:45.27,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:46.52,0:02:48.51,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:48.58,0:02:50.78,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Look, I gotta go.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:50.85,0:02:52.79,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Wait! I thought we were gonna go out.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:52.86,0:02:55.19,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Uh, nah, I don't think so.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:55.26,0:02:57.19,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't hang up on me!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:05.57,0:03:07.87,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Shit.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:07.94,0:03:11.63,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Yes? - I told you not to hang up on me.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:11.71,0:03:13.80,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- What do you want? - To talk.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:13.88,0:03:16.54,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Well, dial someone else, okay?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:25.89,0:03:28.88,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Listen, asshole! - No, you listen, you little bitch!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:28.96,0:03:30.57,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You hang up on me again,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:30.57,0:03:33.16,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I'll cut you like a fish, understand?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:33.23,0:03:35.75,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:35.83,0:03:37.77,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Is this some kind of joke?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:37.83,0:03:40.27,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,More of a game, really.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:41.84,0:03:45.04,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Can you handle that...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:45.11,0:03:47.51,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,blondie?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:57.65,0:03:59.59,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Can you see me?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:02.59,0:04:07.12,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Listen, I am two seconds away from calling the police.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:07.20,0:04:11.43,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,They'd never make it in time. We're out in the middle of nowhere.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:11.50,0:04:13.31,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:13.31,0:04:16.56,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,To see what your insides look like.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:24.88,0:04:28.37,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Who's there? Who's there?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:29.55,0:04:31.49,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm calling the police.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:33.89,0:04:36.22,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You should never say, "Who's there?"
Dialogue: 1,0:04:36.29,0:04:38.73,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't you watch scary movies? It's a death wish.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:38.79,0:04:43.39,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You might as well just come out here to investigate a strange noise or somethin'.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:43.47,0:04:46.90,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Look, you've had your fun now...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:46.97,0:04:50.53,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- so I think you better just leave or else. - Or else what?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:50.61,0:04:55.24,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Or else my boyfriend'll be here any second, and he'll be pissed when he finds out.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:55.31,0:04:57.25,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I thought you didn't have a boyfriend.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:57.31,0:05:01.18,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I lied! I do have a boyfriend, and he'll be here any second...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:01.25,0:05:04.31,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- so your ass better be gone. - Sure.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:04.39,0:05:06.86,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I swear.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:06.92,0:05:09.07,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,He's big, and he plays football
Dialogue: 1,0:05:09.07,0:05:11.79,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,and he'll kick the shit out of you!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:11.86,0:05:15.09,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm getting scared. I'm shaking in my boots.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:15.16,0:05:17.60,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,So you better just leave.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:17.67,0:05:19.60,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,His name wouldn't be...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:19.67,0:05:22.60,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Steve, would it?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:22.67,0:05:25.61,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,How do you know his name?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:25.68,0:05:29.61,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Turn on the patio lights... again.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:41.69,0:05:43.78,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, God!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:43.86,0:05:46.37,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,, I wouldn't do that if I were you.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:46.37,0:05:47.56,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:47.63,0:05:49.69,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Guess. - Please don't hurt him.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:49.77,0:05:52.39,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- That all depends on you. - Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:52.47,0:05:54.94,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- I wanna play a game. - No.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:55.00,0:05:57.60,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Then he dies right now! - No! No!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:57.67,0:06:02.20,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Which is it? Which is it?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:02.28,0:06:06.21,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Wha... What kind of game?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:06.28,0:06:10.98,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Turn off the light. You'll see what kind of game.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:11.05,0:06:12.99,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Just do it!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:15.16,0:06:18.13,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Casey! No! No!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:18.19,0:06:20.25,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,No! Casey!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:20.33,0:06:22.26,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Here's how we play.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:22.33,0:06:26.67,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I ask a question. If you get it right, Steve lives.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:26.74,0:06:29.03,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Please don't do this. - Come on. It'll be fun.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:29.11,0:06:31.13,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Please... - It's an easy category.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:31.21,0:06:33.14,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Please... - Movie trivia.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:33.21,0:06:36.08,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- I'll even give you a warm-up question. - Don't do this. I can't.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:36.15,0:06:39.58,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Name the killer in "Halloween." - No.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:39.65,0:06:42.58,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Come on! It's your favorite scary movie, remember?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:42.65,0:06:45.07,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,He had a white mask; he stalked the baby-sitters.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:45.07,0:06:45.92,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:45.99,0:06:48.92,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Come on. Yes, you do. - No, please.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:48.99,0:06:52.19,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- What's his name? - I can't think.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:52.26,0:06:54.75,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Steve's counting on you.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:54.83,0:06:57.86,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Michael... Michael, Michael.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:57.93,0:07:00.49,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Yes! Very good.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:00.57,0:07:02.50,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Now for the real question.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:02.57,0:07:04.94,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- No! - But you're doing so well.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:05.01,0:07:06.45,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,We can't stop now.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:06.45,0:07:08.41,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Please stop! Leave us alone!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:08.48,0:07:11.54,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Answer the question. Same category.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:11.61,0:07:14.55,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, please stop.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:14.62,0:07:17.71,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Name the killer in "Friday the 13th."
Dialogue: 1,0:07:17.79,0:07:20.45,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Jason! Jason, Jason!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:20.52,0:07:23.58,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. That's the wrong answer.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:23.66,0:07:27.12,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,No, it's not! No, it's not. It was Jason.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:27.20,0:07:29.39,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Afraid not. No way.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:29.47,0:07:33.42,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Listen, it was Jason! I saw that movie 20 goddamn times!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:33.50,0:07:35.00,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Then you should know Jason's mother,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:35.00,0:07:36.63,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Mrs. Voorhees, was the original killer.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:36.71,0:07:39.00,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Jason didn't show up until the sequel.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:39.08,0:07:41.94,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm afraid that was a wrong answer.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:42.01,0:07:43.95,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You tricked me.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:44.01,0:07:46.04,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Lucky for you there's a bonus round.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:46.12,0:07:49.88,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,But poor Steve. I'm afraid he's out!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:14.28,0:08:18.24,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey, we're not finished yet.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:19.62,0:08:22.88,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Final question. Are you ready?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:22.95,0:08:27.12,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Please, please, leave me alone.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:27.19,0:08:29.12,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Answer the question, and I will.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:30.49,0:08:33.93,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,What door am I at?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:34.00,0:08:38.67,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- What? - There are two main doors to your house.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:38.80,0:08:39.60,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,The front door, the patio doors.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:39.67,0:08:41.60,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,If you answer correctly, you live.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:41.67,0:08:43.90,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Very simple.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:43.97,0:08:47.07,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't do this. I can't; I won't.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:47.14,0:08:49.70,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Your call.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:17.40,0:10:19.43,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Aah!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:06.16,0:11:09.45,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Did you water over here today?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:09.53,0:11:12.02,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- It was just that water from the rain. - They look great, don't they?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:12.09,0:11:13.25,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't they smell strong?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:13.25,0:11:15.03,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I told you you could send it back.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:18.10,0:11:20.63,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:20.70,0:11:22.97,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Jesus! - What is it?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:36.82,0:11:38.84,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Casey!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:42.19,0:11:44.59,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, G...
Dialogue: 1,0:11:46.46,0:11:48.56,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Casey. Casey.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:48.63,0:11:50.56,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Casey!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:52.60,0:11:54.93,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Where is she? - Call the police!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:58.91,0:12:00.84,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Casey!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:00.91,0:12:02.17,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Casey, are you upstairs?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:02.17,0:12:03.78,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, my God. Casey, baby?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:03.85,0:12:05.78,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,-  Casey? -  She's here.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:05.85,0:12:08.28,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Mom. -  Oh, my God, I can hear her.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:08.35,0:12:11.72,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- s Mom. - Where is she?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:13.79,0:12:15.72,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, my God! I can hear her.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:15.79,0:12:17.73,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:20.46,0:12:24.40,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Get in the car. Drive down to the MacKenzies'.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:24.47,0:12:27.83,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- No. No, not my daughter. - Just go.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:27.90,0:12:29.84,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Not my daughter. - Call the police.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:10.58,0:13:12.74,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,It's just me.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:12.79,0:13:15.81,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Billy, what are you doing here? - Sorry, don't hate me.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:15.89,0:13:18.19,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- You sleep in that? - Yes, I sleep in this.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:18.26,0:13:20.19,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,My dad is in the other room. You can't be in here.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:20.26,0:13:22.59,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I'll just stay a sec.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:22.66,0:13:24.72,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,No...You gotta go. Go, go, go.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:24.80,0:13:26.92,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,What's going on in there?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:27.00,0:13:28.93,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Are you okay? - Can you knock?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:29.00,0:13:30.87,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- I heard screaming. - No, you didn't.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:30.94,0:13:33.23,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,No?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:33.31,0:13:36.40,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, well. I'm hitting the sack.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:36.48,0:13:38.94,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,My flight leaves first thing in the morning.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:39.01,0:13:42.07,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Now, the expo runs all weekend, so I won't be back 'til Sunday.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:42.15,0:13:45.45,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- There's cash on the table, and I'm staying at... - The Hilton.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:45.52,0:13:48.42,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Out at the airport, so call if... - I need anything.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:48.49,0:13:51.51,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I could've sworn I heard screaming.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:51.59,0:13:53.62,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Have a good trip, okay?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:53.69,0:13:55.63,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Sleep tight, sweetie.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:00.30,0:14:01.89,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh... close call.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:01.97,0:14:04.77,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Billy, what're you doing here?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:04.84,0:14:06.77,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,It occurred to me that...
Dialogue: 1,0:14:06.84,0:14:08.20,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I've never snuck through your bedroom window.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:08.20,0:14:09.03,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Shh, shh, shh.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:09.11,0:14:11.77,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Great idea, now that it's out of your system.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:11.84,0:14:13.78,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I was home watching television.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:13.85,0:14:16.31,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,"The," uh, "The Exorcist" was on.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:16.38,0:14:20.25,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- It got me thinking of you. - It did?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:20.32,0:14:22.16,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Yeah, it was edited for TV.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:22.16,0:14:24.15,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You know, all the good stuff was cut out.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:24.22,0:14:28.52,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,And it got me thinking of us...
Dialogue: 1,0:14:28.59,0:14:32.19,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,how two years ago we started off hot and heavy.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:32.26,0:14:36.17,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Nice solid R-rating on our way to an NC-17.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:37.67,0:14:41.13,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,And now... things have changed and...
Dialogue: 1,0:14:46.28,0:14:49.65,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,lately we're just sort of edited for television.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:49.72,0:14:54.08,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, so you thought you would climb in my window...
Dialogue: 1,0:14:54.15,0:14:57.32,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- and we'd have a little raw footage? -  No.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:57.39,0:15:01.55,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,No, I wouldn't dream of breaking your underwear rule.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:01.63,0:15:06.59,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I just thought maybe we could do a little on-top-of-the-clothes stuff.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:09.34,0:15:13.50,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Okay. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:13.57,0:15:15.51,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:28.95,0:15:30.89,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:46.07,0:15:49.27,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Okay. Okay, okay. Time is up, stud-muffin.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:49.34,0:15:52.28,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,God, you see what you do to me?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:52.34,0:15:55.78,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You know what my dad'll do to you?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:56.35,0:15:58.28,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:58.35,0:16:01.29,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- I'm going. - Okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:10.60,0:16:13.19,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You know, I... I appreciate the romantic gesture.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:15.27,0:16:19.10,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey, about the, uh, the sex stuff?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:19.17,0:16:21.87,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm not trying to rush you at all.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:21.94,0:16:24.38,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I was only half serious.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:24.44,0:16:26.81,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:34.85,0:16:36.79,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey, Billy.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:36.86,0:16:41.12,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Would you settle for a PG-13 relationship?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:41.19,0:16:43.89,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:49.50,0:16:53.40,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,My God. You're just a tease.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:00.51,0:17:03.48,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Thirty-five
Dialogue: 1,0:17:03.55,0:17:06.25,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Situation under control.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:06.32,0:17:09.25,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Roger, dispatch.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:09.32,0:17:12.09,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,There's blood found? All right.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:27.27,0:17:30.33,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,are doing drugs they buy in the classrooms...
Dialogue: 1,0:17:30.41,0:17:32.84,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,and that they are involved in the occult.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:32.91,0:17:35.14,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Occult?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:35.21,0:17:38.27,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Woodsboro, California, was devastated last night...
Dialogue: 1,0:17:38.35,0:17:41.11,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,when two young teenagers were found brutally murdered.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:41.19,0:17:43.31,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Authorities have yet to issue a statement...
Dialogue: 1,0:17:43.39,0:17:46.83,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,but our sources tell us that no arrest has been made...
Dialogue: 1,0:17:46.89,0:17:48.83,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- and the murderer could strike again. - Do you believe this shit?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:48.89,0:17:52.02,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Damn! What is going on? - You don't know?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:52.10,0:17:55.69,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Casey Becker and Steve Orth were killed last night.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:55.77,0:17:57.70,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,What? No way.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:57.77,0:18:00.20,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,And we're not just talking killed; we're talking splatter-movie killed.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:00.27,0:18:02.30,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Ripped open from end to end.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:02.37,0:18:04.90,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Casey Becker, she sits next to me in English.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:04.98,0:18:06.91,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Not anymore. It's so sad.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:06.98,0:18:09.28,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Her mom and dad, they found her hanging from a tree...
Dialogue: 1,0:18:09.35,0:18:12.25,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- her insides on the outside. - Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:12.32,0:18:14.25,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Do they know who did it?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:14.32,0:18:17.62,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Fucking clueless. They're interrogating the entire school.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:17.69,0:18:18.74,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Teachers, students, janitors.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:18.74,0:18:20.18,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,They think it's school-related?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:20.26,0:18:21.05,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,They don't know.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:21.05,0:18:24.20,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Dewey was saying this is the worst crime they've seen in years.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:24.26,0:18:26.20,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Even worse than
Dialogue: 1,0:18:26.27,0:18:28.93,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Well... it's bad.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:34.07,0:18:37.60,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,-  Here you go, Mrs. Tate. - Thank you, James.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:40.45,0:18:42.11,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Sidney.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:42.18,0:18:44.55,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,It would appear to be your turn.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:48.79,0:18:52.35,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Who's up next? - Uh, Sidney Prescott.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:52.42,0:18:55.12,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,She was daughter of, uh...
Dialogue: 1,0:18:56.50,0:18:59.09,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Sidney, how you feelin'? - Fine.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:59.16,0:19:01.46,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Hi, Sidney.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:01.53,0:19:03.06,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Sheriff Burke, Dewey.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:03.14,0:19:06.80,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Uh, that's Deputy Riley today, Sid.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:06.87,0:19:10.27,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,-  How is everything? - Good.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:10.34,0:19:12.44,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,And your dad? How's he doin'?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:12.51,0:19:13.63,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,We're fine. Thanks.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:13.63,0:19:16.41,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,We're gonna keep this very brief, Sidney.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:16.48,0:19:19.14,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,The police just want to ask you a few questions. You okay?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:19.22,0:19:20.58,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:20.65,0:19:23.92,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Sidney, were you very close to Casey Becker?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:23.99,0:19:27.58,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Remember, your principal loves you, and I want you to be safe.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:27.66,0:19:31.32,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,All students are encouraged to return home promptly from school grounds.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:31.40,0:19:33.42,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Avoid strangers; walk in twos and threes.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:33.50,0:19:35.43,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,What kind of questions did they ask you, Sidney?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:35.50,0:19:36.55,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,They asked if I knew Casey.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:36.56,0:19:37.70,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,They asked me that too.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:37.77,0:19:40.20,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Hey, did they ask if you like to hunt? - Yeah, they did.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:40.27,0:19:42.21,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Did they ask you?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:42.27,0:19:44.27,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Why would they ask you if you liked to hunt?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:44.34,0:19:46.78,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,'Cause their bodies were gutted.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:46.85,0:19:50.08,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Thank you, Randy. - They didn't ask me if I like to hunt.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:50.15,0:19:53.21,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- 'Cause there's no way a girl could've killed 'em. - That is so sexist.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:53.29,0:19:55.91,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,The killer could easily be female. "Basic Instinct."
Dialogue: 1,0:19:55.99,0:19:58.32,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,That was an ice pick. Not exactly the same thing.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:58.39,0:20:00.92,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Yeah, Casey and Steve were completely hollowed out.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:00.99,0:20:03.52,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,And the fact is, it takes a man to do something like that.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:03.60,0:20:05.53,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Or a man's mentality.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:05.60,0:20:08.09,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,How do you... gut someone?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:11.44,0:20:15.93,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You take a knife, and you slit 'em from the groin to sternum.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:16.01,0:20:19.77,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey, it's called tact, you fuck rag.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:19.85,0:20:22.01,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey, Stu, didn't you used to date Casey?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:22.08,0:20:23.21,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Yeah, for like two seconds.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:23.21,0:20:26.11,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,, Before she dumped him for Steve.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:26.19,0:20:28.12,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I thought you dumped her for me.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:28.19,0:20:29.52,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I did. He's full of shit.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:29.52,0:20:31.52,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,And are the police aware that you dated the victim?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:31.59,0:20:34.72,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey, what're you saying? That I killed her?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:34.79,0:20:36.78,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,It would certainly improve your high school "Q."
Dialogue: 1,0:20:36.86,0:20:40.70,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Stu was with me last night, okay? - Yeah, I was.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:40.77,0:20:44.33,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Was that before or after he sliced and diced?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:44.40,0:20:46.46,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Fuck you, nutcase. Where were you last night?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:46.54,0:20:47.22,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Working, thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:47.22,0:20:50.37,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,At the video store? I thought they fired your ass.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:50.44,0:20:52.41,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Twice.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:52.48,0:20:56.35,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- I didn't kill anybody. - Nobody said you did.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:56.42,0:20:58.08,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Thanks, buddy.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:58.15,0:21:03.21,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Besides, it takes a man to do something like that.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:03.29,0:21:06.38,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- I'm gonna gut your ass in a second, kid. - Tell me something.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:06.46,0:21:08.89,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Did you really put her liver in the mailbox?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:08.96,0:21:12.86,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,'Cause I heard that they found her liver in the mailbox next to her spleen and pancreas.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:12.93,0:21:14.96,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You goon! Fuck! I'm trying to eat here.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:15.03,0:21:17.13,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,She's getting mad, all right?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:17.20,0:21:19.17,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You better "liver" alone.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:21.94,0:21:24.93,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,"Liver" alone!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:27.68,0:21:31.21,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,"Liv..." Ow! "Liver, Liver". It was a joke.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:36.86,0:21:39.98,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,See you, Sidney. I'll talk to you tomorrow, Sid.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:02.18,0:22:06.62,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,So, you're sure I can stay over, 'cause my dad won't be back 'til Sunday.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:06.69,0:22:08.92,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,No problem. I'll pick you up after practice.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.49,0:22:12.42,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:12.49,0:22:14.93,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Uh-huh. It's just...
Dialogue: 1,0:22:14.99,0:22:16.93,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,you know, the police and the reporters...
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.00,0:22:18.93,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,it's like deja vu all over again.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:19.00,0:22:21.30,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I'll be there by 7:00. I promise.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:21.37,0:22:23.80,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Thanks, Tatum. - Later.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:11.52,0:23:13.71,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,The bodies of 17-year-old Casey Becker...
Dialogue: 1,0:23:13.79,0:23:15.72,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,and her 18-year-old boyfriend, Steven Orth...
Dialogue: 1,0:23:15.79,0:23:17.72,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,were discovered late last night by the girl's parents...
Dialogue: 1,0:23:17.79,0:23:19.85,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,The Woodsboro double murder case.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:19.93,0:23:22.92,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Authorities are baffled by the lack of clues and the savage...
Dialogue: 1,0:23:23.00,0:23:26.52,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,The town's in shock, and no one can quite believe what has happened here...
Dialogue: 1,0:23:26.60,0:23:29.33,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,although this is not the first time this small community...
Dialogue: 1,0:23:29.40,0:23:32.39,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,of Woodsboro has endured such tragedy.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:32.47,0:23:34.46,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Only a year ago Maureen Prescott, wife and mother...
Dialogue: 1,0:23:34.54,0:23:39.00,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,was found raped and murdered not far from this peaceful town square.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:49.48,0:24:53.42,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Hello? - Practice ran late. I'm on my way, okay?
Dialogue: 1,0:24:55.32,0:24:57.25,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,It's past 7:00.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:57.32,0:25:00.26,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't worry. Casey and Steve didn't bite it 'til way after 10:00.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:00.33,0:25:03.23,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh. Oh, that's comforting.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:03.36,0:25:05.16,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm gonna swing by the video store.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:05.23,0:25:07.16,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I was thinkin' Tom Cruise, "All The Right Moves."
Dialogue: 1,0:25:07.23,0:25:10.10,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,If you pause it just right, you can see his penis.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:10.17,0:25:11.97,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Whatever. Just hurry, okay?
Dialogue: 1,0:25:11.98,0:25:13.10,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Ta-ta, Sid.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:23.95,0:25:28.11,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Tatum, just get in the car  -  Hello, Sidney.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:28.19,0:25:31.95,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Uh... hi, who is this?
Dialogue: 1,0:25:32.02,0:25:35.62,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You tell me.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:35.69,0:25:38.13,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Well, I-I have no idea.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:38.20,0:25:40.13,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Scary night, isn't it?
Dialogue: 1,0:25:40.20,0:25:45.00,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,With the murders and all, it's like right out of a horror movie or something.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:45.07,0:25:47.63,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Randy, you gave yourself away.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:47.71,0:25:49.94,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Are you calling from work, 'cause Tatum's on her way over.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:50.01,0:25:53.50,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Do you like scary movies, Sidney?
Dialogue: 1,0:25:53.58,0:25:56.64,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I like that thing you're doing with your voice, Randy. It's sexy.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:56.72,0:25:59.41,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,What's your favorite scary movie?
Dialogue: 1,0:25:59.48,0:26:01.65,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, come on. You know I don't watch that shit.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:01.72,0:26:04.28,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Why not? Too scared? - No. No.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:04.36,0:26:06.42,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,It's just, what's the point? They're all the same.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:06.49,0:26:09.62,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Some stupid killer stalking some big-breasted girl who can't act...
Dialogue: 1,0:26:09.69,0:26:12.63,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,who's always running up the stairs when she should be going out the front door.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:12.70,0:26:16.60,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- It's insulting. - Are you alone in the house?
Dialogue: 1,0:26:16.67,0:26:19.23,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Randy, that's so unoriginal. I'm disappointed in you.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:19.30,0:26:22.64,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Maybe that's because I'm not Randy.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:29.75,0:26:31.68,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,So, who are you?
Dialogue: 1,0:26:31.75,0:26:33.78,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,The question isn't "Who am I?"
Dialogue: 1,0:26:33.85,0:26:37.29,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,The question is "Where am I?"
Dialogue: 1,0:26:38.39,0:26:41.45,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,S-S-So, where are you?
Dialogue: 1,0:26:41.53,0:26:43.46,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Your front porch.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:47.80,0:26:50.23,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Why would you be calling from my front porch?
Dialogue: 1,0:26:50.30,0:26:52.24,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,That's the original part.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:53.97,0:26:55.91,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 1,0:26:59.48,0:27:01.57,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Well, I call your bluff.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:14.33,0:27:17.26,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- So, where are you? - Right here.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:49.79,0:27:52.32,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Can you see me right now? - Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:52.40,0:27:54.33,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Uh-huh, okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:54.40,0:27:57.37,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,What am I doin'? Huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:27:57.44,0:28:00.87,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh? What am I doin'? Hello!
Dialogue: 1,0:28:02.21,0:28:04.14,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Nice try, Randy.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:04.21,0:28:06.58,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Tell Tatum to hurry up, okay? Bye now.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:06.65,0:28:09.24,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,If you hang up on me, you'll die just like your mother!
Dialogue: 1,0:28:10.55,0:28:16.01,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Do you wanna die, Sidney? Your mother sure didn't.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:17.19,0:28:19.18,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Fuck you, you cretin!
Dialogue: 1,0:28:48.89,0:28:50.22,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 1,0:29:20.15,0:29:22.09,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 1,0:29:36.40,0:29:39.00,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Billy!
Dialogue: 1,0:29:39.07,0:29:41.23,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,The door's locked. I heard screaming. You all right?
Dialogue: 1,0:29:41.31,0:29:43.24,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,The killer's here. He's in the house.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:43.31,0:29:46.21,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,He's in the house. He's got a knife.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:46.28,0:29:48.87,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,He's gone. He's gone.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:48.95,0:29:50.88,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:00.86,0:30:02.79,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:30:06.03,0:30:09.02,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Sid, what?
Dialogue: 1,0:30:10.34,0:30:12.27,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa, wait, wait. Wait, Sidney, wait!
Dialogue: 1,0:30:12.34,0:30:15.86,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Wait, wait, wait, wait! What's going on?
Dialogue: 1,0:30:15.94,0:30:19.43,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Sidney, come back! Sidney!
Dialogue: 1,0:30:23.35,0:30:27.81,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Sorry! I found this. Come on!
Dialogue: 1,0:30:27.89,0:30:29.82,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,All right, hold your hands together.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:29.89,0:30:31.65,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Do you wish to give up your right to remain silent?
Dialogue: 1,0:30:31.65,0:30:32.82,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I didn't do anything.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:32.89,0:30:34.83,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Do you wish to give up your right to speak to an attorney...
Dialogue: 1,0:30:34.89,0:30:36.83,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,and have them present during questioning?
Dialogue: 1,0:30:36.90,0:30:40.83,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Ask her. She'll tell you.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:40.90,0:30:42.99,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- I caught him, Sheriff. - Wait. Who is that?
Dialogue: 1,0:30:43.07,0:30:46.50,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Billy Loomis. - Sheriff, Sheriff, call these guys off.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:46.57,0:30:49.67,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I didn't do it. Sheriff, wait.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:49.74,0:30:51.68,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Wait, listen. Call my dad.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:51.74,0:30:54.11,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Please, call him. He'll tell you. Call him.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:54.18,0:30:57.62,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Sidney! Sidney!
Dialogue: 1,0:30:57.68,0:30:59.74,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- How's she doing? - Sid's tougher than she looks.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:59.82,0:31:02.75,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,She'd have to be, all the shit she's been through.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:02.82,0:31:06.26,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,-  Sid! - Well, we're seein' a lot of you today.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:06.32,0:31:10.12,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You gonna be able to come down to the station and answer a few questions, Sid?
Dialogue: 1,0:31:10.20,0:31:12.13,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, shit! Sidney!
Dialogue: 1,0:31:12.20,0:31:14.39,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,God, Sid, I'm so sorry I was late. Are you all right?
Dialogue: 1,0:31:14.47,0:31:16.40,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Tatum, you can't be here. This is an official crime scene.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:16.47,0:31:20.16,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- It's okay. - Her dad's out of town. She's staying with us.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:20.24,0:31:22.17,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Does Mom know?
Dialogue: 1,0:31:22.24,0:31:24.67,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Yes, doofus. - Let's get you out of here.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:24.74,0:31:26.68,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,-  She'll be okay. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:26.74,0:31:28.68,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, you won't believe this.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:32.22,0:31:34.15,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Creepy, huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:31:43.19,0:31:45.13,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- I'll be damned. - What?
Dialogue: 1,0:31:45.20,0:31:48.13,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Jesus! The camera, hurry! - My name isn't Jesus.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:50.07,0:31:52.00,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Sidney, is that you in there?
Dialogue: 1,0:31:52.07,0:31:54.00,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Excuse me. Is that Sidney Prescott they took away?
Dialogue: 1,0:31:54.07,0:31:56.01,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- I'm not talking to you. - What happened to her?
Dialogue: 1,0:31:56.07,0:31:59.44,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- None of your damned business. - I heard something about a costume. Is that true?
Dialogue: 1,0:31:59.51,0:32:01.70,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Can you tell me anything?
Dialogue: 1,0:32:01.71,0:32:03.61,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're a real pain in the ass.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:03.68,0:32:06.12,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Leave Sid alone.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:06.18,0:32:08.12,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Where's she goin'?
Dialogue: 1,0:32:09.19,0:32:11.95,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Look. Kenny? - Yeah?
Dialogue: 1,0:32:12.02,0:32:14.32,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I know that you're about 50 pounds overweight...
Dialogue: 1,0:32:14.39,0:32:16.33,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,but when I say "hurry",
Dialogue: 1,0:32:16.39,0:32:17.13,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,please interpret that as
Dialogue: 1,0:32:17.13,0:32:21.16,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,"move your fat, tub-of-lard ass now!"
Dialogue: 1,0:32:23.00,0:32:25.83,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Did you find him?
Dialogue: 1,0:32:25.90,0:32:28.87,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You sure it was the Hilton?
Dialogue: 1,0:32:28.94,0:32:33.67,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- At the airport. - He's not registered there.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:35.05,0:32:37.98,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Could he have stayed somewhere else?
Dialogue: 1,0:32:38.05,0:32:41.25,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I don't know. I guess.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:41.32,0:32:43.69,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Sid.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:43.82,0:32:45.00,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,We'll find him.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:45.00,0:32:47.09,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Dewey, they got that mask in.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:48.66,0:32:50.60,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:58.47,0:33:03.03,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Let me ask you this. What're you doin' with a cellular telephone, son?
Dialogue: 1,0:33:03.11,0:33:05.04,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Everybody's got one, Sheriff.
Dialogue: 1,0:33:05.11,0:33:08.31,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I didn't make those calls, I swear.
Dialogue: 1,0:33:08.38,0:33:10.31,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Check the phone bill, for Christ's sake.
Dialogue: 1,0:33:10.38,0:33:12.65,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Call Vital Phone Comp. They got the records of every number dialed.
Dialogue: 1,0:33:12.72,0:33:15.62,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Thanks, Hank. We're on top of it.
Dialogue: 1,0:33:15.69,0:33:18.38,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,What were you doing over at Sidney's house tonight?
Dialogue: 1,0:33:18.46,0:33:20.95,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I wanted to see her, that's all.
Dialogue: 1,0:33:21.03,0:33:24.79,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,And last night? Sidney said you crawled through her window last night too.
Dialogue: 1,0:33:24.86,0:33:27.20,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You went out last night?
Dialogue: 1,0:33:27.27,0:33:31.83,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I was watching TV. I got bored. I decided to go for a ride.
Dialogue: 1,0:33:31.90,0:33:34.74,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Did you happen to ride by Casey Becker's house?
Dialogue: 1,0:33:34.81,0:33:38.83,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,No, I didn't. Sheriff, I didn't kill anybody!
Dialogue: 1,0:33:44.18,0:33:47.28,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,We're gonna have to hold you, son, 'til we get those phone records.
Dialogue: 1,0:33:50.26,0:33:52.69,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,That's crazy.
Dialogue: 1,0:33:52.76,0:33:56.82,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You know that? I didn't do it.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:07.17,0:34:09.30,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Camera Two? Okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:09.38,0:34:11.64,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Are there anymore doughnuts in there?
Dialogue: 1,0:34:11.71,0:34:14.68,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Move it, Kenny. - They're not lettin' anybody in.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:14.75,0:34:17.68,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- I'm not just anyone. -  Bitch goddess.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:17.75,0:34:19.68,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Kenny, are we on? - Yeah, go.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:19.75,0:34:22.19,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Hi, Gale Weathers reporting live from Woodsboro police station...
Dialogue: 1,0:34:22.25,0:34:24.28,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,where we hope to get a glimpse of Sidney Prescott.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:24.36,0:34:25.58,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey, watch it, lady.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:25.59,0:34:28.32,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey, watch the hand! Do you know who you're dealing with?
Dialogue: 1,0:34:28.39,0:34:31.36,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Tell 'em. Come on, Dad. Tell 'em!
Dialogue: 1,0:34:31.43,0:34:33.46,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- He's waiting for the lawyer, Billy. - Sidney!
Dialogue: 1,0:34:33.53,0:34:35.76,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Sidney, come on. You know me.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:35.83,0:34:38.63,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Sidney, look at me!
Dialogue: 1,0:34:38.70,0:34:41.14,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 1,0:34:45.44,0:34:49.47,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Sid, we're gonna get you out of here, okay? Are you okay?
Dialogue: 1,0:34:51.18,0:34:55.02,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,They sell this costume at every five-and-dime in the state.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:55.09,0:34:57.75,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,There's no way to track the purchase.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:57.82,0:35:00.09,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,What about that cellular phone bill?
Dialogue: 1,0:35:00.16,0:35:03.93,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,We're pulling Loomis's account. We won't know anything until the morning.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:04.00,0:35:07.40,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 1,0:35:07.47,0:35:08.85,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You think he did it?
Dialogue: 1,0:35:08.85,0:35:11.20,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Twenty years ago, I would've said, "Not a chance."
Dialogue: 1,0:35:11.27,0:35:16.07,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,But these kids today... damned if I know.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:16.14,0:35:19.37,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Hey, Dewey, can we go now? - Hold on a second.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:19.45,0:35:22.81,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Goddamn it, Dewey! - What did Mama tell you?
Dialogue: 1,0:35:22.88,0:35:25.51,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,When I wear this badge, you treat me like a man of the law!
Dialogue: 1,0:35:25.58,0:35:27.78,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Deputy Dewey-boy, but we're ready to go.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:27.85,0:35:30.85,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Now, okay? -  Whoa.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:30.92,0:35:34.88,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Take 'em out the back way. Avoid that circus out there.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:34.96,0:35:37.90,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Come on. - Don't touch me!
Dialogue: 1,0:35:37.96,0:35:41.40,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- He's my superior. - Janitors are your superior.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:43.84,0:35:45.77,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Let's get back to work!
Dialogue: 1,0:35:51.48,0:35:54.28,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Isn't there a back way out of this building? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:54.35,0:35:56.78,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Down that alley, I think.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:59.65,0:36:02.59,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You guys just stay here. I'm gonna get the car.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:02.65,0:36:04.59,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't move. Don't make a sound.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:06.33,0:36:09.32,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,There she is. Sidney!
Dialogue: 1,0:36:09.39,0:36:12.56,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Hi, that's some night. What happened? Are you all right?
Dialogue: 1,0:36:12.63,0:36:15.00,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,She's not answering any questions. Just leave us alone.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:15.07,0:36:17.50,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,No, Tatum, it's okay. She's just doin' her job, right, Gale?
Dialogue: 1,0:36:17.57,0:36:21.01,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Yes, that's right. - So, how's the book?
Dialogue: 1,0:36:21.07,0:36:23.06,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Well, it'll be out later this year.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:23.14,0:36:25.44,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, I'll look for it.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:25.51,0:36:28.41,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I'll send you a copy.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:28.48,0:36:30.64,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Jeez.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:30.72,0:36:33.28,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,-  Nice shot. -  Bitch.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:33.35,0:36:34.79,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,No, I mean, camera shot.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:34.79,0:36:36.45,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Where'd you learn to punch like that?
Dialogue: 1,0:36:36.52,0:36:39.46,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,God, I loved it. "I'll send you a copy."
Dialogue: 1,0:36:39.53,0:36:41.46,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Bam! Bitch went down.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:41.53,0:36:45.73,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,"I'll send you a copy." Bam! Sid... Superbitch!
Dialogue: 1,0:36:45.80,0:36:47.73,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You are so cool.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:47.80,0:36:50.10,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Thought you might want some ice for that right hook.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:50.17,0:36:52.33,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:52.40,0:36:56.10,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I'll be right next door. Try to get some sleep.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:56.18,0:36:58.11,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:01.75,0:37:05.95,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Do you really think Billy did it?
Dialogue: 1,0:37:06.02,0:37:07.95,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,He was there, Tatum.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:08.02,0:37:12.51,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,He was destined to have a flaw. I knew he was too perfect.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:12.59,0:37:15.03,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Telephone, honey.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:15.09,0:37:17.03,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Who is it? - It's for Sid.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:17.10,0:37:18.86,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,My dad?
Dialogue: 1,0:37:18.93,0:37:21.80,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- I don't think so. -  Take a message.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:21.87,0:37:23.80,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,No, um, I'll get it.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:27.74,0:37:30.14,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,How's she doin'?
Dialogue: 1,0:37:32.21,0:37:34.18,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:34.25,0:37:36.54,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Hello, Sidney.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:36.62,0:37:38.74,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 1,0:37:38.82,0:37:40.75,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Poor Billy-boyfriend.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:40.82,0:37:43.65,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,An innocent guy doesn't stand a chance with you.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:43.72,0:37:47.95,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Leave me alone! - Looks like you fingered the wrong guy... again.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:48.03,0:37:50.52,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Who are you? - Dewey! - Hang up, Sid.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:50.60,0:37:53.72,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't worry. You'll find out soon enough.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:53.80,0:37:56.70,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I promise.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:56.77,0:37:58.70,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:38:01.77,0:38:03.71,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- What? - What?
Dialogue: 1,0:38:09.35,0:38:11.28,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 1,0:38:21.83,0:38:25.59,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Sidney Prescott, who escaped a vicious attack last night
Dialogue: 1,0:38:25.66,0:38:27.60,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,is the daughter of Maureen Prescott...
Dialogue: 1,0:38:27.67,0:38:30.07,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,who was brutally killed last year...
Dialogue: 1,0:38:30.14,0:38:32.47,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,when convicted murderer Cotton Weary broke into their home
Dialogue: 1,0:38:32.54,0:38:35.10,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,and savagely raped and tortured the deceased.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:35.17,0:38:38.34,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Cotton Weary is currently awaiting appeal for the death sentence...
Dialogue: 1,0:38:38.41,0:38:41.57,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,handed down after the young Sidney testified against him.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:41.65,0:38:44.41,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,She was the key witness in the state's case against the...
Dialogue: 1,0:38:46.69,0:38:49.28,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,It's never gonna stop, is it?
Dialogue: 1,0:38:49.35,0:38:52.08,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Billy was released.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:52.16,0:38:56.72,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,His cellular bill was clean. He didn't make those calls.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:56.80,0:38:59.32,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,We're checkin' every cellular account in the county.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:59.40,0:39:03.80,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Any calls made to you or Casey Becker are being cross-referenced.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:03.87,0:39:06.46,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,It's gonna take some time, but we'll find him.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:06.54,0:39:09.06,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 1,0:39:25.66,0:39:28.59,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Sid, it's school. You'll be safe here.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:28.66,0:39:31.09,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,So how does it feel to be almost brutally butchered?
Dialogue: 1,0:39:31.16,0:39:34.46,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Hey, leave her alone! - People wanna know. They have a right to know.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:34.53,0:39:36.47,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,-  Leave her alone. - How does it feel?
Dialogue: 1,0:39:36.54,0:39:40.10,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,She just wants to get an education. Turn that thing off.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:40.17,0:39:42.61,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:39:42.67,0:39:45.77,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Just a sec.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:55.25,0:39:57.62,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Stop right there.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:57.69,0:39:59.99,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm not here to fight. I just need to talk.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:00.06,0:40:01.39,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Kenny, camera, now!
Dialogue: 1,0:40:01.39,0:40:02.62,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Off the record. No camera.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:02.69,0:40:05.82,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Forget it. - Please? You owe me.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:05.90,0:40:08.37,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- I owe you shit! - You owe my mother!
Dialogue: 1,0:40:10.30,0:40:13.14,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Your mother's murder was last year's hottest court case.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:13.21,0:40:15.23,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Somebody was gonna write about it.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:15.31,0:40:18.24,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,And it had to be you with all your lies and bullshit theories.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:18.31,0:40:21.11,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,What is your problem? You got what you wanted.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:21.18,0:40:22.97,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Cotton Weary's in jail.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:22.98,0:40:25.41,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,They're gonna gas him. A book is not gonna change that.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:27.85,0:40:30.69,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Do you still think he's innocent?
Dialogue: 1,0:40:30.76,0:40:33.55,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Your testimony put him away. It doesn't really matter what I think.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:33.63,0:40:37.58,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,During the trial, you did all those stories about me. You called me a liar.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:37.66,0:40:39.86,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I think you falsely identified him, yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:39.93,0:40:43.50,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Have you talked to Cotton? - Many times.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:43.63,0:40:45.46,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,And has his story changed?
Dialogue: 1,0:40:45.53,0:40:47.47,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Not one word.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:47.54,0:40:50.10,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,He admits to having sex with your mother, but that's all.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:50.17,0:40:52.44,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,He's lying. She never would've touched him.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:52.51,0:40:54.91,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,He raped her, and then he...
Dialogue: 1,0:40:54.98,0:40:57.88,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,He butchered her. Her blood was all over his coat.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:57.95,0:40:59.88,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,He was drunk that night.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:59.95,0:41:02.68,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,He left his coat at your house after your mother seduced him.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:02.75,0:41:04.18,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I saw him leave wearing it.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:04.18,0:41:06.92,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,No, you saw someone leave wearing that coat.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:06.99,0:41:12.59,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,The same someone who planted it in Cotton's car, framing him.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:12.66,0:41:16.79,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,No. Cotton murdered my mother.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:19.03,0:41:21.56,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You're not so sure anymore, are you?
Dialogue: 1,0:41:23.11,0:41:26.94,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Nice welt, sweetie. Let's go, Sid.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:27.01,0:41:28.94,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,The killer's still on the loose, isn't he?
Dialogue: 1,0:41:29.01,0:41:31.41,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Come on, Sid. - Those murders are related.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:31.48,0:41:34.28,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I mangled your face.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:34.35,0:41:37.44,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Sidney, don't go! - Just stop, all right?
Dialogue: 1,0:41:42.99,0:41:44.93,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Jesus Christ!
Dialogue: 1,0:41:44.99,0:41:48.16,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,An innocent man on death row. A killer still on the loose.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:48.23,0:41:49.67,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Kenny, tell me I'm dreaming.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:49.67,0:41:50.99,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You wanna go live?
Dialogue: 1,0:41:51.07,0:41:52.93,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Not so fast. We don't have anything concrete.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:52.93,0:41:54.33,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You can't just sit on it.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:54.40,0:41:57.50,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I know! That's why we need proof.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:57.57,0:42:01.63,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,If I'm right about this, I could save a man's life.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:01.71,0:42:05.08,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Do you know what that could do for my book sales?
Dialogue: 1,0:42:05.15,0:42:07.62,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,This is a mistake. I shouldn't be here.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:07.68,0:42:11.98,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I want you to meet me right here after class, okay, Sid?
Dialogue: 1,0:42:12.05,0:42:14.35,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:14.42,0:42:19.09,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey, I haven't seen Billy around. Is he really pissed?
Dialogue: 1,0:42:19.16,0:42:21.29,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, you mean after you branded him the Candyman?
Dialogue: 1,0:42:21.36,0:42:23.33,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- No, his heart's broken. Ow! - Stu!
Dialogue: 1,0:42:32.51,0:42:34.44,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Why are they doing this?
Dialogue: 1,0:42:34.51,0:42:37.81,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me? Look at this place. It's like Christmas.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:37.88,0:42:40.94,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Stupidity leak. - Ow. Easy.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:41.02,0:42:43.78,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Sidney!
Dialogue: 1,0:42:43.85,0:42:45.91,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Ow! - Jesus, shit!
Dialogue: 1,0:42:45.99,0:42:48.75,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,It's just me.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:48.82,0:42:52.32,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa. You still think it's me.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:52.39,0:42:54.83,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,No. No, I-I don't.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:54.90,0:42:58.33,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,It's just... somebody was there.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:58.40,0:43:00.39,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Billy, someone tried to kill me.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:00.47,0:43:02.89,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I know, I know. The cops said I scared him away.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:02.89,0:43:04.41,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,It wasn't me, Sid.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:04.47,0:43:08.88,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I know. He called me again last night at Tatum's house.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:08.94,0:43:11.74,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You see? It couldn't have been me. I was in jail.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:11.81,0:43:13.75,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Remember?
Dialogue: 1,0:43:15.15,0:43:18.59,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm so... sorry. Please understand.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:18.65,0:43:20.59,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Understand what?
Dialogue: 1,0:43:20.66,0:43:23.18,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,That I have a girlfriend who would rather accuse me...
Dialogue: 1,0:43:23.26,0:43:25.99,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,of being a psychopathic killer than touch me?
Dialogue: 1,0:43:26.06,0:43:29.19,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You know that's not true.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:29.27,0:43:32.03,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Then what is it? - What... is it?
Dialogue: 1,0:43:32.10,0:43:34.90,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Billy, I was attacked and nearly filleted last night!
Dialogue: 1,0:43:34.97,0:43:36.90,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I mean between us.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:36.97,0:43:39.77,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You haven't been the same since...
Dialogue: 1,0:43:41.31,0:43:44.04,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Since your mother died. - Is your brain leaking?
Dialogue: 1,0:43:44.11,0:43:46.60,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,My mom was killed. I can't believe you're bringing this up!
Dialogue: 1,0:43:46.68,0:43:50.91,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- It's been a year. - Tomorrow! One year tomorrow.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:50.99,0:43:52.92,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I think it's time you got over that.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:52.99,0:43:55.10,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,When my mom left my dad, I accepted it.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:55.10,0:43:56.29,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,That's the way it is.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:56.36,0:43:58.26,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,She's not coming back.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:58.33,0:44:01.42,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Your parents split up. This is not the same thing.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:01.50,0:44:02.92,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Your mom left town.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:02.92,0:44:04.47,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,She's not lying in a coffin somewhere.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:04.53,0:44:07.56,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Okay, okay, I'm sorry. It's a bad analogy.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:07.64,0:44:09.90,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,It's just that...
Dialogue: 1,0:44:09.97,0:44:12.96,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I want my girlfriend back.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:15.28,0:44:17.21,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Sid!
Dialogue: 1,0:44:17.28,0:44:19.21,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Billy, I am sorry if my traumatized life...
Dialogue: 1,0:44:19.28,0:44:22.22,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,is an inconvenience to you and your perfect existence.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:22.28,0:44:25.45,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,What? Wh... Nobody said that. Sid!
Dialogue: 1,0:44:27.19,0:44:29.12,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Stupid.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:29.19,0:44:31.35,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You make me so sick!
Dialogue: 1,0:44:31.43,0:44:35.89,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Your entire havoc-inducing, thieving, whoring generation disgusts me!
Dialogue: 1,0:44:35.97,0:44:40.40,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,So, two of your fellow students...
Dialogue: 1,0:44:40.47,0:44:42.66,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,just savagely murdered...
Dialogue: 1,0:44:42.74,0:44:45.97,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,and this is the way you show your compassion and sensitivity, huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:44:46.04,0:44:49.41,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Let me tell you something. You're both expelled! Get out!
Dialogue: 1,0:44:49.48,0:44:52.74,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Come on, Mr. Himbry! It was just a joke.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:52.82,0:44:54.75,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,That's not fair!
Dialogue: 1,0:44:57.89,0:45:00.58,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You're absolutely right. It is not fair.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:00.66,0:45:02.99,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Fairness would be to rip your insides out...
Dialogue: 1,0:45:03.06,0:45:05.19,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,hang you from a tree so we can expose you...
Dialogue: 1,0:45:05.26,0:45:08.25,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,for the heartless, desensitized little shits that you are.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:20.34,0:45:23.28,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,She was never attacked. I think she made it all up.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:23.35,0:45:25.61,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,-  Why would she lie about it? - For attention!
Dialogue: 1,0:45:25.68,0:45:27.95,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,The girl has some serious issues.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:34.06,0:45:35.99,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,What if she did it?
Dialogue: 1,0:45:36.06,0:45:38.53,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,What if Sidney killed Casey and Steve?
Dialogue: 1,0:45:38.59,0:45:40.53,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Why would she do that?
Dialogue: 1,0:45:40.60,0:45:43.90,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Maybe she had the hots for Steve and killed them both in a jealous rage.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:43.97,0:45:46.11,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,What would Sidney want with Steve?
Dialogue: 1,0:45:46.11,0:45:48.90,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,She has her own bubble-butt boyfriend.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:48.97,0:45:52.37,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Maybe she's a slut just like her mother.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:52.44,0:45:55.74,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- You're evil. - Please, it's a common fact.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:55.81,0:45:57.02,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Her mother was a tramp.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:57.02,0:45:59.75,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Cut some slack. She watched her mom get butchered.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:59.82,0:46:02.05,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,And it fucked her up royally. Think about it.
Dialogue: 1,0:46:02.12,0:46:04.71,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Her mother's death leaves her disturbed and hostile.
Dialogue: 1,0:46:04.79,0:46:08.35,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,In a cruel and inhumane world, she's delusional.
Dialogue: 1,0:46:08.42,0:46:11.39,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Where is God? Etcetera. Completely suicidal.
Dialogue: 1,0:46:11.46,0:46:14.22,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,One day she snaps. She wants to kill herself...
Dialogue: 1,0:46:14.30,0:46:17.73,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,but she realizes that teen suicide is out this year...
Dialogue: 1,0:46:17.80,0:46:21.74,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,and homicide is a much healthier, therapeutic expression.
Dialogue: 1,0:46:21.80,0:46:23.22,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Where do you get this shit?
Dialogue: 1,0:46:23.22,0:46:24.74,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Ricki Lake.
Dialogue: 1,0:46:24.81,0:46:27.94,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You are pathetic.
Dialogue: 1,0:46:40.86,0:46:43.35,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Pathetic.
Dialogue: 1,0:47:10.39,0:47:12.58,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Sidney.
Dialogue: 1,0:47:17.19,0:47:19.13,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Is someone there?
Dialogue: 1,0:47:58.80,0:48:00.73,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,In what appears to be a prank...
Dialogue: 1,0:48:00.80,0:48:03.46,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,several students were seen wearing scary masks.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:03.54,0:48:05.47,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,School officials have yet to comment...
Dialogue: 1,0:48:05.54,0:48:09.41,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,but this is known to be the same costume worn by the killer.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:09.48,0:48:11.77,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Seventeen-year-old Casey Becker and her boyfriend
Dialogue: 1,0:48:11.77,0:48:13.61,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Steven Orth have already lost their lives.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:13.68,0:48:15.62,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Who's next?
Dialogue: 1,0:48:15.68,0:48:19.52,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You can literally feel the fear on this campus.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:19.59,0:48:22.65,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Hi! Gale Weathers, field correspondent, "Top Story."
Dialogue: 1,0:48:22.72,0:48:24.66,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I know who you are, Miss Weathers.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:24.73,0:48:29.13,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- How's the eye? - It's productive. Is there a problem on campus?
Dialogue: 1,0:48:29.20,0:48:31.13,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,No, everything's under control.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:31.20,0:48:34.83,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Of course. You're here. - You're not supposed to be here.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:34.90,0:48:37.93,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I know. I should be in New York covering the Sharon Stone stalker...
Dialogue: 1,0:48:38.01,0:48:39.94,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,but who knew?
Dialogue: 1,0:48:40.01,0:48:42.50,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You look awfully young to be a police officer.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:42.58,0:48:45.17,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm 25 years old.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:45.25,0:48:47.18,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You know, in a demographic study...
Dialogue: 1,0:48:47.25,0:48:50.65,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I proved to be most popular amongst males 11 to 24.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:50.72,0:48:53.03,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Guess I just missed you.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:53.03,0:48:55.18,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Of course, you don't look a day over 12.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:55.26,0:48:57.59,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Except in that upper torso area.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:57.66,0:49:00.99,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Does the force require you to work out? - No, ma'am.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:01.06,0:49:03.00,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,'Cause of my boyish good looks...
Dialogue: 1,0:49:03.07,0:49:06.87,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,muscle mass has increased my acceptance as a serious police officer.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:06.94,0:49:09.64,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I need your attention now, kids.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:09.77,0:49:11.71,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Due to the recent events that have occurred...
Dialogue: 1,0:49:11.77,0:49:15.77,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,effective immediately, all classes are suspended until further notice.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:15.84,0:49:20.41,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,The Woodsboro police department has issued a citywide curfew...
Dialogue: 1,0:49:20.48,0:49:24.25,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,beginning at 9:00 tonight.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:24.32,0:49:26.25,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Looks like we've got a serial killer on our hands.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:26.32,0:49:28.29,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Serial killer's not really accurate.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:28.36,0:49:31.19,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Gotta knock off a couple more to get that title.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:31.26,0:49:34.29,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Well, we can hope, can't we?
Dialogue: 1,0:49:34.36,0:49:37.46,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I mean, we certainly don't have any leads.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:37.53,0:49:40.63,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Have you located Sidney's father yet? - No, not yet.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:40.70,0:49:42.84,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,He's not a suspect, is he?
Dialogue: 1,0:49:42.84,0:49:46.04,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,We haven't ruled him out as a... possibility.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:46.11,0:49:49.60,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- If you'll excuse me. - I'm sorry. Am I keeping you?
Dialogue: 1,0:49:49.68,0:49:53.44,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,If I may say so, Miss Weathers...
Dialogue: 1,0:49:53.52,0:49:57.04,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,you are much prettier in person.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:57.12,0:49:59.28,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,So you do watch the show.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:00.92,0:50:06.05,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm 25. I was 24 for a whole year.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:06.13,0:50:09.43,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Please, call me Gale!
Dialogue: 1,0:50:09.50,0:50:11.83,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,It was just some sick fuck having a laugh, Sidney.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:11.90,0:50:14.13,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,No, it was him, Tatum. I know it.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:14.20,0:50:16.25,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You're not to pee alone anymore.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:16.25,0:50:18.14,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,If you pee, I pee. Is that clear?
Dialogue: 1,0:50:20.88,0:50:22.81,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I don't know what you did, Sidney.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:22.88,0:50:24.97,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,But on behalf of the entire student body, we all say, "Thank you!"
Dialogue: 1,0:50:25.05,0:50:27.48,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Drop it, Stu. - I say...
Dialogue: 1,0:50:27.55,0:50:30.31,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,an impromptu party tonight, my house.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:30.39,0:50:32.32,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Celebrate this little siesta. What do you say?
Dialogue: 1,0:50:32.39,0:50:34.32,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 1,0:50:34.39,0:50:36.32,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,This little vixen...
Dialogue: 1,0:50:36.39,0:50:38.69,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,doesn't invite the entire world, we'll be fine.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:38.76,0:50:41.19,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Intimate gathering, intimate friends.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:41.26,0:50:43.20,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,What do you say, Sid?
Dialogue: 1,0:50:43.27,0:50:45.20,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I mean, pathos could have its perks.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:45.27,0:50:47.70,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Totally protected. Yo, I am so buff.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:47.77,0:50:49.83,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I got you covered, girl.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:49.91,0:50:53.84,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Come on, Sid. For me? It could be fun.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:54.84,0:50:57.14,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Okay. Whatever.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:57.21,0:50:59.15,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Yeah? Nice.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:59.21,0:51:01.15,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Cool. You guys bring food, all right?
Dialogue: 1,0:51:19.13,0:51:21.07,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 1,0:51:21.14,0:51:23.07,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 1,0:51:57.57,0:52:00.80,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Damn little shits. - What'd you call me? Huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:52:00.88,0:52:03.64,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Not you, Fred. -  You prick.
Dialogue: 1,0:52:54.20,0:52:57.65,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Aaaah! Aaah!
Dialogue: 1,0:52:57.73,0:52:59.86,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Ohhhhh!
Dialogue: 1,0:53:09.71,0:53:11.91,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,School's out for summer
Dialogue: 1,0:53:12.49,0:53:13.19,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,School's out
Dialogue: 1,0:53:13.19,0:53:15.42,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,What if Cotton Weary is telling the truth?
Dialogue: 1,0:53:15.49,0:53:18.69,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Maybe he was having an affair with your mom.
Dialogue: 1,0:53:18.76,0:53:22.82,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I mean, your dad was always out of town on business. Maybe...
Dialogue: 1,0:53:22.90,0:53:25.99,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Maybe your mom was just a very unhappy woman.
Dialogue: 1,0:53:26.07,0:53:27.60,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,If they were having an affair,
Dialogue: 1,0:53:27.60,0:53:30.06,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,how come Cotton couldn't prove it in court?
Dialogue: 1,0:53:30.14,0:53:32.44,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Well, you can't prove a rumor.
Dialogue: 1,0:53:32.44,0:53:34.94,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,That's why it's a rumor.
Dialogue: 1,0:53:35.01,0:53:39.07,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Right. Created by that little tabloid twit Gale Weathers.
Dialogue: 1,0:53:40.41,0:53:43.01,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,It goes further back, Sid.
Dialogue: 1,0:53:43.08,0:53:46.02,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,There's been talk about other men.
Dialogue: 1,0:53:46.09,0:53:48.58,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,And you believe it.
Dialogue: 1,0:53:48.65,0:53:54.46,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Well, you can only hear that Richard Gere gerbil story so many times...
Dialogue: 1,0:53:54.53,0:53:57.46,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,before you have to start believing it.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:01.30,0:54:03.39,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:05.97,0:54:08.91,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Y-You know, if I was wrong about Cotton Weary
Dialogue: 1,0:54:08.97,0:54:10.91,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,then... the killer's still out there.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:10.98,0:54:12.91,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't go there, Sid.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:12.98,0:54:16.11,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You're starting to sound like some Wes Carpenter flick or something.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:16.18,0:54:20.12,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't freak yourself, okay? We've got a long night ahead of us. Okay?
Dialogue: 1,0:54:21.19,0:54:23.12,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Let's boogie.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:26.79,0:54:28.73,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,It's alive!
Dialogue: 1,0:54:28.79,0:54:32.73,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Henry   - Oh, in the name of God, now I know
Dialogue: 1,0:54:32.80,0:54:34.73,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Excuse me, dude.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:36.50,0:54:38.44,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Watch it, jerk. - I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:40.84,0:54:42.77,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Ohhhh!
Dialogue: 1,0:54:42.84,0:54:45.21,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Dork.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:45.28,0:54:48.21,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Jesus, this place is packed tonight, man.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:48.28,0:54:50.39,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,We had a run in the mass murder section.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:50.39,0:54:51.72,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Comin' to my fiesta?
Dialogue: 1,0:54:51.78,0:54:54.31,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm off early. Curfew, you know.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:54.39,0:54:57.32,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,What's that werewolf movie with E.T.'s mom in it?
Dialogue: 1,0:54:57.39,0:54:59.47,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,"The Howling." Horror. Straight ahead.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:59.47,0:55:00.45,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Okay, thanks.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:02.03,0:55:04.79,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, now that's in poor taste.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:04.79,0:55:05.66,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:55:05.73,0:55:09.67,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,If you were the only suspect in a senseless bloodbath
Dialogue: 1,0:55:09.74,0:55:12.32,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,would you be standing in the horror section?
Dialogue: 1,0:55:12.37,0:55:16.27,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,What? It was just a misunderstanding. He didn't do anything.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:16.34,0:55:18.28,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You're such a little lapdog.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:18.34,0:55:21.09,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,He's got "killer" printed all over his forehead.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:21.09,0:55:21.80,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Ohhh-kay!
Dialogue: 1,0:55:21.88,0:55:25.58,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Really? Well, why'd the cops let him go, smart guy?
Dialogue: 1,0:55:25.65,0:55:29.75,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Obviously they don't watch enough movies. This is standard horror movie stuff.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:29.82,0:55:32.01,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,"Prom Night" revisited, man.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:32.02,0:55:34.45,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Yeah? Why would he wanna kill his own girlfriend?
Dialogue: 1,0:55:34.53,0:55:37.59,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,There's always some stupid, bullshit reason to kill your girlfriend.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:37.66,0:55:41.22,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Oh? - That's the beauty of it all: simplicity.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:41.30,0:55:44.96,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Besides, if it gets too complicated, you lose your target audience.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:45.04,0:55:47.10,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Well, what's his reason?
Dialogue: 1,0:55:47.17,0:55:49.64,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Maybe Sidney wouldn't have sex with him.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:49.71,0:55:52.39,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,, What, is she savin' herself for you?
Dialogue: 1,0:55:52.39,0:55:53.20,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Maybe.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:53.28,0:55:57.94,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Now that Billy tried to mutilate her, do you think Sid would go out with me?
Dialogue: 1,0:56:03.45,0:56:05.82,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,No, I don't at all. No.
Dialogue: 1,0:56:05.89,0:56:09.26,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You know who I think it is?
Dialogue: 1,0:56:09.33,0:56:11.96,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You know, I think it's her father.
Dialogue: 1,0:56:12.03,0:56:14.46,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Why can't they find her pops, man?
Dialogue: 1,0:56:14.53,0:56:16.63,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Because he's probably dead.
Dialogue: 1,0:56:16.70,0:56:20.26,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,His body will come poppin' up in the last reel somewhere!
Dialogue: 1,0:56:20.34,0:56:24.24,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Eyes gouged out, fingers cut off, teeth knocked out!
Dialogue: 1,0:56:24.31,0:56:27.04,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- The police are always off track with this shit. - Man!
Dialogue: 1,0:56:27.11,0:56:28.50,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,If they'd watch "Prom Night,"
Dialogue: 1,0:56:28.50,0:56:29.55,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,they'd save time.
Dialogue: 1,0:56:29.61,0:56:31.59,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,There's a formula to it. A very simple formula!
Dialogue: 1,0:56:31.59,0:56:33.57,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Everybody's a suspect!
Dialogue: 1,0:56:37.92,0:56:42.33,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, the dad's a red herring. It's Billy.
Dialogue: 1,0:56:43.90,0:56:46.83,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,How do we know you're not the killer? Huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:56:46.90,0:56:49.42,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Huh? - Hi, Billy.
Dialogue: 1,0:56:49.50,0:56:50.97,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Maybe your movie-freaked mind lost its reality button.
Dialogue: 1,0:56:50.97,0:56:52.87,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You ever think of that?
Dialogue: 1,0:56:52.94,0:56:55.87,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You're absolutely right. I'm the first to admit it.
Dialogue: 1,0:56:55.94,0:56:58.57,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,If this were a scary movie, l'd be the prime suspect.
Dialogue: 1,0:56:58.58,0:56:59.38,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 1,0:56:59.44,0:57:01.38,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,And what would be your motive?
Dialogue: 1,0:57:01.45,0:57:03.61,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,It's the millennium.
Dialogue: 1,0:57:03.68,0:57:05.62,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Motives are incidental.
Dialogue: 1,0:57:05.68,0:57:07.67,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,"Millennium". Hmm.
Dialogue: 1,0:57:07.75,0:57:09.32,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,"Millennium". I like that. That's good. It's the millennium.
Dialogue: 1,0:57:09.32,0:57:12.05,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,"Millennium". I like that. That's good. It's the millennium.
Dialogue: 1,0:57:13.16,0:57:15.09,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Good kid.
Dialogue: 1,0:57:16.23,0:57:19.36,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,"Millennium". Good word, my man.
Dialogue: 1,0:57:19.43,0:57:21.40,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Are you telling me that's not a killer?
Dialogue: 1,0:58:06.14,0:58:08.08,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Sure is quiet.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:08.15,0:58:10.08,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,God, look at this place.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:10.15,0:58:12.51,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,It's "The Town That Dreaded Sundown."
Dialogue: 1,0:58:12.58,0:58:13.86,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Yeah, I saw that movie.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:13.86,0:58:16.02,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,It's about a killer in Texas, huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:58:16.09,0:58:18.02,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Mmm. - Hey, Sid, just think.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:18.09,0:58:21.03,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,If they make a movie about you, who's gonna play you?
Dialogue: 1,0:58:21.09,0:58:22.51,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I shudder to think.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:22.51,0:58:24.69,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I see you as a young Meg Ryan myself.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:24.76,0:58:26.48,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Thanks, Dewey. With my luck,
Dialogue: 1,0:58:26.48,0:58:28.20,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,they'd cast Tori Spelling.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:28.27,0:58:31.20,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm just gonna be a few minutes.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:31.27,0:58:33.20,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You girls don't go too far.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:35.71,0:58:37.64,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Is Billy gonna be there tonight?
Dialogue: 1,0:58:37.71,0:58:40.77,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,He'd better not be. I told Stu to keep his mouth shut.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:40.85,0:58:43.78,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I think we can live without the endorphin rush for one night.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:45.45,0:58:48.89,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Billy's right, you know. Whenever he touches me, I just can't relax.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:48.95,0:58:52.55,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,So you have a few intimacy issues as a result of your mother's untimely death.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:52.62,0:58:55.12,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,That's no big deal. You'll thaw out.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:55.19,0:58:58.63,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Yeah, but he has been so patient with me with all the sex stuff.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:58.70,0:59:02.36,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,How many guys would put up with a girlfriend who's sexually anorexic?
Dialogue: 1,0:59:02.43,0:59:05.37,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Billy and his penis don't deserve you, all right?
Dialogue: 1,0:59:13.81,0:59:15.75,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Dewey, where the hell you been?
Dialogue: 1,0:59:15.81,0:59:18.75,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I was keepin' an eye on Sidney, uh...
Dialogue: 1,0:59:20.09,0:59:24.68,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Thought you quit. - I did. But damn it...
Dialogue: 1,0:59:24.76,0:59:28.06,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Dewey, Vital Phone just faxed us.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:28.13,0:59:30.47,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Those calls are listed to Neil Prescott,
Dialogue: 1,0:59:30.48,0:59:32.53,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Sidney's father.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:32.60,0:59:36.23,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,He made the calls with a cellular phone. It's been confirmed.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:37.50,0:59:40.44,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,There's no way a cellular coulda been cloned?
Dialogue: 1,0:59:40.51,0:59:43.27,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,There's more. Guess what tomorrow is.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:43.34,0:59:45.87,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,The anniversary of his wife's death.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:48.78,0:59:51.72,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,We'll keep the roadblocks and the curfew in effect through the night.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:51.78,0:59:55.08,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,If he's not picked up by morning, then we'll do a house-to-house.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:56.22,0:59:58.16,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Where's Sidney? - She's with my sister.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:58.22,1:00:01.75,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- You want me to bring her in? - Naw.
Dialogue: 1,1:00:01.83,1:00:03.76,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Not just yet.
Dialogue: 1,1:00:03.83,1:00:07.27,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Let's find Neil first, make sure he's our man.
Dialogue: 1,1:00:14.61,1:00:17.20,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You stay close to Sidney.
Dialogue: 1,1:00:17.28,1:00:19.87,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't let her out of your sight.
Dialogue: 1,1:00:19.95,1:00:22.21,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 1,1:00:56.92,1:00:59.15,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,All right, you girls have fun.
Dialogue: 1,1:00:59.22,1:01:02.15,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Not too much fun, or I'll bust ya.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:03.42,1:01:05.36,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Bye. - Bye, Sid.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:18.14,1:01:20.07,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Here, kids!
Dialogue: 1,1:01:22.47,1:01:24.41,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh! That's absurd.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:24.48,1:01:27.41,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You guys were tardy for the party, so we started without you.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:27.48,1:01:29.45,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,My man!
Dialogue: 1,1:01:44.16,1:01:46.10,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Shh.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:47.30,1:01:49.23,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Were we spotted?
Dialogue: 1,1:01:49.30,1:01:52.24,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I don't think so. Go get the camera.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:54.77,1:01:57.11,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I didn't mean to scare ya.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:57.18,1:02:00.37,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Deputy, that's okay. - What brings you to these parts?
Dialogue: 1,1:02:00.45,1:02:04.58,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Well, you just never know when or where a story will break.
Dialogue: 1,1:02:04.65,1:02:08.71,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Not much of a story here. Just a bunch of kids cuttin' it loose.
Dialogue: 1,1:02:08.79,1:02:11.52,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Then what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 1,1:02:14.13,1:02:16.56,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Just keepin' an eye on things.
Dialogue: 1,1:02:16.63,1:02:19.56,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm gonna check the party out.
Dialogue: 1,1:02:19.63,1:02:23.07,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Do you mind if I join you? - Not at all.
Dialogue: 1,1:02:24.14,1:02:27.43,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Let me just get my coat. Thanks.
Dialogue: 1,1:02:32.64,1:02:35.61,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- All right. - Yeah, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 1,1:02:35.68,1:02:37.61,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh! Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,1:02:39.78,1:02:42.72,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- How many "Evil Deads"? - One! Two!
Dialogue: 1,1:02:42.79,1:02:45.09,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- How many "Hellraisers"? - Hellraiser right here.
Dialogue: 1,1:02:45.16,1:02:48.59,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,"The Fog," "Terror Train," "Prom Night."
Dialogue: 1,1:02:48.66,1:02:52.10,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,How come Jamie Lee Curtis is in all of these movies?
Dialogue: 1,1:02:52.16,1:02:54.69,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,She's the... scream queen.
Dialogue: 1,1:02:54.77,1:02:57.96,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- With a set of lungs like that, she should be. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,1:02:58.04,1:02:59.59,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Tits. See?
Dialogue: 1,1:02:59.67,1:03:01.61,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, I'll get it.
Dialogue: 1,1:03:03.17,1:03:05.61,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey, Tate, grab another beer, would ya?
Dialogue: 1,1:03:05.68,1:03:08.08,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,There's more beer in the garage.
Dialogue: 1,1:03:08.15,1:03:10.08,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,What am l, the beer wench?
Dialogue: 1,1:03:10.15,1:03:13.08,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- She was nominated for "Terror Train." - Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 1,1:03:13.15,1:03:16.09,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You are not gonna believe who's here! It's that chick from "Top Story"!
Dialogue: 1,1:03:16.15,1:03:18.05,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Gale Weathers? - Here. Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,1:03:20.99,1:03:22.93,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You're under age, son.
Dialogue: 1,1:03:22.99,1:03:24.93,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm kiddin'. Have a good time.
Dialogue: 1,1:03:25.00,1:03:26.79,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,-  Dewey. - Hi.
Dialogue: 1,1:03:26.87,1:03:29.93,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Dewey.
Dialogue: 1,1:03:30.00,1:03:33.10,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- What is she doing here? - She's with me!
Dialogue: 1,1:03:33.17,1:03:35.57,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- I'm just checkin' things out. - So you did.
Dialogue: 1,1:03:35.64,1:03:40.01,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Now leave, and take your media mouth with you.
Dialogue: 1,1:03:41.51,1:03:44.28,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- I just think you're awesome. - Oh, thank you very much.
Dialogue: 1,1:03:44.35,1:03:46.28,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- I watch your show religiously. - That's great.
Dialogue: 1,1:03:46.35,1:03:48.75,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Hey. - Hey.
Dialogue: 1,1:03:48.82,1:03:51.41,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I need a camera
Dialogue: 1,1:03:51.49,1:03:54.75,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Have you found my father? - I'm afraid not.
Dialogue: 1,1:03:56.53,1:03:58.96,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,-  Should I be worried? -  Not yet.
Dialogue: 1,1:04:01.07,1:04:04.56,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,That's the one I want... "Halloween."
Dialogue: 1,1:04:25.12,1:04:27.15,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Mmm.
Dialogue: 1,1:04:48.11,1:04:50.74,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Jesus!
Dialogue: 1,1:04:53.12,1:04:55.71,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Tatum, it's okay.
Dialogue: 1,1:05:05.50,1:05:07.43,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Shit.
Dialogue: 1,1:05:11.94,1:05:13.87,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey, shitheads!
Dialogue: 1,1:05:15.44,1:05:17.37,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 1,1:05:18.71,1:05:21.70,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Shit. Piss.
Dialogue: 1,1:05:38.96,1:05:40.59,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Is that you, Randy?
Dialogue: 1,1:05:43.17,1:05:45.20,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Cute. What movie is this from?
Dialogue: 1,1:05:45.20,1:05:46.60,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,"I Spit On Your Garage"?
Dialogue: 1,1:05:48.01,1:05:51.34,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Lose the outfit. If Sidney sees it, she'll flip.
Dialogue: 1,1:05:51.41,1:05:54.34,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, you wanna play psycho killer?
Dialogue: 1,1:05:54.41,1:05:57.11,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Can I be the helpless victim?
Dialogue: 1,1:05:57.18,1:06:00.62,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Okay, let's see... No, please don't kill me, Mr. Ghost Face.
Dialogue: 1,1:06:00.69,1:06:03.21,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I wanna be in the sequel!
Dialogue: 1,1:06:04.59,1:06:07.85,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Cut, Casper. That's a wrap.
Dialogue: 1,1:06:09.69,1:06:13.06,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Randy, what the hell are you doing? Aaah!
Dialogue: 1,1:06:19.38,1:06:21.17,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Aaaah!
Dialogue: 1,1:06:27.38,1:06:30.01,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Fucker!
Dialogue: 1,1:06:30.09,1:06:32.18,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Aaah!
Dialogue: 1,1:06:50.31,1:06:59.70,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Aaah! Aaaah!
Dialogue: 1,1:07:10.11,1:07:13.17,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Happy curfew. - Nice party, Stu.
Dialogue: 1,1:07:13.24,1:07:14.12,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Tatum, come on!
Dialogue: 1,1:07:14.12,1:07:16.18,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,There's nobody here but us chickens!
Dialogue: 1,1:07:16.25,1:07:17.52,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Do you know where she is?
Dialogue: 1,1:07:17.52,1:07:19.21,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,, No, I haven't seen her.
Dialogue: 1,1:07:19.28,1:07:21.15,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Aaah!
Dialogue: 1,1:07:21.22,1:07:23.78,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh. Billy. Hey.
Dialogue: 1,1:07:23.85,1:07:25.79,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Billy. Hmm. What are you doin' here?
Dialogue: 1,1:07:25.85,1:07:28.65,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I was hoping I could talk to Sid alone.
Dialogue: 1,1:07:28.72,1:07:31.89,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You know, if Tatum sees you here, she'll draw blood.
Dialogue: 1,1:07:31.96,1:07:34.90,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Why don't you go up to my parents' room?
Dialogue: 1,1:07:34.96,1:07:38.40,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You know, you guys can talk, whatever.
Dialogue: 1,1:07:38.47,1:07:40.90,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Subtlety, Stu. You should look it up.
Dialogue: 1,1:07:42.04,1:07:45.01,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,No, i-it's okay. We do need to talk.
Dialogue: 1,1:07:47.31,1:07:49.30,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Oooh! Oww.
Dialogue: 1,1:07:54.48,1:07:56.42,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,What's Leatherface doin' here?
Dialogue: 1,1:07:56.49,1:07:59.08,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Cute. He came to make up.
Dialogue: 1,1:07:59.15,1:08:02.09,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,There goes my chance with Sid. Damn it.
Dialogue: 1,1:08:02.16,1:08:04.25,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,As if. That's all I'm sayin'.
Dialogue: 1,1:08:04.33,1:08:06.26,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,As if.
Dialogue: 1,1:08:06.33,1:08:08.26,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, really, Alicia?
Dialogue: 1,1:08:09.33,1:08:12.20,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,"As if." I'm gonna go check on them.
Dialogue: 1,1:08:12.27,1:08:15.26,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Come on! -  It was nice to meet all of you.
Dialogue: 1,1:08:18.57,1:08:20.84,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You're a genius.
Dialogue: 1,1:08:20.91,1:08:23.17,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Oh, shit. - What?
Dialogue: 1,1:08:23.25,1:08:25.68,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- I got a delay. -  How long is it?
Dialogue: 1,1:08:25.75,1:08:29.68,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I don't know. What'd it take you to walk from the house, 30 seconds?
Dialogue: 1,1:08:29.75,1:08:33.19,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,It'll be fine. Just record it. Oh, the placement is perfect.
Dialogue: 1,1:08:33.26,1:08:34.69,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Tell me, Kenneth... - Hmm?
Dialogue: 1,1:08:34.76,1:08:38.19,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Has a cheesy tabloid journalist ever won the Pulitzer?
Dialogue: 1,1:08:38.26,1:08:40.46,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Well, first time for everything.
Dialogue: 1,1:08:40.53,1:08:42.46,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You're damn right.
Dialogue: 1,1:08:49.04,1:08:50.97,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,S-So, um...
Dialogue: 1,1:08:53.04,1:08:54.98,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 1,1:08:57.95,1:08:59.88,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 1,1:09:01.05,1:09:04.99,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I've been selfish, and I want to apologize.
Dialogue: 1,1:09:05.05,1:09:08.22,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,No, Billy, I-I'm...
Dialogue: 1,1:09:08.29,1:09:11.85,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,the one who's been selfish and self-absorbed...
Dialogue: 1,1:09:11.93,1:09:14.73,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,with all this post-traumatic stress.
Dialogue: 1,1:09:16.07,1:09:20.06,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- You lost your mom. - Yeah, I know, but you're right.
Dialogue: 1,1:09:20.14,1:09:22.07,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Enough is enough.
Dialogue: 1,1:09:22.14,1:09:25.07,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I can't wallow in the grief process forever...
Dialogue: 1,1:09:25.14,1:09:27.07,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,and...
Dialogue: 1,1:09:28.64,1:09:30.58,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,and I can't...
Dialogue: 1,1:09:30.65,1:09:34.88,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,keep lying to myself about who my mom was.
Dialogue: 1,1:09:38.69,1:09:40.45,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Yeah, I think I'm really...
Dialogue: 1,1:09:43.03,1:09:45.29,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,scared...
Dialogue: 1,1:09:45.36,1:09:48.80,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,that I'm gonna turn out just like her, you know?
Dialogue: 1,1:09:49.93,1:09:53.42,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Like "The Bad Seed" or somethin'.
Dialogue: 1,1:09:53.50,1:09:56.47,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,And I know it doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 1,1:09:57.61,1:09:59.54,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Yeah, it does.
Dialogue: 1,1:10:01.48,1:10:03.41,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 1,1:10:03.48,1:10:06.92,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,It's like Jodie Foster in "The Silence of the Lambs"...
Dialogue: 1,1:10:06.98,1:10:10.92,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,when she keeps having flashbacks of her dead father.
Dialogue: 1,1:10:10.99,1:10:13.08,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,But this is life.
Dialogue: 1,1:10:13.16,1:10:15.09,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,This isn't a movie.
Dialogue: 1,1:10:15.16,1:10:17.68,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Sure it is, Sid.
Dialogue: 1,1:10:17.76,1:10:19.69,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,It's all... It's all a movie.
Dialogue: 1,1:10:19.76,1:10:21.70,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,It's all...
Dialogue: 1,1:10:21.76,1:10:23.70,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,one great big movie.
Dialogue: 1,1:10:30.21,1:10:32.64,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Only you can't pick your genre.
Dialogue: 1,1:10:58.63,1:11:01.66,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Why can't I be a Meg Ryan movie?
Dialogue: 1,1:11:04.71,1:11:07.70,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Or even a good porno.
Dialogue: 1,1:11:10.25,1:11:12.18,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,1:11:12.25,1:11:14.18,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You heard me.
Dialogue: 1,1:11:22.19,1:11:24.13,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 1,1:11:26.20,1:11:28.13,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,1:11:28.20,1:11:30.13,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I think so.
Dialogue: 1,1:11:46.95,1:11:49.04,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Look, look, look. Here it comes.
Dialogue: 1,1:11:49.12,1:11:51.05,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Whoa! - Ohh!
Dialogue: 1,1:11:51.12,1:11:52.85,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,The blood is all wrong!
Dialogue: 1,1:11:52.85,1:11:55.06,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Why do they do that? It's too red!
Dialogue: 1,1:11:55.12,1:11:57.09,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Wait. Here comes another.
Dialogue: 1,1:11:59.00,1:12:00.93,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Oooh! Oooh! - Yes! Yes!
Dialogue: 1,1:12:01.00,1:12:03.43,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Predictable. I knew he was gonna bite it.
Dialogue: 1,1:12:03.50,1:12:05.91,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,How can you watch this shit over and over?
Dialogue: 1,1:12:05.91,1:12:06.43,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Shh!
Dialogue: 1,1:12:06.50,1:12:08.94,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I wanna see Jamie Lee's breasts.
Dialogue: 1,1:12:09.01,1:12:10.99,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,When do we see Jamie Lee's breasts?
Dialogue: 1,1:12:10.99,1:12:11.44,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Breasts?
Dialogue: 1,1:12:11.51,1:12:13.87,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Not until "Trading Places" in '83.
Dialogue: 1,1:12:13.94,1:12:16.38,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Jamie Lee was always the virgin in horror movies.
Dialogue: 1,1:12:16.45,1:12:18.32,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,She never showed her tits 'til she went legits.
Dialogue: 1,1:12:18.32,1:12:20.54,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Could afford a decent pair.
Dialogue: 1,1:12:20.62,1:12:25.02,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,That's why she always outsmarted the killer in the big chase scene at the end.
Dialogue: 1,1:12:25.09,1:12:28.02,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Only virgins can do that. Don't you know the rules?
Dialogue: 1,1:12:28.09,1:12:30.03,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- What rules? - You don't...
Dialogue: 1,1:12:32.20,1:12:34.72,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Jesus Christ. You don't know the rules?
Dialogue: 1,1:12:34.80,1:12:36.86,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Have an aneurysm, why don't ya?
Dialogue: 1,1:12:36.93,1:12:39.87,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,There are certain rules one must abide by...
Dialogue: 1,1:12:39.94,1:12:42.80,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,in order to successfully survive a horror movie.
Dialogue: 1,1:12:42.87,1:12:45.90,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,For instance, number one: You can never have sex.
Dialogue: 1,1:12:48.01,1:12:50.27,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Big no-no! Big no-no!
Dialogue: 1,1:12:50.35,1:12:52.14,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,l'd be a dead man.
Dialogue: 1,1:12:52.22,1:12:54.15,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Sex equals death. Okay?
Dialogue: 1,1:12:54.22,1:12:57.31,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Number two: You can never drink or do drugs.
Dialogue: 1,1:13:00.22,1:13:02.16,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,No, the sin factor.
Dialogue: 1,1:13:02.23,1:13:05.16,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,It's a sin. It's an extension of number one.
Dialogue: 1,1:13:05.23,1:13:08.93,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,And number three: Never, ever, ever under any circumstances, say...
Dialogue: 1,1:13:09.00,1:13:10.93,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,"I'll be right back",  'cause you won't be back.
Dialogue: 1,1:13:11.00,1:13:13.05,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm gettin' another beer. You want one?
Dialogue: 1,1:13:13.05,1:13:13.76,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 1,1:13:13.84,1:13:16.27,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- I'll be right back! - Ohhhh!
Dialogue: 1,1:13:18.64,1:13:20.13,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You push the laws and you end up dead.
Dialogue: 1,1:13:20.13,1:13:22.48,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,See you in the kitchen with a knife.
Dialogue: 1,1:13:22.55,1:13:25.98,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Only virgins can outsmart the killer in the big chase scene at the end.
Dialogue: 1,1:13:26.05,1:13:28.52,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Don't you know the rules? - What rules?
Dialogue: 1,1:13:28.58,1:13:30.52,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You don't know the rules?
Dialogue: 1,1:13:30.59,1:13:34.22,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,There are rules one must abide by to survive a horror movie.
Dialogue: 1,1:13:34.22,1:13:34.78,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Boring.
Dialogue: 1,1:13:34.86,1:13:36.79,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,For instance
Dialogue: 1,1:13:38.06,1:13:39.99,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,The sheriff just radioed.
Dialogue: 1,1:13:40.06,1:13:42.86,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Somebody reported a car in the bushes down the road.
Dialogue: 1,1:13:42.86,1:13:43.76,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go check it out.
Dialogue: 1,1:13:43.83,1:13:46.77,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Would you care to join me? - I'd love to.
Dialogue: 1,1:13:46.84,1:13:48.96,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,If you're sure it's all right.
Dialogue: 1,1:13:49.04,1:13:52.87,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Uh, ma'am, I'm the deputy of this town.
Dialogue: 1,1:13:54.38,1:13:56.31,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Be right back.
Dialogue: 1,1:13:59.82,1:14:02.01,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You push the laws, you end up dead.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:02.08,1:14:05.02,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- W... Excuse me, ma'am. - Mm-hmm?
Dialogue: 1,1:14:05.09,1:14:07.02,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I thought maybe we'd walk.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:08.29,1:14:12.13,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,It's such a nice night out. I got a flashlight.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:14.43,1:14:16.73,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You're not scared, are ya?
Dialogue: 1,1:14:16.80,1:14:18.70,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:18.77,1:14:21.29,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- All right. - Great.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:25.11,1:14:28.54,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Do you know what that constellation is? - No. What is it?
Dialogue: 1,1:14:28.61,1:14:32.91,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I don't know. That's why I was askin' you
Dialogue: 1,1:14:36.15,1:14:38.09,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,What happened to Tatum, Stu?
Dialogue: 1,1:14:38.15,1:14:41.02,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,She probably got pissed at me and bailed. Bye.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:43.09,1:14:45.03,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,No, I'm just kidding.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:01.58,1:15:04.57,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Look! Here comes the obligatory tit shot!
Dialogue: 1,1:15:08.25,1:15:10.19,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Yes! Oh! Beautiful! - Lovely!
Dialogue: 1,1:15:10.25,1:15:12.19,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Ohh! Ohh.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:12.26,1:15:14.95,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Oh, my God. - I'll leave you guys alone.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:16.03,1:15:17.96,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You are so...
Dialogue: 1,1:15:19.53,1:15:21.46,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,amazing.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:27.67,1:15:30.37,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Hello? Yeah?
Dialogue: 1,1:15:34.71,1:15:36.64,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Holy shit.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:40.22,1:15:42.08,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Listen up.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:42.15,1:15:43.98,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,They found Principal Himbry dead.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:44.20,1:15:47.46,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Hey. Hey. - To arms! To arms!
Dialogue: 1,1:15:47.53,1:15:50.47,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Where did he say he was? - At the football field!
Dialogue: 1,1:15:50.53,1:15:53.77,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Come on! - Where you guys goin'?
Dialogue: 1,1:15:53.84,1:15:57.27,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,We were just gettin' to the good part.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:57.34,1:16:00.80,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Hello? Yeah?
Dialogue: 1,1:16:11.89,1:16:14.12,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Whoo!
Dialogue: 1,1:16:23.07,1:16:26.13,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Hi-ho, Silver! Let's go!
Dialogue: 1,1:16:26.20,1:16:29.33,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,So, is... is Dewey your real name?
Dialogue: 1,1:16:29.41,1:16:31.34,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,No, it's Dwight.
Dialogue: 1,1:16:31.41,1:16:33.34,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Dwight?
Dialogue: 1,1:16:33.41,1:16:35.68,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- I'm sorry. - No, that's all right.
Dialogue: 1,1:16:35.75,1:16:39.51,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Dewey's just somethin' I got stuck with a long time ago.
Dialogue: 1,1:16:39.58,1:16:42.02,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Well, I like it.
Dialogue: 1,1:16:42.09,1:16:44.02,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Sexy.
Dialogue: 1,1:16:44.09,1:16:46.78,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Sexy? - Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 1,1:16:46.86,1:16:50.29,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Ah, it's just this town's way of not takin' me serious.
Dialogue: 1,1:16:50.36,1:16:52.80,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,What about Gale Weathers?
Dialogue: 1,1:16:52.86,1:16:55.96,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Sounds like I'm a meteorologist or something.
Dialogue: 1,1:16:57.20,1:16:59.14,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,People treat me...
Dialogue: 1,1:16:59.20,1:17:01.60,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,like I'm the antichrist of television journalism.
Dialogue: 1,1:17:01.67,1:17:03.61,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- I don't think you're that bad. - No?
Dialogue: 1,1:17:03.67,1:17:05.61,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- No? - No.
Dialogue: 1,1:17:05.68,1:17:07.61,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,That's just 'cause you kinda like me.
Dialogue: 1,1:17:07.68,1:17:10.41,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,They sure are comin' fast. Slow down!
Dialogue: 1,1:17:10.48,1:17:14.18,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Freeze... Jump!
Dialogue: 1,1:17:16.25,1:17:18.19,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. Are you okay?
Dialogue: 1,1:17:18.26,1:17:20.19,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,1:17:31.94,1:17:33.80,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 1,1:17:33.87,1:17:35.81,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm on duty.
Dialogue: 1,1:17:43.18,1:17:46.12,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Is that what you're looking for?
Dialogue: 1,1:17:46.18,1:17:48.12,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,My whole life.
Dialogue: 1,1:17:53.19,1:17:55.12,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Damn! - What?
Dialogue: 1,1:17:55.19,1:17:58.13,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- What is it? - This is Neil Prescott's car.
Dialogue: 1,1:17:58.20,1:18:00.13,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Sidney's father? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,1:18:01.47,1:18:03.40,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Jesus. What's he doing here?
Dialogue: 1,1:18:04.87,1:18:07.27,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,We gotta get back.
Dialogue: 1,1:18:10.41,1:18:12.34,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 1,1:18:13.94,1:18:15.88,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,1:18:15.95,1:18:17.88,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm fine
Dialogue: 1,1:18:28.56,1:18:30.69,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Who'd you call?
Dialogue: 1,1:18:30.76,1:18:32.63,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,1:18:32.70,1:18:36.63,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Um, well, I don't know, when you're arrested you're allowed one phone call.
Dialogue: 1,1:18:36.70,1:18:39.64,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,So I was just curious. Who'd you call?
Dialogue: 1,1:18:41.17,1:18:43.11,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Called my dad.
Dialogue: 1,1:18:45.18,1:18:48.77,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,No, um, Sheriff Burke called your dad. I saw him.
Dialogue: 1,1:18:50.92,1:18:54.98,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Yeah, but when I called I didn't get an answer.
Dialogue: 1,1:18:59.56,1:19:01.49,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 1,1:19:06.10,1:19:09.19,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You don't still think it was me, do ya?
Dialogue: 1,1:19:12.60,1:19:14.57,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 1,1:19:14.64,1:19:16.57,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 1,1:19:16.64,1:19:17.66,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I was just thinking,
Dialogue: 1,1:19:17.66,1:19:21.74,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,if it were you it'd be a very clever way to throw me off track.
Dialogue: 1,1:19:21.81,1:19:26.48,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You know, using your one phone call to call me so I wouldn't think it was you.
Dialogue: 1,1:19:26.55,1:19:28.81,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Really.
Dialogue: 1,1:19:36.66,1:19:41.19,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,What do I have to do to prove to you that I'm not a killer?
Dialogue: 1,1:19:42.70,1:19:45.36,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Oh, my God. - Huh?
Dialogue: 1,1:19:46.60,1:19:48.94,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Oh, my God. - Sidney - Billy, watch out!
Dialogue: 1,1:19:50.01,1:19:51.41,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Aaah! - Aaaah!
Dialogue: 1,1:19:55.95,1:19:58.04,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Sid.
Dialogue: 1,1:20:29.39,1:20:32.65,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 1,1:20:36.36,1:20:40.06,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Help me, somebody! Help me!
Dialogue: 1,1:20:58.72,1:21:00.95,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 1,1:21:30.12,1:21:33.98,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,No, Jamie. Uh, watch out.
Dialogue: 1,1:21:34.05,1:21:37.32,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Watch out, Jamie. You know he's around.
Dialogue: 1,1:21:37.39,1:21:40.36,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You... You know...
Dialogue: 1,1:21:40.43,1:21:42.92,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Look, there he is. I told you.
Dialogue: 1,1:21:43.00,1:21:45.38,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I told you he was right around the corner.
Dialogue: 1,1:21:45.43,1:21:47.42,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Jamie. Jamie.
Dialogue: 1,1:21:48.87,1:21:52.57,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Jamie, look behind you. Look behind you.
Dialogue: 1,1:21:52.64,1:21:55.23,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Turn around. Behind you.
Dialogue: 1,1:21:55.31,1:21:58.87,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,All the time! Behind you!
Dialogue: 1,1:21:58.95,1:22:01.24,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Behind you, Jamie.
Dialogue: 1,1:22:01.31,1:22:06.25,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Jamie, turn around. Ohh! God! Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,1:22:06.32,1:22:09.08,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Help me! Help!
Dialogue: 1,1:22:20.70,1:22:24.03,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Let me in!
Dialogue: 1,1:22:24.10,1:22:27.83,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- The killer's coming after me! He's in the house! - Where? Wait.
Dialogue: 1,1:22:27.91,1:22:31.40,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- There's a camera in the house. Look. - Behind you!
Dialogue: 1,1:22:31.48,1:22:33.34,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Oh, my God. No. - Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 1,1:22:33.41,1:22:35.61,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Jamie. Jamie.
Dialogue: 1,1:22:35.68,1:22:38.34,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Behind you, kid! - Randy!
Dialogue: 1,1:22:38.42,1:22:41.18,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Behind ya! -  Look around!
Dialogue: 1,1:22:43.06,1:22:45.46,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Shit. - What?
Dialogue: 1,1:22:45.52,1:22:47.99,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- We're on 30-second delay. - Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 1,1:22:49.56,1:22:51.29,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Aaaah!
Dialogue: 1,1:22:55.37,1:22:57.60,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,The... door.
Dialogue: 1,1:23:01.54,1:23:04.34,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Aaah!
Dialogue: 1,1:23:41.25,1:23:44.77,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Is there a phone in the van? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,1:23:44.85,1:23:48.38,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Lock yourself in it. Call the sheriff for backup.
Dialogue: 1,1:23:49.89,1:23:51.82,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Be careful!
Dialogue: 1,1:24:04.97,1:24:08.84,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Neil?
Dialogue: 1,1:24:12.41,1:24:14.35,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Mr. Prescott?
Dialogue: 1,1:24:16.48,1:24:18.42,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 1,1:24:26.43,1:24:29.45,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 1,1:24:34.83,1:24:37.20,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Kenny, I need the cellular!
Dialogue: 1,1:24:39.44,1:24:41.37,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Kenny!
Dialogue: 1,1:24:43.11,1:24:46.48,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Kenny! -  Kenny! Kenny!
Dialogue: 1,1:25:06.77,1:25:10.39,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,9-1-1.
Dialogue: 1,1:25:10.47,1:25:13.34,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- What's going on?   - Ooh! Aah!
Dialogue: 1,1:25:13.41,1:25:15.74,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Aaaah!
Dialogue: 1,1:25:25.55,1:25:27.52,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, God!
Dialogue: 1,1:25:36.86,1:25:39.26,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 1,1:25:40.71,1:25:42.80,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 1,1:25:50.95,1:25:52.89,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, God!
Dialogue: 1,1:26:00.10,1:26:03.07,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Dewey!
Dialogue: 1,1:26:03.13,1:26:05.07,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Dewey!
Dialogue: 1,1:26:05.14,1:26:08.97,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Dewey, where are you?
Dialogue: 1,1:26:09.04,1:26:10.97,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Dewey!
Dialogue: 1,1:26:12.04,1:26:13.67,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Sidney?
Dialogue: 1,1:26:18.75,1:26:20.74,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Dewey!
Dialogue: 1,1:26:48.31,1:26:49.78,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 1,1:27:15.97,1:27:19.67,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,7825, suspect at 105 North Avenue 52.
Dialogue: 1,1:27:19.74,1:27:22.94,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Hello. Help me, please. I'm at Stu Marker's house on Turner Lane.
Dialogue: 1,1:27:23.01,1:27:27.38,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,It's 261 Turner Lane. Please, he's going to try and kill me.
Dialogue: 1,1:27:49.87,1:27:53.10,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Sidney! Sidney!
Dialogue: 1,1:27:53.18,1:27:55.61,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Jesus, we've got to get the fuck out of here!
Dialogue: 1,1:27:55.68,1:27:56.58,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Stop right there!
Dialogue: 1,1:27:56.58,1:27:59.05,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't shoot. It's me! I found Tatum. She's dead.
Dialogue: 1,1:27:59.12,1:28:01.11,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- I think Stu did it. - Don't listen to him, Sidney!
Dialogue: 1,1:28:01.19,1:28:03.12,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Stay back! - Stu did it.
Dialogue: 1,1:28:03.19,1:28:05.75,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- He killed Billy. He killed my Tatum.  - You did it!
Dialogue: 1,1:28:05.82,1:28:06.91,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- He killed my Tatum!  - No, I didn't!
Dialogue: 1,1:28:06.91,1:28:07.22,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You lie!
Dialogue: 1,1:28:07.22,1:28:07.64,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,He killed my Tatum!
Dialogue: 1,1:28:07.64,1:28:08.16,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- No, I didn't! - You lie!
Dialogue: 1,1:28:08.23,1:28:10.46,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Sidney, baby, please, give me that gun!
Dialogue: 1,1:28:10.53,1:28:12.50,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Give me that gun! Christ, man!
Dialogue: 1,1:28:12.56,1:28:14.93,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,No, I didn't. Sid, he did it!
Dialogue: 1,1:28:15.00,1:28:17.39,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,He did it, Sidney! Please, I didn't do it.
Dialogue: 1,1:28:17.39,1:28:18.53,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,He did it. Please!
Dialogue: 1,1:28:18.60,1:28:21.13,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Please, Sidney. Oh! - Fuck you both!
Dialogue: 1,1:28:21.21,1:28:23.83,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Please! - No! No! Sidney!
Dialogue: 1,1:28:23.91,1:28:26.93,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Open up! He did it!
Dialogue: 1,1:28:27.01,1:28:31.34,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Help me! He's going crazy!
Dialogue: 1,1:28:31.42,1:28:33.47,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Sidney! - Go away!
Dialogue: 1,1:28:33.55,1:28:35.85,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Sidney?
Dialogue: 1,1:28:35.92,1:28:39.65,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Leave me alone
Dialogue: 1,1:28:42.59,1:28:44.79,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Sid. - Billy.
Dialogue: 1,1:28:49.90,1:28:54.27,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh! Billy. Billy. Are you okay?
Dialogue: 1,1:28:54.34,1:28:57.17,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- I'm okay. - I thought you were dead.
Dialogue: 1,1:28:57.24,1:29:00.04,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,No, I'm like a stuck pig, but I'm all right.
Dialogue: 1,1:29:00.11,1:29:02.20,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Get up.
Dialogue: 1,1:29:02.28,1:29:04.54,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- I'm okay. - You're bleeding.
Dialogue: 1,1:29:05.62,1:29:07.55,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Oh, my God. - We've gotta get help.
Dialogue: 1,1:29:07.62,1:29:08.68,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,No, he's out there!
Dialogue: 1,1:29:08.69,1:29:10.71,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,No, give me the gun. Give me the gun. It's okay.
Dialogue: 1,1:29:10.79,1:29:13.15,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,It's okay. It's okay.
Dialogue: 1,1:29:13.22,1:29:15.16,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Careful.
Dialogue: 1,1:29:16.33,1:29:18.82,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Please help me! - Come in, come in!
Dialogue: 1,1:29:18.90,1:29:21.09,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Stu's flipped out! He's gone mad!
Dialogue: 1,1:29:23.53,1:29:25.70,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,We all go a little mad sometimes.
Dialogue: 1,1:29:25.77,1:29:27.63,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- No, Billy! - Oh, fuck!
Dialogue: 1,1:29:33.64,1:29:37.01,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Anthony Perkins, "Psycho."
Dialogue: 1,1:29:40.75,1:29:43.05,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Mmm.
Dialogue: 1,1:29:43.12,1:29:47.72,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Corn syrup. Same stuff they used for pig's blood in "Carrie."
Dialogue: 1,1:29:50.93,1:29:53.19,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Stu.
Dialogue: 1,1:29:53.26,1:29:57.10,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Help me, please.
Dialogue: 1,1:29:57.17,1:30:00.19,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Surprise, Sidney.
Dialogue: 1,1:30:03.37,1:30:06.04,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- No! - Ooh!
Dialogue: 1,1:30:06.11,1:30:08.77,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, now. Whoa.
Dialogue: 1,1:30:10.48,1:30:13.97,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Sidney? You look like you've seen a ghost.
Dialogue: 1,1:30:14.05,1:30:16.71,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 1,1:30:16.79,1:30:18.81,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,It's all part of the game, Sidney.
Dialogue: 1,1:30:18.89,1:30:20.88,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,It's called "Guess How I'm Gonna Die."
Dialogue: 1,1:30:20.88,1:30:21.65,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Fuck you!
Dialogue: 1,1:30:21.73,1:30:23.43,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,No, no, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 1,1:30:23.43,1:30:26.32,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,We already played that game, remember?
Dialogue: 1,1:30:26.40,1:30:29.46,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- You lost. - It's a fun game, Sidney.
Dialogue: 1,1:30:29.53,1:30:32.53,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,See, we ask you a question, and if you get it wrong,
Dialogue: 1,1:30:32.60,1:30:34.76,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,"boo-kah", you die!
Dialogue: 1,1:30:34.84,1:30:37.90,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You get it right, you die.
Dialogue: 1,1:30:37.98,1:30:39.13,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You're crazy, both of you.
Dialogue: 1,1:30:39.14,1:30:41.57,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Actually, we prefer the term "psychotic."
Dialogue: 1,1:30:41.65,1:30:45.74,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- You'll never get away with this. - Oh, no?
Dialogue: 1,1:30:46.65,1:30:48.85,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Tell that to Cotton Weary.
Dialogue: 1,1:30:48.92,1:30:51.65,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You wouldn't believe how easy he was to frame.
Dialogue: 1,1:30:51.72,1:30:55.66,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Watch a few movies, take a few notes.
Dialogue: 1,1:30:55.73,1:30:58.09,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- It was fun.  - No!
Dialogue: 1,1:30:58.16,1:31:00.43,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Whoa! - Where're you goin'?
Dialogue: 1,1:31:00.50,1:31:03.19,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 1,1:31:03.27,1:31:05.79,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Why did you kill my mother?
Dialogue: 1,1:31:05.87,1:31:09.60,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Why? Why?
Dialogue: 1,1:31:09.67,1:31:12.30,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Did you hear that, Stu? I think she wants a motive.
Dialogue: 1,1:31:14.58,1:31:16.51,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I don't really believe in motive, Sid.
Dialogue: 1,1:31:16.58,1:31:18.23,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I mean, did Norman Bates have a motive?
Dialogue: 1,1:31:18.23,1:31:18.51,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 1,1:31:18.58,1:31:21.89,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Did they ever really decide why Hannibal Lecter liked to eat people?
Dialogue: 1,1:31:21.89,1:31:22.71,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't think so!
Dialogue: 1,1:31:22.79,1:31:26.55,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,See, it's a lot scarier when there's no motive, Sid.
Dialogue: 1,1:31:26.62,1:31:29.15,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,We did your mom a favor, Sid.
Dialogue: 1,1:31:29.23,1:31:30.63,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,That woman was a slut-bag whore
Dialogue: 1,1:31:30.63,1:31:32.79,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,who flashed her shit all over town like she was Sharon Stone.
Dialogue: 1,1:31:32.86,1:31:34.16,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Yeah, we put her out of her misery,
Dialogue: 1,1:31:34.16,1:31:35.30,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,cause let's face it, Sidney,
Dialogue: 1,1:31:35.37,1:31:38.53,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,your mother was no Sharon Stone, hmm?
Dialogue: 1,1:31:43.74,1:31:46.23,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Is that motive enough for you?
Dialogue: 1,1:31:47.44,1:31:50.68,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,How about this?
Dialogue: 1,1:31:50.75,1:31:55.24,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Your slut mother was fucking my father,
Dialogue: 1,1:31:57.09,1:32:00.72,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,and she's the reason my mom moved out and abandoned me.
Dialogue: 1,1:32:03.43,1:32:05.40,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,How's that for a motive?
Dialogue: 1,1:32:05.46,1:32:09.06,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Maternal abandonment causes serious deviant behavior.
Dialogue: 1,1:32:09.13,1:32:10.13,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,lt certainly fucked you up.
Dialogue: 1,1:32:10.13,1:32:11.86,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,lt made you have sex with a psychopath.
Dialogue: 1,1:32:11.94,1:32:16.34,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,That's right. You gave it up. Now you're no longer a virgin. Oooh!
Dialogue: 1,1:32:16.41,1:32:18.40,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I said "virgin". Whoops!
Dialogue: 1,1:32:18.48,1:32:21.44,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Now you gotta die. Those are the rules.
Dialogue: 1,1:32:21.51,1:32:23.98,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Let's pretend it's all a scary movie, Sid.
Dialogue: 1,1:32:23.98,1:32:25.68,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,How do you think it's gonna end?
Dialogue: 1,1:32:28.99,1:32:32.55,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh! Oh! This is the greatest part! You're gonna love this.
Dialogue: 1,1:32:32.62,1:32:35.11,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,We got a surprise for you, Sidney.
Dialogue: 1,1:32:35.19,1:32:36.57,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're gonna love this one.
Dialogue: 1,1:32:36.57,1:32:38.06,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,It's a scream, baby!
Dialogue: 1,1:32:38.13,1:32:41.06,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Hold on a sec. I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 1,1:32:41.13,1:32:44.12,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You know what time it is, Sid?
Dialogue: 1,1:32:44.20,1:32:46.19,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,It's after midnight.
Dialogue: 1,1:32:46.27,1:32:49.97,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,It's your mom's anniversary. Congratulations.
Dialogue: 1,1:32:50.04,1:32:52.91,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,We killed her exactly one year ago today.
Dialogue: 1,1:32:52.98,1:32:57.44,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Attention! Oh, what do we have behind door number three, Sidney?
Dialogue: 1,1:32:57.51,1:32:59.24,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Daddy! - Whoa, hold it.
Dialogue: 1,1:32:59.32,1:33:01.11,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 1,1:33:01.18,1:33:04.42,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Guess we won't be needing this anymore. - Uh-huh!
Dialogue: 1,1:33:04.49,1:33:07.75,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,And, oh, look at this. Ring, ring. Won't need this.
Dialogue: 1,1:33:07.82,1:33:09.92,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Got the ending figured out yet, Sid?
Dialogue: 1,1:33:09.99,1:33:12.02,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Come on, Sidney. You think about it now, huh?
Dialogue: 1,1:33:12.10,1:33:14.86,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Your daddy's the chief suspect. We cloned his cellular.
Dialogue: 1,1:33:14.93,1:33:16.27,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,The evidence is all right there, baby!
Dialogue: 1,1:33:16.27,1:33:18.33,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,What if your father snapped?
Dialogue: 1,1:33:18.40,1:33:19.78,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Your mother's anniversary set him off,
Dialogue: 1,1:33:19.78,1:33:21.60,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,and he went on a murder spree, killing everyone.
Dialogue: 1,1:33:21.67,1:33:23.94,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Except for Billy and me. We were left for dead.
Dialogue: 1,1:33:24.01,1:33:27.14,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Then he... kills you...
Dialogue: 1,1:33:27.21,1:33:29.87,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,and shoots himself in the head.
Dialogue: 1,1:33:29.95,1:33:32.78,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Perfect ending. - I thought of that.
Dialogue: 1,1:33:32.85,1:33:34.78,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Watch this.
Dialogue: 1,1:33:38.79,1:33:43.12,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Ready? - Yeah. Yeah! I'm ready, baby!
Dialogue: 1,1:33:43.19,1:33:47.96,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Right! Get up! Yeah, babe, get up! Hit it!
Dialogue: 1,1:33:52.80,1:33:55.33,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Good one, man. Jesus.
Dialogue: 1,1:33:55.41,1:33:57.10,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 1,1:33:57.17,1:33:59.44,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,My turn.
Dialogue: 1,1:34:01.18,1:34:04.61,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't forget. Stay to the side and don't go too deep.
Dialogue: 1,1:34:05.68,1:34:08.31,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Okay. I'll remember.
Dialogue: 1,1:34:09.39,1:34:12.82,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Aaah! Fuck! Fuck!
Dialogue: 1,1:34:12.89,1:34:15.36,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Fuck! Goddamn it, Stu!
Dialogue: 1,1:34:15.43,1:34:18.45,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Sorry, Billy. I guess I got a little too zealous, huh?
Dialogue: 1,1:34:18.53,1:34:21.55,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Give me the knife. - No.
Dialogue: 1,1:34:21.63,1:34:24.50,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Give me the knife!
Dialogue: 1,1:34:27.37,1:34:29.30,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 1,1:34:31.61,1:34:33.82,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You see, Sid, everybody dies but us.
Dialogue: 1,1:34:33.82,1:34:36.34,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Everybody dies but us.
Dialogue: 1,1:34:36.41,1:34:39.04,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,We get to carry on and plan the sequel,
Dialogue: 1,1:34:39.12,1:34:43.35,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,'cause let's face it, baby, these days ya gotta have a sequel!
Dialogue: 1,1:34:46.12,1:34:48.99,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You sick fucks. You've seen one too many movies.
Dialogue: 1,1:34:49.06,1:34:51.55,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Now, Sid, don't you blame the movies.
Dialogue: 1,1:34:51.57,1:34:51.58,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I feel a little woozy here!
Dialogue: 1,1:34:51.63,1:34:55.36,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Movies don't create psychos.
Dialogue: 1,1:34:58.04,1:35:02.00,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,All right. All right, you get the gun.
Dialogue: 1,1:35:02.08,1:35:03.98,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I'll untie Pops, okay?
Dialogue: 1,1:35:07.39,1:35:10.58,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Now! - Okay.
Dialogue: 1,1:35:19.36,1:35:21.96,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Um. Uh...
Dialogue: 1,1:35:22.03,1:35:25.70,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Houston, we... we have a problem here.
Dialogue: 1,1:35:27.71,1:35:30.30,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- What? - The gun, man. The gun.
Dialogue: 1,1:35:30.38,1:35:33.97,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I put it right there, and it's not there.
Dialogue: 1,1:35:34.05,1:35:37.31,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Where the fuck is it? - Right here, asshole.
Dialogue: 1,1:35:38.92,1:35:40.60,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Man, I thought she was dead.
Dialogue: 1,1:35:40.60,1:35:42.41,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,She looked dead, man.
Dialogue: 1,1:35:42.49,1:35:45.25,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Still does. - I've got an ending for you.
Dialogue: 1,1:35:45.32,1:35:48.32,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,The reporter left for dead in the news van
Dialogue: 1,1:35:48.39,1:35:50.45,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,comes to,
Dialogue: 1,1:35:50.53,1:35:52.86,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,stumbles on you two dipshits,
Dialogue: 1,1:35:52.93,1:35:55.06,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,finds the gun,
Dialogue: 1,1:35:55.13,1:35:58.86,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,foils your plan and saves the day.
Dialogue: 1,1:35:58.94,1:36:01.41,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I like that ending.
Dialogue: 1,1:36:02.74,1:36:04.94,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I know something you don't.
Dialogue: 1,1:36:08.31,1:36:10.98,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Fuck. No!
Dialogue: 1,1:36:13.79,1:36:16.08,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Yeah, man.
Dialogue: 1,1:36:16.15,1:36:19.92,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Yeah. Aw, so sweet.
Dialogue: 1,1:36:25.03,1:36:29.52,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,It works better without the safety on.
Dialogue: 1,1:36:34.87,1:36:37.97,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,This is Gale Weathers signing off.
Dialogue: 1,1:36:38.04,1:36:40.41,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Babe, you're gonna love this!
Dialogue: 1,1:36:42.71,1:36:44.65,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Shit.
Dialogue: 1,1:36:46.29,1:36:48.22,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,1:36:54.06,1:36:56.49,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Where are they? Where are they?
Dialogue: 1,1:36:56.56,1:36:58.55,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I don't know, but I'm hurtin', man.
Dialogue: 1,1:36:58.63,1:37:01.06,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Fuck!
Dialogue: 1,1:37:01.13,1:37:05.59,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Shall I let the machine get it?
Dialogue: 1,1:37:05.67,1:37:08.44,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Hello? -  Are you alone in the house?
Dialogue: 1,1:37:08.51,1:37:10.81,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Bitch! You bitch! Where the fuck are you?
Dialogue: 1,1:37:10.88,1:37:13.81,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Not so fast. We're gonna play a little game.
Dialogue: 1,1:37:13.88,1:37:16.55,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,It's called "Guess Who Just Called The Police And
Dialogue: 1,1:37:16.55,1:37:18.75,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Reported Your Sorry Motherfucking Ass."
Dialogue: 1,1:37:18.82,1:37:20.57,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Find her, you dipshit. Get up.
Dialogue: 1,1:37:20.57,1:37:22.45,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I can't, Billy. You cut me too deep.
Dialogue: 1,1:37:22.52,1:37:26.32,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I think I'm dying here, man.
Dialogue: 1,1:37:26.39,1:37:29.79,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Talk to her. Talk to her.
Dialogue: 1,1:37:36.70,1:37:37.44,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 1,1:37:37.44,1:37:41.47,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, Stu, Stu, Stu. What's your motive?
Dialogue: 1,1:37:41.54,1:37:43.14,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Billy's got one. The police are on their way.
Dialogue: 1,1:37:43.15,1:37:44.63,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,What are you gonna tell them?
Dialogue: 1,1:37:44.71,1:37:47.11,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Peer pressure. I'm far too sensitive.
Dialogue: 1,1:37:47.18,1:37:49.16,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm gonna rip you up, you bitch,
Dialogue: 1,1:37:49.16,1:37:50.64,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,just like your fucking mother!
Dialogue: 1,1:37:50.72,1:37:52.87,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You've gotta find me first, you pansy-assed mama's boy!
Dialogue: 1,1:37:52.87,1:37:53.41,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Fuck!
Dialogue: 1,1:37:53.49,1:37:56.35,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Ow. You fuckin' hit me with the phone, dick!
Dialogue: 1,1:37:56.42,1:37:59.05,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Fucker, where are you?
Dialogue: 1,1:38:01.23,1:38:04.75,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You fuck!
Dialogue: 1,1:38:04.83,1:38:06.80,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Did you really call the police?
Dialogue: 1,1:38:06.80,1:38:08.77,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,You bet your sorry ass I did.
Dialogue: 1,1:38:08.83,1:38:12.13,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,My mom and dad are gonna be so mad at me.
Dialogue: 1,1:38:12.20,1:38:15.26,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Aaah! Bitch!
Dialogue: 1,1:38:44.14,1:38:46.43,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Aaah!
Dialogue: 1,1:38:49.47,1:38:52.17,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Aaah!
Dialogue: 1,1:39:08.93,1:39:12.16,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Aah!
Dialogue: 1,1:39:12.23,1:39:14.36,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Ohh! My arm!
Dialogue: 1,1:39:21.34,1:39:23.77,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I always had a thing for ya, Sid!
Dialogue: 1,1:39:29.48,1:39:33.04,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Bitch.
Dialogue: 1,1:39:44.08,1:39:46.01,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. It's all right.
Dialogue: 1,1:39:46.08,1:39:48.17,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, my God, Randy, I thought you were dead.
Dialogue: 1,1:39:48.25,1:39:49.74,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I probably should be.
Dialogue: 1,1:39:49.74,1:39:51.24,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,I never thought I'd be so happy to be a virgin.
Dialogue: 1,1:39:51.32,1:39:53.51,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Fucker!
Dialogue: 1,1:39:59.16,1:40:02.13,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Say hello to your mother.
Dialogue: 1,1:40:08.90,1:40:12.23,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Aaah!
Dialogue: 1,1:40:35.76,1:40:37.70,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 1,1:40:40.57,1:40:43.43,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Guess I remembered the safety that time, you bastard.
Dialogue: 1,1:40:55.78,1:40:57.72,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Careful.
Dialogue: 1,1:40:57.79,1:41:01.41,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,This is the moment when the supposedly dead killer comes back to life...
Dialogue: 1,1:41:01.49,1:41:03.42,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,for one last scare.
Dialogue: 1,1:41:07.76,1:41:11.39,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Not in my movie.
Dialogue: 1,1:41:15.40,1:41:17.06,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Dad.
Dialogue: 1,1:41:17.14,1:41:19.70,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Randy, help me out.
Dialogue: 1,1:41:23.44,1:41:25.38,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Ow. Aah. - Are you okay?
Dialogue: 1,1:41:27.82,1:41:30.55,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Are you okay? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,1:41:32.05,1:41:35.68,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Hang in there, buddy. - All right.
Dialogue: 1,1:41:35.76,1:41:37.69,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,- Over here. - Sorry, kid.
Dialogue: 1,1:41:37.86,1:41:41.95,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Okay, I think it's going to go something like this. Just stay with me.
Dialogue: 1,1:41:42.03,1:41:44.85,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Hi, this is Gale Weathers...
Dialogue: 1,1:41:44.90,1:41:49.86,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,with an exclusive eyewitness account of this amazing breaking story.
Dialogue: 1,1:41:49.94,1:41:52.37,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Several more local teens are dead...
Dialogue: 1,1:41:52.44,1:41:55.37,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,bringing to an end the harrowing mystery of the mass killing
Dialogue: 1,1:41:55.44,1:41:58.04,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,that has terrified this peaceful community...
Dialogue: 1,1:41:58.11,1:42:00.81,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,like the plot of some scary movie.
Dialogue: 1,1:42:00.88,1:42:03.44,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,lt all began with a scream over 9-1-1...
Dialogue: 1,1:42:03.52,1:42:07.78,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,and ended in a bloodbath that has rocked the town of Woodsboro,
Dialogue: 1,1:42:07.86,1:42:10.38,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,all played out here in this peaceful farmhouse...
Dialogue: 1,1:42:10.46,1:42:13.05,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,far from the crimes and the sirens of the larger cities...
Dialogue: 1,1:42:13.13,1:42:15.22,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,that its residents had fled.
Dialogue: 1,1:42:15.30,1:42:17.96,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,Okay, let's take it back to one. Come on. Move it.
Dialogue: 1,1:42:18.03,1:42:20.73,ENG,NTP,0,0,0,,This is my big shot. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,《惊声尖叫》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.00,0:00:21.20,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 喂 -  喂
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.27,0:00:23.71,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你找？ - 你是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.77,0:00:26.77,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你想找谁？ - 这个电话号码是？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.84,0:00:29.78,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你想打的是哪个电话号码？ - 我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.85,0:00:32.28,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我想你打错了 - 是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.35,0:00:34.78,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,不要紧，没关系的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.03,0:00:46.46,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 喂！ - 对不起，我猜我刚才打错了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.53,0:00:49.97,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那你为什么还要再打进来？ - 来道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.03,0:00:53.73,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我原谅你了，再见 - 等等，别挂
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.80,0:00:56.14,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 为什么？ - 我想跟你谈一小会儿
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.21,0:00:59.30,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你想聊天的话，可以去打900收费电话 再见
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.63,0:01:23.33,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 喂 - 你为什么不想和我聊一聊？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.40,0:01:24.54,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你是谁呀？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.54,0:01:27.46,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你先告诉我你的名字，我再说我的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.54,0:01:30.47,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.54,0:01:32.80,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那是什么声音？ - 爆米花
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.88,0:01:34.81,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你在做爆米花？ - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.88,0:01:37.11,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我只在看电影时才吃爆米花
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.18,0:01:40.48,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我准备看录像了 - 是吗？什么录像？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.55,0:01:42.54,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,一个恐怖电影
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.62,0:01:44.92,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你喜欢恐怖电影吗？ - 是呀
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.99,0:01:47.05,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你最喜欢看哪部恐怖电影？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.12,0:01:50.02,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我不知道 - 你肯定有一个最喜欢看的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.09,0:01:52.03,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,想起来了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.10,0:01:54.03,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯...《鬼节》吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.10,0:01:56.46,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道，那个戴白面具的家伙...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.53,0:01:59.40,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,他四处寻找猎物， 最后盯上了那个临时保姆
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.47,0:02:01.40,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,-  是吗 - 那你最喜欢的是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.47,0:02:05.91,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你猜 - 嗯...<猛鬼街>
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.98,0:02:08.74,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是有个家伙的手指是刀子？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.81,0:02:11.25,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是的，弗莱迪·克鲁戈 - 弗莱迪，对，就是他
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.31,0:02:13.98,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我喜欢那个电影，很恐怖
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.05,0:02:16.58,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,是呀，第一部很恐怖， 但是其他的都很差
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.65,0:02:18.62,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,那你有男朋友吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.69,0:02:21.92,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了？你想和我约会吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.99,0:02:24.55,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,很可能你有还是没有男朋友？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.63,0:02:27.82,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 嗯...没有 - 你还没有告诉我你的名字呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.90,0:02:29.83,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么想知道我的名字？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.90,0:02:33.27,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我想知道我现在正在看谁
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.34,0:02:38.10,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你说什么？ - 我想知道我在和谁说话
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.17,0:02:39.42,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才你不是这样说的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.42,0:02:41.11,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,那你说我刚才说的是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.25,0:02:45.27,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.52,0:02:48.51,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,喂？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.58,0:02:50.78,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,注意，我要挂线了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.85,0:02:52.79,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,等等！我们不是说要出去约会的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.86,0:02:55.19,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会去的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.26,0:02:57.19,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,不要挂断！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.57,0:03:07.87,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,该死
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.94,0:03:11.63,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 干什么？ - 我叫你别挂线的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.71,0:03:13.80,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你究竟想干什么？ - 想聊聊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.88,0:03:16.54,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你打给别人去好不好？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.89,0:03:28.88,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 听着，混蛋！ - 你给我听着，你这个小婊子！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.96,0:03:30.57,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你又把我的电话挂断了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.57,0:03:33.16,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我要把你象鱼一样宰了，知道吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.23,0:03:35.75,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,好不好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.83,0:03:37.77,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,这是开玩笑吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.83,0:03:40.27,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,不，实际上更像一种游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.84,0:03:45.04,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你应付得了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.11,0:03:47.51,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,金发女郎？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.65,0:03:59.59,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你能看得见我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.59,0:04:07.12,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,听着，我马上就要叫警察了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.20,0:04:11.43,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,叫他们已经来不及了， 他们离这儿太远了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.50,0:04:13.31,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你究竟想干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.31,0:04:16.56,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,想看看你身体内部究竟是什么样的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.88,0:04:28.37,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,是谁？谁在那儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.55,0:04:31.49,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我在打电话
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.89,0:04:36.22,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你不该问“谁在那儿”
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.29,0:04:38.73,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你没看过恐怖电影吗？ 那是求死愿望
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.79,0:04:43.39,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你也应该过来看看这儿 是不是有什么怪声的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.47,0:04:46.90,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,听着，你现在已经玩够了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.97,0:04:50.53,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你最好马上离开，否则 - 否则什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.61,0:04:55.24,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我男朋友快来这儿了， 他知道了会大发雷霆的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.31,0:04:57.25,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我认为你没有男朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.31,0:05:01.18,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我撒谎了！ 我确实有男朋友，并且会随时来这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.25,0:05:04.31,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 所以你这头蠢驴最好赶快滚 - 好呀
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.39,0:05:06.86,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我说真的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.92,0:05:09.07,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,他很壮，是个橄榄球队员
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.07,0:05:11.79,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,他会把你的屎都打出来的！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.86,0:05:15.09,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我好害怕哟，我的腿在发抖
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.16,0:05:17.60,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你最好赶紧走
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.67,0:05:19.60,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,他不是叫...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.67,0:05:22.60,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,斯蒂夫吗，对不对？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.67,0:05:25.61,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么知道他的名字的？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.68,0:05:29.61,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你再打开院子里的灯...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.69,0:05:43.78,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,天哪！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.86,0:05:46.37,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我是你， 我不会那样干的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.37,0:05:47.56,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你在哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.63,0:05:49.69,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 猜猜看 - 请不要伤害我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.77,0:05:52.39,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那要看你了 - 你为什么要这样做？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.47,0:05:54.94,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我想玩一个游戏 - 不
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.00,0:05:57.60,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那他马上就会死！ - 不！不！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.67,0:06:02.20,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,到底玩不玩？ 到底玩不玩？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.28,0:06:06.21,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,什...什么样的游戏？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.28,0:06:10.98,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,关上灯， 你会看到是什么样的游戏的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.05,0:06:12.99,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,快！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.16,0:06:18.13,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,凯西！不要！不要！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.19,0:06:20.25,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,别！凯西！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.33,0:06:22.26,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我们开始玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.33,0:06:26.67,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我问问题， 如果你答对了，斯蒂夫便可以不死
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.74,0:06:29.03,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 请不要这样了 - 来吧，很好玩的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.11,0:06:31.13,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 求求你... - 这是简单的那类问题
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.21,0:06:33.14,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 求求你... - 有关电影的细节问题
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.21,0:06:36.08,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 先给你来个热身的问题吧 - 请别这样，我不会
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.15,0:06:39.58,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 说出《鬼节》中杀手的名字 - 不
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.65,0:06:42.58,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧！ 这是你最喜欢的恐怖电影，还记得吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.65,0:06:45.07,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,他有一个白色的面具 他盯上了那个保姆
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.07,0:06:45.92,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.99,0:06:48.92,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 得了，你知道的 - 请别玩了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.99,0:06:52.19,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他叫什么名字？ - 我现在不能思考
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.26,0:06:54.75,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,斯蒂夫的性命就靠你了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.83,0:06:57.86,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,麦克尔...麦克尔，麦克尔
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.93,0:07:00.49,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,对！非常好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.57,0:07:02.50,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,现在来开始正式的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.57,0:07:04.94,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不要！ - 刚才你玩得很不错嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.01,0:07:06.45,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我们现在不能停下来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.45,0:07:08.41,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,请不要这样！放过我们吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.48,0:07:11.54,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,来回答另一个同类型的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.61,0:07:14.55,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,求求你停下来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.62,0:07:17.71,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,说出《十三号星期五》中杀手的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.79,0:07:20.45,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,贾森！贾森，贾森！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.52,0:07:23.58,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,很抱歉，你答错了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.66,0:07:27.12,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,不，我没错！不，我没错！就是贾森
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.20,0:07:29.39,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,恐怕不是的，你错了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.47,0:07:33.42,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,听着，就是贾森！ 那个电影我他妈看过20遍了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.50,0:07:35.00,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,那你应该知道贾森的老娘
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.00,0:07:36.63,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,沃希斯太太，是最初的杀手
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.71,0:07:39.00,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,贾森最后才出场
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.08,0:07:41.94,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,恐怕你答错了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.01,0:07:43.95,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你在玩我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.01,0:07:46.04,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你很幸运，我再给你一个机会
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.12,0:07:49.88,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,但是可怜的史蒂夫，我想他完蛋了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.28,0:08:18.24,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨，我们还没完哪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.62,0:08:22.88,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,最后一个问题你准备好了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.95,0:08:27.12,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,求求你放过我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.19,0:08:29.12,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,答对了，我就放过你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.49,0:08:33.93,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我在哪个门外？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.00,0:08:38.67,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 什么？ - 这个房子有两个大门
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.80,0:08:39.60,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,前门和院子里的门
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.67,0:08:41.60,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你答对了，便不会死
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.67,0:08:43.90,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,很简单
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.97,0:08:47.07,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,不要这样做 我不能回答！我不会回答！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.14,0:08:49.70,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,注意了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.40,0:10:19.43,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,啊哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.16,0:11:09.45,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你今天在这儿浇水了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.53,0:11:12.02,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那只是雨水 - 它们看起来很不错，对不？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.09,0:11:13.25,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,闻起来不也很香吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.25,0:11:15.03,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我跟你说了可以把它们送回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.10,0:11:20.63,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.70,0:11:22.97,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 天哪！ - 这是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.82,0:11:38.84,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,凯西！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.19,0:11:44.59,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,唉呀，天...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.46,0:11:48.56,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,凯西！凯西！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.63,0:11:50.56,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,凯西！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.60,0:11:54.93,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 她在哪？ - 快报警！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.91,0:12:00.84,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,凯西！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.91,0:12:02.17,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,凯西，你在楼上吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.17,0:12:03.78,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,噢，老天！凯西，宝贝？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.85,0:12:05.78,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,-  凯西？ -  她在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.85,0:12:08.28,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 妈妈 -  噢，天哪！ 我能听见她声音
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.35,0:12:11.72,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 妈妈 - 她在哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.79,0:12:15.72,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,噢，天哪！我能听见她声音
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.79,0:12:17.73,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.46,0:12:24.40,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,快进车，到麦肯齐家去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.47,0:12:27.83,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不，不，那不是我女儿！ - 快走
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.90,0:12:29.84,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不是我女儿！ - 去报警
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.58,0:13:12.74,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,是我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.79,0:13:15.81,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 比利，你来这儿干什么？ - 抱歉，不要怪我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.89,0:13:18.19,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这是你的卧室？ - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.26,0:13:20.19,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我爸就在隔壁，你不能在这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.26,0:13:22.59,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我只呆一会儿
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.66,0:13:24.72,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...你快走吧快！快！快！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.80,0:13:26.92,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,发生什么事了？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.00,0:13:28.93,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧？ - 你不会先敲门吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.00,0:13:30.87,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我听见尖叫声 - 不，我没有
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.94,0:13:33.23,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,没有？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.31,0:13:36.40,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,哦，是吗？我正准备睡觉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.48,0:13:38.94,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我明天一早的飞机
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.01,0:13:42.07,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,整个周末都有展览， 我起码要到星期天才回来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.15,0:13:45.45,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 桌上有钱，我会住在... - 希尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.52,0:13:48.42,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 就在机超打电话给我，如果... - 有事的话
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.49,0:13:51.51,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我肯定我听见了尖叫声
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.59,0:13:53.62,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,祝旅途愉快！爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.69,0:13:55.63,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,好好睡，宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.30,0:14:01.89,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,噢...差一点被发现
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.97,0:14:04.77,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,比利，你到这儿干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.84,0:14:06.77,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我刚想到...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.84,0:14:08.20,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我还没有试过从你的卧室窗户进来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.20,0:14:09.03,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,嘘...嘘...嘘
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.11,0:14:11.77,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你现在进来了，那就赶紧走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.84,0:14:13.78,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我刚刚在家看电视
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.85,0:14:16.31,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,正在放那个，嗯...那个《驱魔人》
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.38,0:14:20.25,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 它使我想起了你 - 是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.32,0:14:22.16,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,是的，不过那是电视版的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.16,0:14:24.15,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道，好东西都被剪掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.22,0:14:28.52,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,也使我想起了我们...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.59,0:14:32.19,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,两年那充满激情的开始
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.26,0:14:36.17,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,关系就像R级电影，眼看我们就可以像NC-17级了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.67,0:14:41.13,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,可是现在...一切都变了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.28,0:14:49.65,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,现在我们的关系就像剪辑过的电视版
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.72,0:14:54.08,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,那你觉得就应该爬进我的窗户来...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.15,0:14:57.32,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 并且跟我表演一点被剪掉的镜头？ -  不
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.39,0:15:01.55,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,不，我不会突破你的内衣底线的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.63,0:15:06.59,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我在想，我们可以穿着衣服来做
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.34,0:15:13.50,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 真的？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.57,0:15:15.51,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.95,0:15:30.89,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.07,0:15:49.27,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,好了，好了，时间到了，性感猛男
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.34,0:15:52.28,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,天哪，你看你怎么对待我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.34,0:15:55.78,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道我爸会怎样对你吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.35,0:15:58.28,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.35,0:16:01.29,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我走了 - 好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.60,0:16:13.19,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道， 我...我很感激你这种浪漫情调
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.27,0:16:19.10,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨，关于那个性方面的事，
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.17,0:16:21.87,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我根本不是想催促你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.94,0:16:24.38,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是半开玩笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.44,0:16:26.81,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.85,0:16:36.79,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨，比利
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.86,0:16:41.12,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我们来个PG-13级的关系怎样？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.19,0:16:43.89,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么样的？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.50,0:16:53.40,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,哼，别取笑我了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.51,0:17:03.48,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,三十五
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.55,0:17:06.25,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,局势已被控制
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.32,0:17:09.25,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,罗杰，你去
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.32,0:17:12.09,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,发现了血？好的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.27,0:17:30.33,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,在教室里吸毒...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.41,0:17:32.84,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,并涉及那件神秘的事件
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.91,0:17:35.14,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,神秘的事？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.21,0:17:38.27,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,加州伍兹士堡昨晚被震惊了...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.35,0:17:41.11,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,两名十几岁的学生被残忍地谋杀
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.19,0:17:43.31,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,警方至今未作任何说明
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.39,0:17:46.83,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,但消息来源说未有人被捕...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.89,0:17:48.83,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 凶手可能再次作案 - 你相信这件事吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.89,0:17:52.02,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 发生了什么事？ - 你还不知道？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.10,0:17:55.69,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,凯西·贝克尔和史蒂夫·厄斯 昨晚被杀了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.77,0:17:57.70,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？不会吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.77,0:18:00.20,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,不止是被杀，而且还是血腥的谋杀
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.27,0:18:02.30,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,从头到脚都被割开了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.37,0:18:04.90,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,凯西·贝克尔？ 她上英语课时坐在我的旁边呀
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.98,0:18:06.91,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,以后不会了 真是太不幸了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.98,0:18:09.28,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,她的爸爸和妈妈 发现她吊在一棵树下...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.35,0:18:12.25,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 她的内脏露在外面 - 天哪！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.32,0:18:14.25,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,他们知道谁是凶手吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.32,0:18:17.62,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,一点线索都没有 他们正对校内所有人问话
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.69,0:18:18.74,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,教师，学生，工友等
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.74,0:18:20.18,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,他们认为跟校内的人有关？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.26,0:18:21.05,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,他们不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.05,0:18:24.20,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,杜威说他们已经 多年没见过这么恶性的案件
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.26,0:18:26.20,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,更糟的是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.27,0:18:28.93,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊...很糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.07,0:18:37.60,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,-  给您，泰特太太 - 谢谢你，詹姆士
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.45,0:18:42.11,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,希德内
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.18,0:18:44.55,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,到你了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.79,0:18:52.35,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 谁是下一个？ - 哦，希德内·普里斯科特
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.42,0:18:55.12,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,她是...的女儿，唉...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.50,0:18:59.09,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 希德内，感觉怎么样？ - 还好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.16,0:19:01.46,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨，希德内
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.53,0:19:03.06,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,治安官伯克，杜威
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.14,0:19:06.80,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,哦，希德内，那是副警长莱利
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.87,0:19:10.27,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,-  你好吗？ - 好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.34,0:19:12.44,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你父亲怎样？他还好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.51,0:19:13.63,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我们很好谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.63,0:19:16.41,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,希德内， 我们不会耽误你太长时间的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.48,0:19:19.14,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,警察只想问你几个问题，可以吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.22,0:19:20.58,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.65,0:19:23.92,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,希德内， 你和凯西·贝克尔的关系很好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.99,0:19:27.58,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,记赚你们的校长是爱你们的，我希望你们每个人都平安
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.66,0:19:31.32,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,所有的学生请从学校立即回家
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.40,0:19:33.42,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,请结伴回家，不要跟陌生人接触
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.50,0:19:35.43,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,希德内， 他们问你什么问题了？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.50,0:19:36.55,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,他们问我是否认识凯西
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.56,0:19:37.70,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,他们也问我同样的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.77,0:19:40.20,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 嗨，他们有问你喜欢打猎吗？ - 是呀他们问了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.27,0:19:42.21,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,他们问了你没有？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.27,0:19:44.27,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,他们为什么要问你这个问题？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.34,0:19:46.78,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,因为被害者的尸体都被开膛了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.85,0:19:50.08,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 谢谢，兰迪 - 他们没有问我是否喜欢打猎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.15,0:19:53.21,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 因为凶手不可能是个女孩 - 大男子主义
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.29,0:19:55.91,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,凶手有可能是女性 看过《本能》吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.99,0:19:58.32,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,那是用的破冰锤， 跟这不是一码事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.39,0:20:00.92,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,是呀！ 凯西和史蒂夫的内脏全被掏出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.99,0:20:03.52,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,事实是，只有男的才干得出来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.60,0:20:05.53,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,或是男人型的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.60,0:20:08.09,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道怎样... 才能把人的内脏挖出来？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.44,0:20:15.93,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,用一把刀，从腹股沟一直割到胸骨
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.01,0:20:19.77,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨，别说了， 你这个追求感官刺激的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.85,0:20:22.01,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿，斯图， 你没有和凯西约会过吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.08,0:20:23.21,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,有过，很短
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.21,0:20:26.11,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,在她为了史蒂夫 而甩了他之前
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.19,0:20:28.12,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我还以为你是为我 而把她踹了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.19,0:20:29.52,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,当然是呀！别听他胡说
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.52,0:20:31.52,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,警察知道你和被害者有过约会吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.59,0:20:34.72,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿，你说什么？我杀了他？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.79,0:20:36.78,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,那绝对会提高你 高中生活的质量
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.86,0:20:40.70,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 斯图昨晚和我在一起，好不好？ - 是，确实是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.77,0:20:44.33,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,那是在杀人之前还是在之后？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.40,0:20:46.46,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,去你的，你这个疯子 昨晚你又在哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.54,0:20:47.22,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,在工作
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.22,0:20:50.37,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,还在那个音像店？ 我还以为他们把你炒了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.44,0:20:52.41,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,炒过两次
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.48,0:20:56.35,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我没有杀任何人 - 没有人说你杀了人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.42,0:20:58.08,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢，老兄
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.15,0:21:03.21,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,再说， 只有男人才下得了那样的手
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.29,0:21:06.38,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我马上就把你的屁股割下来，小子 - 告诉我，
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.46,0:21:08.89,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你是不是真的把她的肝放进了信箱？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.96,0:21:12.86,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我听说他们在信箱里 找到了她的肝，脾和胰
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.93,0:21:14.96,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你这个混蛋！我还想在这儿吃东西呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.03,0:21:17.13,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,她已经受不了了，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.20,0:21:19.17,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你最好"肝"远一点
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.94,0:21:24.93,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,“肝”远一点！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.68,0:21:31.21,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,“肝...”，噢！ “肝、肝、肝”，开个玩笑而已
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.86,0:21:39.98,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,再见，希德内 明天见，希德内
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.18,0:22:06.62,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,那，你确信我可以过夜吗？ 我爸爸到星期天才会回来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.69,0:22:08.92,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题 我锻炼完后就来接你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.49,0:22:12.42,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.49,0:22:14.93,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯...嗯，只是...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.99,0:22:16.93,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道，警察和那些记者们...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.00,0:22:18.93,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,对我而言有一种似曾相识的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.00,0:22:21.30,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我7点钟一定到你那儿，我发誓
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.37,0:22:23.80,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 谢谢，塔特姆 - 过会儿见
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.52,0:23:13.71,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,17岁的凯西·贝克尔...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.79,0:23:15.72,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,和她的18岁男友 史蒂夫·厄斯的尸体，
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.79,0:23:17.72,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,昨天晚上被女孩的父母发现...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.79,0:23:19.85,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,伍兹士堡双重谋杀案
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.93,0:23:22.92,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,警方正为缺少线索而为难， 而残暴的凶手...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.00,0:23:26.52,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,惨案震惊了全镇，没有人愿相信这里发生的惨案
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.60,0:23:29.33,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然这不是伍兹士堡小镇首次...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.40,0:23:32.39,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,经历这种惨剧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.47,0:23:34.46,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,仅仅在一年前，毛里恩·普里斯科特，一位妻子兼母亲
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.54,0:23:39.00,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,被强奸并杀害在这个 安宁的小镇广场不远处
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.48,0:24:53.42,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 喂？ - 锻炼得太晚了我就来，好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.32,0:24:57.25,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,七点过了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.32,0:25:00.26,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,别担心, 凯西和史蒂夫都是十点后才遇害的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.33,0:25:03.23,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,哦，哦，这令我放心多了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.36,0:25:05.16,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我要去一趟音像店
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.23,0:25:07.16,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我在考虑租汤姆·克鲁斯 的《步步登天》
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.23,0:25:10.10,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你在适当的地方暂停下来， 你可以看见他的阳具
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.17,0:25:11.97,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,不管怎样，你快点儿来，好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.98,0:25:13.10,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,那回头见，希德
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.95,0:25:28.11,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 塔特姆，快开车过来  -  你好，希德尼
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.19,0:25:31.95,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯...嗨，你是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.02,0:25:35.62,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.69,0:25:38.13,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,唔...，我，我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.20,0:25:40.13,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,恐怖的夜晚，是吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.20,0:25:45.00,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,那些谋杀， 太像恐怖电影里的情节了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.07,0:25:47.63,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,兰迪，我知道是你了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.71,0:25:49.94,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你是从工作的地方来电的吧，  塔特姆正往你那儿去
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.01,0:25:53.50,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你喜欢恐怖电影吗，希德内？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.58,0:25:56.64,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我喜欢你这种语调，兰迪很性感
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.72,0:25:59.41,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你最喜欢的恐怖电影是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.48,0:26:01.65,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,噢，得了 你知道我不看那些垃圾的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.72,0:26:04.28,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 为什么不？害怕？ - 不，不
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.36,0:26:06.42,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,只是，怎么说呢？ 它们看起来都一样
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.49,0:26:09.62,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,愚蠢的凶手总是猎杀 那些毫无反抗的大波妹
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.69,0:26:12.63,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,这些大波妹总是跑上楼， 而不懂应该从正门出去
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.70,0:26:16.60,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这真是对观众的侮辱 - 你一个人在家吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.67,0:26:19.23,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,兰迪，问得太没有创意了 真对你失望
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.30,0:26:22.64,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,也许那是因为我不是兰迪
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.75,0:26:31.68,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,那，你是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.75,0:26:33.78,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你不应问“我是谁”
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.85,0:26:37.29,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,而应问“我在哪儿”
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.39,0:26:41.45,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,那，那...，你在哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.53,0:26:43.46,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你家前门廊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.80,0:26:50.23,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么要在那儿打电话？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.30,0:26:52.24,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,这个问题有创意
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.97,0:26:55.91,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,噢，是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.48,0:27:01.57,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,哼，我说你是个骗子
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.33,0:27:17.26,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你在哪儿？ - 就在这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.79,0:27:52.32,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你现在能看见我吗？ - 当然
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.40,0:27:54.33,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,当然？好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.40,0:27:57.37,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在在干嘛？翱
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.44,0:28:00.87,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈？我在干嘛？ 喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.21,0:28:04.14,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,演得不错，兰迪
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.21,0:28:06.58,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,叫塔特姆快点，好不？ 再见
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.65,0:28:09.24,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你挂断， 你就会像你妈一样死！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.55,0:28:16.01,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你想死吗，希德内？ 你妈是肯定不想的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.19,0:28:19.18,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,去你的，杂种！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.89,0:28:50.22,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,不！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.15,0:29:22.09,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,靠！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.40,0:29:39.00,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,比利！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.07,0:29:41.23,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,门锁上了我听到了尖叫声 你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.31,0:29:43.24,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,杀手在这儿 他在这房子里
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.31,0:29:46.21,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,他在屋子里 他有刀
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.28,0:29:48.87,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,他走了 他走了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.95,0:29:50.88,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,没事了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.86,0:30:02.79,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.03,0:30:09.02,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,希德内，怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.34,0:30:12.27,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,喂，喂，等等，等等 等等，希德内，等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.34,0:30:15.86,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,等等，等等，等等，等等！ 怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.94,0:30:19.43,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,希德内，回来！希德内！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.35,0:30:27.81,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起！我找到这个来吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.89,0:30:29.82,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,好了，并拢双手
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.89,0:30:31.65,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你想放弃保持沉默的权利吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.65,0:30:32.82,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我没有干任何事
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.89,0:30:34.83,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你想放弃和律师谈话的权力...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.89,0:30:36.83,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,及讯问时律师可以在场的权力吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.90,0:30:40.83,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,问她，她会告诉你的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.90,0:30:42.99,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我逮住他了，治安官 - 等等，他是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.07,0:30:46.50,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 比利·卢米斯 - 治安官，治安官，放开我
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.57,0:30:49.67,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,不是我 治安官，等等
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.74,0:30:51.68,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,等等，听着 打电话给我爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.74,0:30:54.11,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,求你了，打电话给我爸 他会告诉你的请打个电话
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.18,0:30:57.62,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,希德内！希德内！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.68,0:30:59.74,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 她怎样？ - 希德内比看起来坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.82,0:31:02.75,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,她必须这样， 经历了这么多糟糕的事
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.82,0:31:06.26,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,-  希德内！ - 是呀，今天我们又见到你了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.32,0:31:10.12,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,希德内，请跟我们到警局， 有些问题要问你
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.20,0:31:12.13,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,艾该死！希德内！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.20,0:31:14.39,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,天艾希德内，非常对不起， 我来晚了你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.47,0:31:16.40,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,塔特姆，你不能在这儿， 这是犯罪现场
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.47,0:31:20.16,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 没关系 - 她爸爸出差了，她要住我们家
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.24,0:31:22.17,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈知道吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.24,0:31:24.67,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 知道，猪头 - 我们走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.74,0:31:26.68,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,-  她会没事的 - 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.74,0:31:28.68,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,噢，你不会相信这的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.22,0:31:34.15,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,令人毛骨悚然，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.19,0:31:45.13,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我真该死 - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.20,0:31:48.13,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 老天！快取摄像机！ - 我的名字不是老天
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.07,0:31:52.00,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,希德内，是你在里面吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.07,0:31:54.00,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起，请问他们带走的是 希德内·普里斯科特吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.07,0:31:56.01,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不告诉你 - 她怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.07,0:31:59.44,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不管你的屁事 - 我听说有一个面具，对不对？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.51,0:32:01.70,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你一点消息都不能告诉我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.71,0:32:03.61,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,好艾，你是屁眼里的痔疮
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.68,0:32:06.12,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,别去烦希德内
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.18,0:32:08.12,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,她去哪儿了？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.19,0:32:11.95,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 听着，肯尼 - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.02,0:32:14.32,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你超重过50磅...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.39,0:32:16.33,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,但当我说“快”时，
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.39,0:32:17.13,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,请理解为
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.13,0:32:21.16,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,“立即移动你这头 肥胖、笨拙的蠢驴的大屁股”
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.00,0:32:25.83,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,找到他了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.90,0:32:28.87,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,确信在希尔顿饭店？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.94,0:32:33.67,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 机场那儿的 - 他没在那儿登记
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.05,0:32:37.98,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,他会在别的什么地方吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.05,0:32:41.25,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我想我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.32,0:32:43.69,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系，希德
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.82,0:32:45.00,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会找到他的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.00,0:32:47.09,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,杜威，他们把那个面具拿来了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.66,0:32:50.60,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我马上回来
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.47,0:33:03.03,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我来问你，小子， 你拿着个手机干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.11,0:33:05.04,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,治安官，每个人都有的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.11,0:33:08.31,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我发誓，不是我打的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.38,0:33:10.31,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,看在上帝的份上， 干嘛不去查查电话帐单？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.38,0:33:12.65,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,打电话给威特尔电话公司， 他们有全部的通信记录
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.72,0:33:15.62,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢，汉克斯 我们知道
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.69,0:33:18.38,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你今晚跑到希德内家去干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.46,0:33:20.95,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是想见见她
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.03,0:33:24.79,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,那昨晚呢？希德内说你 昨晚也爬进了她的窗户
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.86,0:33:27.20,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你昨晚出去了？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.27,0:33:31.83,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我看电视看烦了， 就决定出去兜兜风
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.90,0:33:34.74,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你是否正好就兜到 凯西·贝克尔的家了？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.81,0:33:38.83,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,没有，我没有，治安官 我没有杀任何人！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.18,0:33:47.28,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,在那些电话记录来之前， 我们不能放你，小子
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.26,0:33:52.69,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,这真荒唐
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.76,0:33:56.82,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道的，不是我干的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.17,0:34:09.30,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,二号机？好的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.38,0:34:11.64,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,里面还有更多的面包圈吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.71,0:34:14.68,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 快走，肯尼 - 他们不会让任何人进的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.75,0:34:17.68,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我不是普通人 -  变态婊子
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.75,0:34:19.68,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 肯尼，好了吗？ - 好了，开始
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.75,0:34:22.19,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,大家好，这是基尔·唯茨在伍兹士堡警察局的现场报道
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.25,0:34:24.28,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我们希望能采访到 希德内·普里斯科特
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.36,0:34:25.58,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨，注意，女士
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.59,0:34:28.32,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨，拿开你的手， 你知道我是谁吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.39,0:34:31.36,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉他们 没事，爸爸告诉他们！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.43,0:34:33.46,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他正在等律师，比利 - 希德内！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.53,0:34:35.76,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,希德内，快点！ 你了解我
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.83,0:34:38.63,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,希德内，看看我
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.70,0:34:41.14,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,快点！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.44,0:34:49.47,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,希德，我们离开这里吧，好吗？ 你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.18,0:34:55.02,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,这种面具在每个廉价店里都有卖
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.09,0:34:57.75,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,不可能从这里找出线索
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.82,0:35:00.09,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,那个手机帐单记录怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.16,0:35:03.93,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,正在检查卢米斯的帐号， 明早才有结果
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.00,0:35:07.40,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,噢，快点！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.47,0:35:08.85,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你认为是他干的？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.85,0:35:11.20,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,二十年前，我会说“绝对不会”
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.27,0:35:16.07,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,但是现在的孩子... 谁知道呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.14,0:35:19.37,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 嘿，杜威，我们可以走了吗？ - 等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.45,0:35:22.81,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 讨厌，杜威！ - 妈妈是怎么跟你说的？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.88,0:35:25.51,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,当我戴上这警徽时， 你应该把我当成执法人员！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.58,0:35:27.78,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起，副治安官杜威朋友， 我们准备走了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.85,0:35:30.85,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 现在，好不好？ -  哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.92,0:35:34.88,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,带他们从后面走 避开前门那些耍杂的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.96,0:35:37.90,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 来吧 - 别碰我！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.96,0:35:41.40,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他是我的上级 - 看门的才是你的上级呢
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.84,0:35:45.77,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,来，大家开始工作！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.48,0:35:54.28,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这栋楼有没有后门？ - 有
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.35,0:35:56.78,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,应该是顺着这条小路
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.65,0:36:02.59,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你们呆在这儿， 我去取车
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.65,0:36:04.59,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,别走开，别出声
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.33,0:36:09.32,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,她在那儿希德内！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.39,0:36:12.56,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨，真是 发生什么了？你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.63,0:36:15.00,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,她不会回答你的问题的 别烦我们
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.07,0:36:17.50,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,不，塔特姆，没事 人家只是在工作而已是吧，基尔？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.57,0:36:21.01,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是呀，没错 - 那本书怎样了？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.07,0:36:23.06,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,艾今年迟些时候才能出来
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.14,0:36:25.44,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,哦，我一定会看的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.51,0:36:28.41,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我会送你一本的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.48,0:36:30.64,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.72,0:36:33.28,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,-  干得好！ -  婊子
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.35,0:36:34.79,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,不，我是说摄像干得不错
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.79,0:36:36.45,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你从哪儿学会这样打人的？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.52,0:36:39.46,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,老天，我真喜欢这个 “我会送你一本的”
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.53,0:36:41.46,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,梆！婊子倒下了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.53,0:36:45.73,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,“我会送你一本的” 梆！希德... 超级婊子！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.80,0:36:47.73,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你真是太酷了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.80,0:36:50.10,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,打出那记右勾拳后， 你的手可能需要些冰块
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.17,0:36:52.33,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.40,0:36:56.10,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我就在隔壁，想睡一会
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.18,0:36:58.11,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧，好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.75,0:37:05.95,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你真认为是比利干的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.02,0:37:07.95,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,他当时在那儿，塔特姆
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.02,0:37:12.51,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,人注定会有缺陷的， 他以前在我眼里太完美了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.59,0:37:15.03,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,电话，亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.09,0:37:17.03,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是谁？ - 找希德的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.10,0:37:18.86,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我爸爸？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.93,0:37:21.80,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 恐怕不是 -  叫他留言
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.87,0:37:23.80,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,不，嗯，我来接
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.74,0:37:30.14,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,她怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.21,0:37:34.18,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.25,0:37:36.54,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你好，希德内
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.62,0:37:38.74,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,不！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.82,0:37:40.75,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你男朋友比利真可怜
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.82,0:37:43.65,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,那个无辜的家伙，再也 没有机会和你在一起了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.72,0:37:47.95,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 放过我！ - 看起来你又一次指控错人了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.03,0:37:50.52,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你是谁？ - 杜威！ - 挂电话，希德
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.60,0:37:53.72,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,别担心你很快就会知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.80,0:37:56.70,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我发誓
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.77,0:37:58.70,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.77,0:38:03.71,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？ - 怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.35,0:38:11.28,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,喂？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.83,0:38:25.59,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,昨晚逃过了那场恶性袭击事件的希德内·普里斯科特
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.66,0:38:27.60,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,是毛里恩·普里斯科特的女儿...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.67,0:38:30.07,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,毛里恩去年被残忍地谋杀...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.14,0:38:32.47,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,已被裁定有罪的凶手科顿·威而瑞，当时闯入他们家里
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.54,0:38:35.10,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,野蛮地强奸并折磨了死者
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.17,0:38:38.34,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,科顿·威而瑞目前正在 为其死刑判决上诉...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.41,0:38:41.57,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,在年轻的希德内指证他后， 他被判处死罪
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.65,0:38:44.41,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,她是那个案件中的关键证人...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.69,0:38:49.28,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,他们真是没完没了，是吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.35,0:38:52.08,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,比利被释放了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.16,0:38:56.72,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,他的手机记录没有问题， 不是他打的那些电话
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.80,0:38:59.32,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我们正在检查本县内 所有手机的通话记录
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.40,0:39:03.80,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,所有打给你或凯西·贝克尔 的电话都会被对照参考
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.87,0:39:06.46,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,需要些时间，但我们一定会找到他的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.54,0:39:09.06,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.66,0:39:28.59,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,别担心，希德，这儿是学校 你会很安全的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.66,0:39:31.09,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,差一点儿就被残忍地宰割， 你有什么感想？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.16,0:39:34.46,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 嘿，别烦她！ - 人们想知道他们有权知道
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.53,0:39:36.47,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,-  别烦她 - 感觉如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.54,0:39:40.10,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,她只是来上学的把那些东西关掉
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.17,0:39:42.61,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.67,0:39:45.77,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,等一会儿
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.25,0:39:57.62,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,停那儿别动
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.69,0:39:59.99,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是来打架的 我需要和你谈谈
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.06,0:40:01.39,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,肯尼，马上准备摄象机！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.39,0:40:02.62,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,不用记录，不要摄像
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.69,0:40:05.82,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 忘了吧 - 什么？你欠我的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.90,0:40:08.37,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我欠你狗屎啊 - 你欠我母亲的！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.30,0:40:13.14,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你母亲的谋杀案是去年最轰动的庭案
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.21,0:40:15.23,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,总会有个人为此写书的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.31,0:40:18.24,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,并且这个人还就得像你一样，充满了谎言和狗屎理论
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.31,0:40:21.11,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你有什么毛部 你还想要什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.18,0:40:22.97,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,科顿·威而瑞被关进监狱了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.98,0:40:25.41,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,并将被执行毒刑 一本书根本改变不了这个
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.85,0:40:30.69,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你还认为他是无辜的？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.76,0:40:33.55,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你的证词使他定罪 我怎么想根本无关紧要
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.63,0:40:37.58,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,当时审讯时，你就编造了那些故事， 还说我在撒谎
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.66,0:40:39.86,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,是的，我认为你认错人了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.93,0:40:43.50,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你跟科顿谈过吗？ - 很多次
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.63,0:40:45.46,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,那你对他所说的那些故事改变过吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.53,0:40:47.47,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,一点儿也没有
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.54,0:40:50.10,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,他只承认和你母亲有过性关系
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.17,0:40:52.44,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,他在撒谎， 我母亲根本碰都不会碰他
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.51,0:40:54.91,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,他强奸了她，并且...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.98,0:40:57.88,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,肢解了她 他的外套上占满了我妈的血
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.95,0:40:59.88,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,他那天晚上喝多了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.95,0:41:02.68,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你妈引诱他后，他把外套落在你家了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.75,0:41:04.18,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我看见他离开时穿着
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.18,0:41:06.92,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,不，你看见的是另 一个人穿的那件外套
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.99,0:41:12.59,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,那个人又把外套放进科顿的车里， 陷害他
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.66,0:41:16.79,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,不，科顿杀了我妈
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.03,0:41:21.56,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你不像以前那样确信了，是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.11,0:41:26.94,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,脸肿得好漂亮艾亲爱的 我们走，希德
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.01,0:41:28.94,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,杀手还在逍遥法外，对不？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.01,0:41:31.41,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 走吧，希德 - 这些谋杀是有联系的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.48,0:41:34.28,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起，我把你的脸打肿了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.35,0:41:37.44,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 希德内，别走！ - 别跟来，知道不？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.99,0:41:44.93,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,老天！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.99,0:41:48.16,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,无辜的人等着被执行死刑， 而真正的凶手却逍遥法外
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.23,0:41:49.67,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,肯尼，告诉我我是在做梦
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.67,0:41:50.99,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你想现场直播这些？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.07,0:41:52.93,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,别着急，我们还没有确切的线索
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.93,0:41:54.33,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你不能一直拖延下去
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.40,0:41:57.50,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道！ 这就是为什么我们迫切需要证据
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.57,0:42:01.63,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我这次对了， 我就挽救了一个人的生命
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.71,0:42:05.08,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道那会对我写的书 的销量有什么样的影响吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.15,0:42:07.62,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,这真是个错误，我不该在这儿的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.68,0:42:11.98,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望你下课后来这儿 见我好吗，希德内？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.05,0:42:14.35,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.42,0:42:19.09,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿，怎么没见到比利 难道他真的很恼火？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.16,0:42:21.29,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,哦，你以为你只是 把糖纸贴在他身上？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.36,0:42:23.33,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不，他是伤心透了哎哟！ - 斯图！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.51,0:42:34.44,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,他们为什么要这样？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.51,0:42:37.81,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你开玩笑吗？ 看看这周围，像是过圣诞
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.88,0:42:40.94,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 别犯傻了 - 哎哟，轻点
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.02,0:42:43.78,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,希德内！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.85,0:42:45.91,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 哎哟！ - 老天，真是！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.99,0:42:48.75,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,是我
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.82,0:42:52.32,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,哇，哇，哇，哇 你还认为是我干的？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.39,0:42:54.83,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,不，不，我不是
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.90,0:42:58.33,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,只是... 确实有人在那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.40,0:43:00.39,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,比利，有人想杀我
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.47,0:43:02.89,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道，我知道警察说我把他吓走了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.89,0:43:04.41,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,那人不是我，希德内
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.47,0:43:08.88,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道昨晚在塔特姆家里，他又打电话给我了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.94,0:43:11.74,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你看，那不可能是我我在监狱
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.81,0:43:13.75,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,记得吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.15,0:43:18.59,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,非常对...对不起 请理解我
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.65,0:43:20.59,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,理解什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.66,0:43:23.18,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,难道是我有一个宁愿指控我为...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.26,0:43:25.99,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,变态杀手，而不愿摸摸我的女友？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.06,0:43:29.19,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道你说的不是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.27,0:43:32.03,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那是什么？ - 什么...是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.10,0:43:34.90,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,比利，我昨晚被袭击， 差点儿被大卸八块！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.97,0:43:36.90,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我是说我们之间的关系
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.97,0:43:39.77,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你变了，自从...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.31,0:43:44.04,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你妈妈死后 - 你脑子又问题呀？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.11,0:43:46.60,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我妈被谋杀了 真不能相信你又提起这档子事
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.68,0:43:50.91,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 已经一年了 - 明天！到明天一年
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.99,0:43:52.92,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得现在是该你从 中恢复过来的时侯了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.99,0:43:55.10,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,当我妈离开我爸的时侯， 我接受了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.10,0:43:56.29,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,事情就是这个样子的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.36,0:43:58.26,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,她不会再回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.33,0:44:01.42,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你父母离婚了 这不是一码事
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.50,0:44:02.92,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你妈只是离开了我们镇
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.92,0:44:04.47,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,并没有呆在某处的一个棺材里
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.53,0:44:07.56,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧，好吧，对不起 这真是一个糟糕的比较
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.64,0:44:09.90,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是想...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.97,0:44:12.96,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,让我以前样子的女友恢复回来
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.28,0:44:17.21,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,希德！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.28,0:44:19.21,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,比利，对不起， 如果我受到创伤的生活...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.28,0:44:22.22,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,给你和你完美的存在 造成了不便的话
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.28,0:44:25.45,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？什... 没人那样说，希德！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.19,0:44:29.12,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,真蠢
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.19,0:44:31.35,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你们使我恶心！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.43,0:44:35.89,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你们这些破坏狂、小偷 及娼妓的一代真令我恶心！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.97,0:44:40.40,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你们中的两个学生...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.47,0:44:42.66,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,刚被残忍地谋杀了...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.74,0:44:45.97,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,难道这就是你们表现出 的同情心和伤感吗，嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.04,0:44:49.41,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我告诉你们， 你们俩都被开除了！滚！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.48,0:44:52.74,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,得了，希伯瑞先生！ 这只是个玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.82,0:44:54.75,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,这太不公平了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.89,0:45:00.58,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你说得对极了， 这就是不公平
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.66,0:45:02.99,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,如果公平的话，我就该 把你们的肠子都挖出来...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.06,0:45:05.19,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,再把你们吊在树上，让那些...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.26,0:45:08.25,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,像你们一样无情无义，没有丝毫感觉的小杂种们都来看
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.34,0:45:23.28,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,她没有被袭击过 我觉得一切都是她编的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.35,0:45:25.61,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,-  那她为什么要撒谎 - 为了吸引注意力呗
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.68,0:45:27.95,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,那个女孩有严重的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.06,0:45:35.99,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,如果是她干的呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.06,0:45:38.53,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,如果是希德内杀了凯西和史迪夫呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.59,0:45:40.53,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,她为什么要那样干？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.60,0:45:43.90,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,可能是她特别想上史迪夫， 因为嫉妒而杀了他们俩
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.97,0:45:46.11,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么希德内想上史迪夫？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.11,0:45:48.90,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,她自己有个翘屁股的性感男友比利呀？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.97,0:45:52.37,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,有可能她也是个荡妇， 就象她妈一样
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.44,0:45:55.74,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你真恶毒 - 得了，这是常识
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.81,0:45:57.02,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,她妈是个妓女
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.02,0:45:59.75,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,如果有机会，她会看着她妈被杀的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.82,0:46:02.05,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,想想看，那会使她多么兴奋呀
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.12,0:46:04.71,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,她妈的死使她心理变得不正常， 还充满敌意
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.79,0:46:08.35,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,在这个残酷而不公平的世界， 她太天真妄想了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.42,0:46:11.39,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,如“上帝在哪儿呀？”，等等等等， 完全是自取灭亡
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.46,0:46:14.22,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,有一天她突然受不了， 她想自杀...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.30,0:46:17.73,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,但是她认识到今年少女 自杀已经过时了...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.80,0:46:21.74,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,谋杀会更有利于健康， 如果从治疗学上来表述的话
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.80,0:46:23.22,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你从哪儿学到的这些狗屁？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.22,0:46:24.74,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,Ricki Lake说的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.81,0:46:27.94,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你真是可悲呀
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.86,0:46:43.35,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,可悲的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.39,0:47:12.58,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,希德内
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.19,0:47:19.13,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,有人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.80,0:48:00.73,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,在看起来是恶作剧的事件中...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.80,0:48:03.46,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,有人看见几个学生戴着恐怖面具
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.54,0:48:05.47,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,学校当局还没有对此发表评论...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.54,0:48:09.41,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,现在知道这些面具和 凶手戴的是一样的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.48,0:48:11.77,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,17岁的凯西·贝克尔和她的男友
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.77,0:48:13.61,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,史迪夫·厄斯已经被杀了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.68,0:48:15.62,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,谁是下一个呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.68,0:48:19.52,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以确切地感觉到 恐惧弥漫在这校园中
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.59,0:48:22.65,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨！我是基尔·唯茨，《头条消息》的现场记者
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.72,0:48:24.66,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你是谁， 唯茨小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.73,0:48:29.13,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 眼睛怎么样？ - 快好了校园里有什么问题吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.20,0:48:31.13,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,没有，一切都在控制中
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.20,0:48:34.83,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 当然，你在这儿嘛 - 可是你不该在这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.90,0:48:37.93,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道我应该在纽约报道 骚扰莎朗·斯通的人...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.01,0:48:39.94,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,但是谁知道呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.01,0:48:42.50,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你看起来这么年轻， 不像一个警官呀
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.58,0:48:45.17,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经25了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.25,0:48:47.18,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,知道吗，在一项统计调查中...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.25,0:48:50.65,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我最受11到24岁的男性观众欢迎
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.72,0:48:53.03,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,看来我正好错过了你这个年纪
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.03,0:48:55.18,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,不过，你看起来还不到12岁
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.26,0:48:57.59,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,要是不看你强壮的躯干的话
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.66,0:49:00.99,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是警察都要求锻炼吗？ - 不，女士
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.06,0:49:03.00,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,那是为了弥补我这张孩子 气的漂亮脸蛋儿...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.07,0:49:06.87,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,如果有一身肌肉的话， 可以增加我当高级警官的机会
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.94,0:49:09.64,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,同学们，请注意
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.77,0:49:11.71,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,由于最近发生的事件...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.77,0:49:15.77,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,学校决定停课，何时开课另行通知 此项宣布立即生效
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.84,0:49:20.41,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,伍兹士堡警察局发布 了全城范围的宵禁令...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.48,0:49:24.25,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,从今天晚上9点开始
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.32,0:49:26.25,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,看样子我们遇到了一个连环杀手
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.32,0:49:28.29,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,“连环杀手”这词并不准确
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.36,0:49:31.19,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,凶手只有再杀几个 才能得到这个头衔
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.26,0:49:34.29,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,艾我们有这个希望，不是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.36,0:49:37.46,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我的意思是，我们确实没有任何线索
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.53,0:49:40.63,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你找到了希德内的父亲了吗？ - 还没有
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.70,0:49:42.84,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,他不是嫌疑人，对不？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.84,0:49:46.04,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我们还没有排除他的...可能性
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.11,0:49:49.60,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 失陪了 - 对不起，我妨碍了你吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.68,0:49:53.44,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,可以这样说，唯茨小姐...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.52,0:49:57.04,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你真人看起来漂亮多了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.12,0:49:59.28,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,那你真的看我的节目了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.92,0:50:06.05,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我今年25 我去年一年都是24
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.13,0:50:09.43,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,请叫我基尔吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.50,0:50:11.83,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,那只是某些病态的杂种 假扮了逗你的，希德内
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.90,0:50:14.13,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,不，是他，塔特姆 我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.20,0:50:16.25,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你不要再一个人去卫生间了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.25,0:50:18.14,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你去，我也去明白吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.88,0:50:22.81,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我不管你做了什么，希德内
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.88,0:50:24.97,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,但是代表全体学生， 我们要说：“谢谢你”
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.05,0:50:27.48,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 别说了，斯图 - 我宣布...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.55,0:50:30.31,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚在我家举办一个即兴聚会，
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.39,0:50:32.32,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,来庆祝学校的停课 你说如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.39,0:50:34.32,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你是认真的？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.39,0:50:36.32,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,差不多吧，你这个小泼妇...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.39,0:50:38.69,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,放心吧，不会邀请所有人的
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.76,0:50:41.19,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,只是几个老朋友亲密的聚会
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.26,0:50:43.20,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你说怎么样，希德？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.27,0:50:45.20,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我的意思是，老这样痛苦也不是办法， 来轻松一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.27,0:50:47.70,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,安全方面绝对没有问题 喱你看我是多么强壮
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.77,0:50:49.83,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,姑娘们，我会保护你们的
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.91,0:50:53.84,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧，希德 给我个面子，很好玩的
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.84,0:50:57.14,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,既然这样，好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.21,0:50:59.15,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗？太好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.21,0:51:01.15,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,棒极了你们带食品，好不好？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.13,0:51:21.07,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.14,0:51:23.07,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,谁呀？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.57,0:52:00.80,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他妈的小混蛋 - 你叫我什么？嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.88,0:52:03.64,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不是说你，弗雷德 -  你个笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.20,0:52:57.65,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,啊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.73,0:52:59.86,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.71,0:53:11.91,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,学校放暑假了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.49,0:53:13.19,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,学校放假了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.19,0:53:15.42,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,如果科顿·威而瑞说的是真的， 怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.49,0:53:18.69,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,他也许的确和你妈妈有一腿
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.76,0:53:22.82,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我的意思是， 你爸爸常常出差不在家也许...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.90,0:53:25.99,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,也许你妈妈只是一个 非常不快乐的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.07,0:53:27.60,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,如果他们真的有一腿
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.60,0:53:30.06,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,那科顿为什么不能在法庭上证明？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.14,0:53:32.44,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯，谣言是没法被证明的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.44,0:53:34.94,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是为什么叫谣言的缘故
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.01,0:53:39.07,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,对，是那个白痴小报记者 基尔·唯茨造的谣
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.41,0:53:43.01,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,背后还有更多的，希德
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.08,0:53:46.02,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,还有有关和其他男人的传闻
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.09,0:53:48.58,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,那你相信了？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.65,0:53:54.46,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,唉，谣言听得太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.53,0:53:57.46,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你就不得不开始相信
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.30,0:54:03.39,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,哎，对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.97,0:54:08.91,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你-你知道，如果我对科顿·威而瑞 的指控错了的话
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.97,0:54:10.91,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,那么...凶手还在那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.98,0:54:12.91,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,不要去那儿，希德
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.98,0:54:16.11,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你说的听起来像韦斯和卡彭特，拍的电影之类的东东了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.18,0:54:20.12,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,别想得太多，好不？我们还要度过 一个很长的夜晚呢
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.19,0:54:23.12,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,让我们跳起来
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.79,0:54:28.73,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,还是活的！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.79,0:54:32.73,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 亨利   - 噢，以上帝的名义，现在我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.80,0:54:34.73,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起，伙计
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.50,0:54:38.44,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 注意点，呆子 - 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.84,0:54:42.77,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.84,0:54:45.21,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.28,0:54:48.21,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,老天，今儿晚上这里可真挤呀，老兄
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.28,0:54:50.39,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,来租多重谋杀案之类的片子的人可真多
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.39,0:54:51.72,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,参加我家的聚会吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.78,0:54:54.31,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,当然，今天我放工早 你知道，有宵禁
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.39,0:54:57.32,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,那个狼人的电影叫什么？ 里面还有E.T.的妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.39,0:54:59.47,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,是《狼嗥》，恐怖片区一直往前就是
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.47,0:55:00.45,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,好的，谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.03,0:55:04.79,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,噢，现在那种片子根本不对人的胃口了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.79,0:55:05.66,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.73,0:55:09.67,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,如果在一场毫无意义的大屠杀中，只有一个人是嫌疑犯
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.74,0:55:12.32,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你还会看吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.37,0:55:16.27,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？那只是一个误会 不是他干的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.34,0:55:18.28,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你真是个小哈巴狗
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.34,0:55:21.09,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你看，他的整个额头上都写着“杀手”两个字
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.09,0:55:21.80,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.88,0:55:25.58,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗？ 那警察为什么把他放了，大葱头？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.65,0:55:29.75,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,显然他们看的电影还不够多，这是标准的恐怖电影情节
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.82,0:55:32.01,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,简直是《毕业舞会之夜》再现，老兄
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.02,0:55:34.45,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗？那他为什么想杀自己的女朋友？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.53,0:55:37.59,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,总会有那么些愚蠢而没道理的，原因去杀自己的女朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.66,0:55:41.22,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 哦？ - 这就是整个事情的可取之处：简单
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.30,0:55:44.96,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,再说了，如果搞得太复杂， 你把观众都吓跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.04,0:55:47.10,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,那好，可是他的动机是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.17,0:55:49.64,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,也许希德内不愿和他上床
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.71,0:55:52.39,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？难道她 准备把第一次留给你？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.39,0:55:53.20,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,有可能
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.28,0:55:57.94,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,既然现在比利要害她，你说希德会不会跟我出去约会？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.45,0:56:05.82,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,不，打死我也不会这样认为 不可能的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.89,0:56:09.26,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道我觉得是谁干的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.33,0:56:11.96,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,知道吗？我觉得是她老爹干的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.03,0:56:14.46,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,老兄，知道他们为什么找不到她老爹？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.53,0:56:16.63,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,因为他有可能已经死了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.70,0:56:20.26,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,他的尸体最后肯定会在某处出现！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.34,0:56:24.24,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,眼珠被挖了出来，手指被割了下来，牙齿也被敲掉了！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.31,0:56:27.04,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 警察在这些案件中总是找错了方向 - 哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.11,0:56:28.50,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,如果他们看了《毕业舞会之夜》
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.50,0:56:29.55,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,他们就不会费那么多时间了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.61,0:56:31.59,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,有一个规则，很简单的一个规则
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.59,0:56:33.57,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是：每个人都是嫌疑犯！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.92,0:56:42.33,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我告诉你，她父亲只是一个烟幕弹 真凶是比利
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.90,0:56:46.83,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我们怎么知道你不是凶手呢？嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.90,0:56:49.42,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 嗯？ - 嗨，比利
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.50,0:56:50.97,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你想没有，你是不是看电影看糊涂了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.97,0:56:52.87,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,已经分不清什么是现实， 什么是电影里的了？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.94,0:56:55.87,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你说的很对我现在第一个承认这点
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.94,0:56:58.57,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,如果这是一场恐怖电影，那我就是 头号嫌疑犯
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.58,0:56:59.38,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,这就对了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.44,0:57:01.38,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,那你的动机是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.45,0:57:03.61,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,都快到新世纪了，
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.68,0:57:05.62,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,动机根本不重要
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.68,0:57:07.67,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,“新世纪”，嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.75,0:57:09.32,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,“新世纪”，我喜欢这个 很好，现在是新世纪
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.32,0:57:12.05,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,“新世纪”，我喜欢这个 很好，现在是新世纪
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.16,0:57:15.09,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,好孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.23,0:57:19.36,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,“新世纪”，好词，老兄
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.43,0:57:21.40,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你是说他不是杀手吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.14,0:58:08.08,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,多么安静呀
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.15,0:58:10.08,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,天哪，看看这个地方
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.15,0:58:12.51,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,太像《杀出魔鬼镇》里的镜头了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.58,0:58:13.86,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,是艾我也看过那个电影
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.86,0:58:16.02,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,讲的是德州一个杀手的故事，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.09,0:58:18.02,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 嗯 - 嗨，希德，你想一想，
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.09,0:58:21.03,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,如果有人要拍一个有关你的电影， 你说谁会来演你？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.09,0:58:22.51,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我有点害怕去想这个
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.51,0:58:24.69,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我看你就像年轻时的梅格·瑞恩
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.76,0:58:26.48,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢，杜威如果我猜得准的话
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.48,0:58:28.20,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,他们会让托瑞·斯培林去演的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.27,0:58:31.20,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我只需要几分钟时间
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.27,0:58:33.20,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你们不要走得太远了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.71,0:58:37.64,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,比利今晚会来吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.71,0:58:40.77,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,他最好别来 我已经叫斯图别告诉他了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.85,0:58:43.78,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我想我们可以忘掉痛苦， 快乐地过一个晚上
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.45,0:58:48.89,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,比利说得对，你知道 他一摸我，我就感到不自在
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.95,0:58:52.55,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,可能是你妈妈死得太早，影响了你这方面的正常发展
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.62,0:58:55.12,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么大不了的， 你心头的冰块会融化的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.19,0:58:58.63,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,是艾可是他在性这 方面已经够有耐心了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.70,0:59:02.36,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你说有几个男孩子能 忍受性冷淡的女友呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.43,0:59:05.37,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,比利和他的阳具配不上你，好不好？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.81,0:59:15.75,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,杜威，你他妈跑哪儿去了？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.81,0:59:18.75,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直在看着希德内，嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.09,0:59:24.68,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你不是戒了吗？ - 是戒了，但是他妈的...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.76,0:59:28.06,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,杜威，威特尔电话公司刚刚 给我们发来了传真
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.13,0:59:30.47,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,那些电话是属于尼尔·普里斯科特
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.48,0:59:32.53,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是希德内老爹的帐户上的
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.60,0:59:36.23,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,现在已经证实是他用手机打的
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.50,0:59:40.44,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,难道不可能复制一个同样的手机吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.51,0:59:43.27,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,还有，猜猜看明天是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.34,0:59:45.87,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,是他老婆死去的周年纪念日
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.78,0:59:51.72,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,今天整个晚上，我们都要设置路障， 并执行宵禁令
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.78,0:59:55.08,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,如果到早上还没有抓到他， 我们就要挨家挨户去搜查
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.22,0:59:58.16,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 希德内在哪儿？ - 她和我妹妹在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.22,1:00:01.75,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你想让我把她带到这儿吗？ - 不用了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.83,1:00:03.76,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,还不到时侯
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.83,1:00:07.27,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,让我们先找到尼尔， 确认他是我们想要的真凶
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.61,1:00:17.20,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你要好好看着希德内
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.28,1:00:19.87,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,别让她离开你的视线
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.95,1:00:22.21,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,是，长官
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.92,1:00:59.15,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,好了，姑娘们，你们去玩吧
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.22,1:01:02.15,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,别太过火了，否则把你们都捉起来
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.42,1:01:05.36,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 拜 - 拜，希德
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.14,1:01:20.07,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我们来了，孩子们！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.47,1:01:24.41,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,噢！真可笑
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.48,1:01:27.41,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你们办事太拖拉了， 晚会已经开始了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.48,1:01:29.45,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,不错，哥儿们！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.16,1:01:46.10,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,嘘
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.30,1:01:49.23,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我们被发现了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.30,1:01:52.24,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,不会的去拿摄像机
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.77,1:01:57.11,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起，我不是故意吓你的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.18,1:02:00.37,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 副警长，没事儿 - 你怎么也来这个聚会了？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.45,1:02:04.58,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,是艾 你根本不知道何时何地出现新闻
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.65,1:02:08.71,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,这儿没什么新闻， 只是一帮孩子在闹哄
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.79,1:02:11.52,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,那你在这儿干什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.13,1:02:16.56,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,只是在这里看着他们
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.63,1:02:19.56,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我要去看看聚会怎么样了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.63,1:02:23.07,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 介意我跟你一块去吗？ - 一点儿也不
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.14,1:02:27.43,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,等我先拿一下外套，谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.64,1:02:35.61,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好了 - 没关系的
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.68,1:02:37.61,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,哦！对了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.78,1:02:42.72,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 谁看《尸变》？ - 一个！两个！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.79,1:02:45.09,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 谁看《猛鬼追魂》？ - 我看
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.16,1:02:48.59,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,像《冤魂不息》，《死亡列车》，《毕业舞会之夜》
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.66,1:02:52.10,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么每个片子里都有 杰米·李·柯蒂斯呀？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.16,1:02:54.69,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,她是...尖叫之皇后
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.77,1:02:57.96,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 看看她那样的肺，不是才怪呢 - 是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.04,1:02:59.59,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,是胸部，明白吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.67,1:03:01.61,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,哦，我去开
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.17,1:03:05.61,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨，塔特，再拿一瓶啤酒来，好吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.68,1:03:08.08,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,车库里有更多的啤酒
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.15,1:03:10.08,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,把我当什么了？啤酒侍应？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.15,1:03:13.08,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 她因为《死亡列车》而被提名 - 哦，是吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.15,1:03:16.09,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你们不会相信谁来了 是那个《头条消息》的女的
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.15,1:03:18.05,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 基尔·唯茨？ - 是她，没错
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.99,1:03:22.93,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,小子，你还不到年纪
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.99,1:03:24.93,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,开个玩笑好好玩
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.00,1:03:26.79,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,-  杜威 - 嗨
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.87,1:03:29.93,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,杜威
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.00,1:03:33.10,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 她来这儿干什么？ - 她跟我一起来的
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.17,1:03:35.57,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我只是来查看查看 - 既然已经看过了，
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.64,1:03:40.01,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你快点离开这儿吧， 把你的小道消息跟班也带走
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.51,1:03:44.28,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我觉得你真是了不起 - 哦，非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.35,1:03:46.28,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我一直忠实地看你的节目 - 太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.35,1:03:48.75,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 嗨 - 嗨
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.82,1:03:51.41,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要一个相机
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.49,1:03:54.75,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 找到我爸爸了吗？ - 恐怕还没有
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.53,1:03:58.96,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,-  我该担心吗？ -  现在还不必
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.07,1:04:04.56,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,那是我想看的《鬼节》
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.12,1:04:27.15,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,唔
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.11,1:04:50.74,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,天哪！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.12,1:04:55.71,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,塔特姆，没事儿的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.50,1:05:07.43,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.94,1:05:13.87,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨，讨厌鬼！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.44,1:05:17.37,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,喂！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.71,1:05:21.70,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,混蛋，真讨厌
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.96,1:05:40.59,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,是你吗，兰迪？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.17,1:05:45.20,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,好了，这又是从哪出电影学来的？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.20,1:05:46.60,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,是《我唾弃你的坟墓》？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.01,1:05:51.34,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,把面具脱了吧 要是希德内看到了，她会发疯的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.41,1:05:54.34,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,哦，你想扮变态杀手？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.41,1:05:57.11,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以扮无助的受害者吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.18,1:06:00.62,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧，我们来...  不，请别杀我，鬼脸先生
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.69,1:06:03.21,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我还想演续集呢
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.59,1:06:07.85,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,停，小鬼头 电影结束了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.69,1:06:13.06,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,兰迪，你究竟想干什么？啊
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.38,1:06:21.17,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.38,1:06:30.01,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.09,1:06:32.18,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.31,1:06:59.70,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,啊啊
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.11,1:07:13.17,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 宵禁快乐 - 晚会不错，斯图
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.24,1:07:14.12,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,塔特姆，快来！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.12,1:07:16.18,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,这儿除了我们几个女的， 没有别人了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.25,1:07:17.52,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道她在哪儿吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.52,1:07:19.21,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道， 我一直没有见到她
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.28,1:07:21.15,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.22,1:07:23.78,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,噢，比利，嗨
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.85,1:07:25.79,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,比利，嗯 你来这儿干什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.85,1:07:28.65,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望和希德单独谈谈
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.72,1:07:31.89,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道，要是塔特姆看见你在这儿， 她会不高兴的
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.96,1:07:34.90,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你们为什么不去我父母房里呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.96,1:07:38.40,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,在那儿，你们可以谈话， 或干其它别的
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.47,1:07:40.90,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,斯图，注意点你的语气
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.04,1:07:45.01,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,不，没-没关系 我们是需要谈谈
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.31,1:07:49.30,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,唔！哈
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.48,1:07:56.42,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,这个杀人狂来干吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.49,1:07:59.08,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,别装了他是来弥补关系的
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.15,1:08:02.09,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,那不没我的什么机会了，真倒霉
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.16,1:08:04.25,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,好像是我能说的就是这些喽
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.33,1:08:06.26,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,好像是
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.33,1:08:08.26,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,哦，真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.33,1:08:12.20,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,“好像是” 我要去看看他们
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.27,1:08:15.26,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 快点出来！ -  见到你们真是很高兴
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.57,1:08:20.84,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你真是个天才
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.91,1:08:23.17,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 哦，真倒霉 - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.25,1:08:25.68,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 信号有延时 -  多长延迟？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.75,1:08:29.68,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道你从那房子走到这儿 要花多长时间？30秒？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.75,1:08:33.19,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系，尽管录下来就是了 哇！放的位置真好
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.26,1:08:34.69,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 告诉我， 肯尼思... - 嗯？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.76,1:08:38.19,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,有没有一个下流小报记者 曾经赢得过普利策奖？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.26,1:08:40.46,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,唔，每件事情都有第一次的
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.53,1:08:42.46,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你简直太对了！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.04,1:08:50.97,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,那...，嗯...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.04,1:08:54.98,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,那...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.95,1:08:59.88,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.05,1:09:04.99,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我太自私了，我应该道歉
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.05,1:09:08.22,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,不，比利，我-我是...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.29,1:09:11.85,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,那个自私而又太专注于 自己的想法的人...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.93,1:09:14.73,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,都是由于这些受到创伤后的压力所致
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.07,1:09:20.06,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你失去了母亲 - 是的，我知道你说得对...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.14,1:09:22.07,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,什么事都有一个限度
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.14,1:09:25.07,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能一直沉浸在悲伤中...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.14,1:09:27.07,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,而且...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.64,1:09:30.58,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,而且，我不能...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.65,1:09:34.88,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,一直对自己撒谎， 认为我妈不是那样的人
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.69,1:09:40.45,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,是的，我觉得我真是被我的想法...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.03,1:09:45.29,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,吓坏了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.36,1:09:48.80,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道吗？ 我害怕有一天变成和我妈妈一样的人
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.93,1:09:53.42,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,类似《坏种》中的情节那样
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.50,1:09:56.47,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然我知道这些想法太荒唐
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.61,1:09:59.54,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,不，不荒唐
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.48,1:10:03.41,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.48,1:10:06.92,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,就像朱迪·福斯特在 《沉默的羔羊》中...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.98,1:10:10.92,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,不断地回忆自己死去的父亲那样
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.99,1:10:13.08,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,但是，这是现实生活
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.16,1:10:15.09,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是电影
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.16,1:10:17.68,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,不，这是，希德
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.76,1:10:19.69,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,所有的... 所有的都是一场电影
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.76,1:10:21.70,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,人生就像...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.76,1:10:23.70,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,一场巨大的电影
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.21,1:10:32.64,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,只是，你不能选择电影的类型
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.63,1:11:01.66,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,那我为什么在这场电影中不能 像梅格·瑞恩那样呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.71,1:11:07.70,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,或者，甚至出演一个高级脱星？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.25,1:11:12.18,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.25,1:11:14.18,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你听到了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.19,1:11:24.13,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.20,1:11:28.13,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.20,1:11:30.13,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,是真的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.95,1:11:49.04,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,注意，注意，注意， 快到了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.12,1:11:51.05,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 哇！ - 哦！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.12,1:11:52.85,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,那上面的血太不真实了！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.85,1:11:55.06,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,他们为什么用那个？太红了！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.12,1:11:57.09,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,等等，另一个快到了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.00,1:12:00.93,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 哇！哇！ - 好！好！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.00,1:12:03.43,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,太俗套了， 我早知道他要杀人
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.50,1:12:05.91,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你们怎么能忍受一遍又一遍 地看这种垃圾呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.91,1:12:06.43,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,嘘！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.50,1:12:08.94,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我想看杰米·李的波波
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.01,1:12:10.99,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我们什么时侯才能看到 杰米·李的波波？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.99,1:12:11.44,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,波波？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.51,1:12:13.87,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,直到83年的《交易场》才能看得到
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.94,1:12:16.38,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,杰米·李在恐怖电影中一直扮的是处女，
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.45,1:12:18.32,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,直到改演正统戏时才露出胸部
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.32,1:12:20.54,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,她那对长得又不好看
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.62,1:12:25.02,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是她最后的大追逐中总是 能够智胜杀手缘故
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.09,1:12:28.02,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,只有处女才能这样 你们知道这些规则吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.09,1:12:30.03,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 哪些规则？ - 你不知道...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.20,1:12:34.72,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,天哪！ 你不知道这些规则？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.80,1:12:36.86,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,有毛病艾我们为什么要知道？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.93,1:12:39.87,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,只有遵守几个必要的规则...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.94,1:12:42.80,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,一个人才能在恐怖电影中最后活下来
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.87,1:12:45.90,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,例如，规则一： 不能做爱
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.01,1:12:50.27,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,别！别这样！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.35,1:12:52.14,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,那我肯定会死的
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.22,1:12:54.15,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,做爱就等于死亡，知道不？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.22,1:12:57.31,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,规则二： 不能喝酒和吸毒
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.22,1:13:02.16,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,其实，是罪恶因素在起作用
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.23,1:13:05.16,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,喝酒吸毒是一种罪行 这也是规则一的扩展
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.23,1:13:08.93,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,规则三：在任何情况下， 从不要，绝对不要说...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.00,1:13:10.93,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,“我马上回来”， 因为你不可能回来了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.00,1:13:13.05,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我再去拿一瓶啤酒去， 你也想要吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.05,1:13:13.76,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,好的，当然
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.84,1:13:16.27,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我马上回来！ - 噢!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.64,1:13:20.13,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你不遵守规则，最后肯定会死
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.13,1:13:22.48,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧，我等会儿到厨房里去看你 插着刀子的尸体
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.55,1:13:25.98,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,只有处女才能在最后的大追逐中 智胜杀手
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.05,1:13:28.52,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你们知道这些规则吗？ - 哪些规则？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.58,1:13:30.52,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你不知道这些规则？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.59,1:13:34.22,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,只有遵守几个必要的规则， 才能在电影中活下来
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.22,1:13:34.78,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,无聊
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.86,1:13:36.79,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,例如
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.06,1:13:39.99,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,治安官刚刚无线电通知我，
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.06,1:13:42.86,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,有人报告说在这条路边的灌木丛里发现了一辆车
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.86,1:13:43.76,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我准备去查看一下
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.83,1:13:46.77,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 愿意跟我一起去吗？ - 很愿意
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.84,1:13:48.96,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你确信不会出问题的话
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.04,1:13:52.87,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,唉，女士， 我是这个镇上的副警长呀！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.38,1:13:56.31,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,马上回来
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.82,1:14:02.01,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你不遵守规则， 最后肯定会死
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.08,1:14:05.02,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 哦... 对不起，女士 - 嗯？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.09,1:14:07.02,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我想我们可以走过去
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.29,1:14:12.13,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,今天晚上外面天气真好 我有手电
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.43,1:14:16.73,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你没有害怕吧，对吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.80,1:14:18.70,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.77,1:14:21.29,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 走吧 - 太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.11,1:14:28.54,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你知道那是什么星座吗？ - 不知道那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.61,1:14:32.91,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不知道，所以才问你
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.15,1:14:38.09,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,塔特姆怎么了，斯图？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.15,1:14:41.02,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,她可能是生我气了，不知道跑哪儿 去了再见
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.09,1:14:45.03,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,没事，我只是开个玩笑
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.58,1:15:04.57,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,快看！必须有的波波秀来了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.25,1:15:10.19,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好！噢！太美了！ - 真可爱！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.25,1:15:12.19,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,哦！哦！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.26,1:15:14.95,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 哦，天哪！ - 你们慢慢看，我走了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.03,1:15:17.96,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你真是...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.53,1:15:21.46,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,令人惊叹
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.67,1:15:30.37,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,喂？什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.71,1:15:36.64,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,哦，老天哪！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.22,1:15:42.08,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,听着
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.15,1:15:43.98,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,他们发现校长希伯瑞死了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.20,1:15:47.46,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 嗨！嗨！ - 去看校长！去看校长！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.53,1:15:50.47,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他说他在哪儿？ - 在橄榄球场
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.53,1:15:53.77,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 快走！ - 你们都要去哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.84,1:15:57.27,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,快到最精彩的部分了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.34,1:16:00.80,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,喂？什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.89,1:16:14.12,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.07,1:16:26.13,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,哈-嗬, 让我们出发！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.20,1:16:29.33,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,那，杜...杜威是你的真名吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.41,1:16:31.34,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,不，真名是德怀特
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.41,1:16:33.34,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,德怀特？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.41,1:16:35.68,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 对不起 - 不，没关系
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.75,1:16:39.51,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,只是人们叫我杜威已经很长时间了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.58,1:16:42.02,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我喜欢这个名字
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.09,1:16:44.02,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,很性感
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.09,1:16:46.78,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 性感？ - 嗯...哼
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.86,1:16:50.29,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,呵，这个镇上的人并没有把我当回事
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.36,1:16:52.80,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,那他们是如何对基尔·唯茨的呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.86,1:16:55.96,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我这名字听起来就像气象学家之类的 什么东西一样
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.20,1:16:59.14,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,人们对我...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.20,1:17:01.60,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,就像我是电视新闻业里的老鼠屎一样
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.67,1:17:03.61,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我认为你并没有那么坏 - 没有？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.67,1:17:05.61,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 没有？ - 没有
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.68,1:17:07.61,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,那只是因为你有些喜欢我而已
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.68,1:17:10.41,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,他们真是开得太快了慢点！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.48,1:17:14.18,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,别动... 跳！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.25,1:17:18.19,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起，你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.26,1:17:20.19,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.94,1:17:33.80,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.87,1:17:35.81,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我正执行公务
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.18,1:17:46.12,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,那是你正在找的吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.18,1:17:48.12,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我一生中都在
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.19,1:17:55.12,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 该死！ - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.19,1:17:58.13,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？ - 这是尼尔·普里斯科特的汽车
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.20,1:18:00.13,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 希德内的父亲？ - 对
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.47,1:18:03.40,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,老天，他来这儿干什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.87,1:18:07.27,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我们快回去
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.41,1:18:12.34,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.94,1:18:15.88,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,当然
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.95,1:18:17.88,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,没事，我很好
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.56,1:18:30.69,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你打给谁了？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.76,1:18:32.63,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.70,1:18:36.63,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯，没什么当你被捕时，你 可以允许打一个电话
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.70,1:18:39.64,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是很好奇，你打给谁了？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.17,1:18:43.11,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,打给我爸了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.18,1:18:48.77,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,不会吧，嗯，治安官伯克打给他的 我看见了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.92,1:18:54.98,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,当然是，不过我打的时候，没人接
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.56,1:19:01.49,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,哼！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.10,1:19:09.19,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你不会还认为是我吧，是不是？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.60,1:19:14.57,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.64,1:19:16.57,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.64,1:19:17.66,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是在想
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.66,1:19:21.74,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,如果真是你的话，有一 个非常聪明的办法可以骗住我
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.81,1:19:26.48,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道，如果你当时打电话给我， 我就不会认为是你
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.55,1:19:28.81,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,真的？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.66,1:19:41.19,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我该怎么做才能使你相信我不是凶手？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.70,1:19:45.36,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 哎呀，天哪！ - 翱
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.60,1:19:48.94,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 哎呀，天哪！ - 希德内 - 比利，注意！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.01,1:19:51.41,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 啊 - 啊...！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.95,1:19:58.04,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,希德
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.39,1:20:32.65,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,糟了！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.36,1:20:40.06,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,救命！有人吗？救命！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.72,1:21:00.95,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,救命啦！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.12,1:21:33.98,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,不，杰米 艾注意
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.05,1:21:37.32,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,注意，杰米 你知道他在附近
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.39,1:21:40.36,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你...你知道的...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.43,1:21:42.92,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,注意，他来了 我告诉过你了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.00,1:21:45.38,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我告诉过你他就在那个角落里
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.43,1:21:47.42,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,杰米，杰米
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.87,1:21:52.57,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,杰米，注意身后 注意身后
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.64,1:21:55.23,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,转身 在你后面
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.31,1:21:58.87,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,一直都在你后面！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.95,1:22:01.24,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你身后，杰米
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.31,1:22:06.25,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,杰米，转身 噢！天哪！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.32,1:22:09.08,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,救命！救命！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.70,1:22:24.03,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,让我进去！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.10,1:22:27.83,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 杀手在追我！他在屋子里！ - 哪儿？等等
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.91,1:22:31.40,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 屋子里有一个摄像机，你看 - 在你身后！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.48,1:22:33.34,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 噢，天哪不 - 噢，糟糕
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.41,1:22:35.61,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,杰米，杰米
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.68,1:22:38.34,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你后面，孩子！ - 兰迪！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.42,1:22:41.18,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你身后！ -  往后看！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.06,1:22:45.46,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 糟糕 - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.52,1:22:47.99,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们有30秒的延时 - 噢，天哪
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.56,1:22:51.29,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.37,1:22:57.60,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,门...门
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.54,1:23:04.34,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.25,1:23:44.77,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你的车里有电话吗？ - 有
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.85,1:23:48.38,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,把自己锁在里面 快叫治安官来支援
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.89,1:23:51.82,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,小心点！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.97,1:24:08.84,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,尼尔？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.41,1:24:14.35,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,普里斯科特先生？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.48,1:24:18.42,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,靠！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.43,1:24:29.45,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,噢！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.83,1:24:37.20,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,肯尼，我需要手机！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.44,1:24:41.37,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,肯尼！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.11,1:24:46.48,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 肯尼！ -  肯尼！肯尼！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.77,1:25:10.39,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,9-1-1
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.47,1:25:13.34,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？  - 嚯！啊
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.41,1:25:15.74,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.55,1:25:27.52,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,噢，天哪！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.86,1:25:39.26,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.71,1:25:42.80,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,停！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.95,1:25:52.89,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,艾天哪！
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.10,1:26:03.07,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,杜威！
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.13,1:26:05.07,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,杜威！
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.14,1:26:08.97,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,杜威，你在哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.04,1:26:10.97,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,杜威1
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.04,1:26:13.67,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,希德内？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.75,1:26:20.74,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,杜威！
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.31,1:26:49.78,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.97,1:27:19.67,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,7825，嫌疑犯在北52街105号
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.74,1:27:22.94,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,喂请快救我我在特纳道上的 斯图·马克家
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.01,1:27:27.38,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是特纳道261号 请快点，他想杀我
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.87,1:27:53.10,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,希德内！希德内！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.18,1:27:55.61,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,天哪，我们快离开这个鬼地方吧！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.68,1:27:56.58,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,停那儿别动！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.58,1:27:59.05,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,别开枪，是我！ 我找到了塔特姆，她死了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.12,1:28:01.11,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我认为是斯图干的 - 别听他的，希德内！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.19,1:28:03.12,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 别过来！ - 斯图干的
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.19,1:28:05.75,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他杀了比利他杀了我的塔特姆  - 是你杀的！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.82,1:28:06.91,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他杀了我的塔特姆！  - 不，我没有！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.91,1:28:07.22,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你撒谎！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.22,1:28:07.64,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,他杀了我的塔特姆！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.64,1:28:08.16,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不，我没有！ - 你撒谎！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.23,1:28:10.46,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,希德内，乖乖，请把枪给我！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.53,1:28:12.50,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,把枪给我！老天！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.56,1:28:14.93,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,不，不是我 希德，是他杀的
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.00,1:28:17.39,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,他杀的，希德内！请相信， 不是我杀的
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.39,1:28:18.53,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,是他杀的，相信我！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.60,1:28:21.13,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 请相信我，希德内噢！ - 滚你们俩儿的蛋！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.21,1:28:23.83,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 请别！ - 不！不！希德内！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.91,1:28:26.93,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,开门！是他干的！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.01,1:28:31.34,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,快救我！他疯了！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.42,1:28:33.47,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 希德内！ - 滚！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.55,1:28:35.85,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,希德内？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.92,1:28:39.65,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,都给我走开
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.59,1:28:44.79,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 希德 - 比利
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.90,1:28:54.27,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,噢！比利，比利 你没事儿吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.34,1:28:57.17,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我没事 - 我还以为你死了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.24,1:29:00.04,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,没有，虽然象一头中了镖的野猪， 但是我没事
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.11,1:29:02.20,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,起来
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.28,1:29:04.54,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我没事 - 你在流血
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.62,1:29:07.55,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 噢，天哪 - 我们需要帮助
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.62,1:29:08.68,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,不，他在外面！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.69,1:29:10.71,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,不，把枪给我，把枪给我， 没问题的
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.79,1:29:13.15,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题，没问题
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.22,1:29:15.16,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,小心
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.33,1:29:18.82,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 请救救我！ - 进来，进来！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.90,1:29:21.09,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,斯图精神错乱了！ 他发疯了！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.53,1:29:25.70,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,每个人有时候都会发点儿疯的
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.77,1:29:27.63,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不，比利！ - 噢，他妈的！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.64,1:29:37.01,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,安东尼·帕金斯的《惊魂记》
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.75,1:29:43.05,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.12,1:29:47.72,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,玉米糖浆在《凶灵》中就是用的 这个来替代猪血的
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.93,1:29:53.19,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,斯图
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.26,1:29:57.10,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,请救救我
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.17,1:30:00.19,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,惊诧吧，希德内
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.37,1:30:06.04,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不！ - 哦！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.11,1:30:08.77,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,哦，可以了，哇
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.48,1:30:13.97,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么啦，希德内？ 你看起来就像是见到鬼了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.05,1:30:16.71,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你们为什么要这样做？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.79,1:30:18.81,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,所有这些只是一个游戏而已，希德内
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.89,1:30:20.88,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,名字叫做“猜猜看，我会怎么死”
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.88,1:30:21.65,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,去你妈的！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.73,1:30:23.43,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,不，不，不，不，不
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.43,1:30:26.32,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我们已经玩过这个游戏了，还记得吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.40,1:30:29.46,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你失败了 - 这是个有趣的游戏，希德内
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.53,1:30:32.53,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,知道吗？我们问你一个问题， 如果你答错了,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.60,1:30:34.76,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,“砰...咔”，你死了！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.84,1:30:37.90,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,要是答对了，你也死
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.98,1:30:39.13,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你们两个全疯了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.14,1:30:41.57,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,事实上，我们更喜欢用“精神病” 这个词
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.65,1:30:45.74,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你们逃不了的 - 哦，不会吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.65,1:30:48.85,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你应该对科顿·威而瑞说这话
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.92,1:30:51.65,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你简直想不到嫁祸给他是多么容易
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.72,1:30:55.66,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,看几场电影，记下些电影里的手段
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.73,1:30:58.09,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 真是很有趣呀 - 不！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.16,1:31:00.43,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 喂！ - 你想要去哪儿呀？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.50,1:31:03.19,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.27,1:31:05.79,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你们为什么杀死我妈？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.87,1:31:09.60,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么？为什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.67,1:31:12.30,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你听到了吗，斯图？ 她想要我的动机
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.58,1:31:16.51,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我真的是不相信什么动机之说的， 希德
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.58,1:31:18.23,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我的意思是，你知道诺曼·贝茨 有动机吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.23,1:31:18.51,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.58,1:31:21.89,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,那他们真的知道汉尼拔·莱克特为什么爱吃人肉吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.89,1:31:22.71,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,他们不知道！
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.79,1:31:26.55,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,所以，如果没有动机，那就更恐怖， 希德
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.62,1:31:29.15,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是在帮你老娘，希德
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.23,1:31:30.63,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,那个女人就是一个毫不知耻的荡妇
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.63,1:31:32.79,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,在我们镇上四处找人上她，当自己是莎朗·斯通似的
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.86,1:31:34.16,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,是艾我们把她从不幸中解脱出来了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.16,1:31:35.30,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,因为让我们直说吧，希德内
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.37,1:31:38.53,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你老娘不是莎朗·斯通，嗯？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.74,1:31:46.23,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你说那个动机够了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.44,1:31:50.68,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,那这个呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.75,1:31:55.24,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你那母狗老娘曾操过我爸，
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.09,1:32:00.72,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,就是她，使得我妈出走，抛弃了我
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.43,1:32:05.40,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,这个动机怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.46,1:32:09.06,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,没有母爱的孩子会产生严重的变态 行为
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.13,1:32:10.13,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,这已经在你身上验证了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.13,1:32:11.86,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,它使得你刚才竟和一个精神病发生 性关系
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.94,1:32:16.34,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,太对了你放弃了 现在你已经不是一个处女了，哇！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.41,1:32:18.40,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我说的是“处女”，哦...哇！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.48,1:32:21.44,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,现在你要死了 这是规则
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.51,1:32:23.98,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,让我们假装所有这些只是一个恐怖影片
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.98,1:32:25.68,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,希德你说这结局会是怎样的？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.99,1:32:32.55,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,哦！哦！这是最精彩的部分！ 你一定会喜欢这个的
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.62,1:32:35.11,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要给你一个惊奇，希德
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.19,1:32:36.57,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,是艾你一定会喜欢这个的
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.57,1:32:38.06,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是“惊声尖叫”，宝贝！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.13,1:32:41.06,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,等一会儿，我马上回来
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.13,1:32:44.12,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道现在是什么时侯吗，希德？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.20,1:32:46.19,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,现在刚过午夜
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.27,1:32:49.97,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,是你妈死去的周年，祝贺你
Dialogue: 0,1:32:50.04,1:32:52.91,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我们正好在一年前的今天杀了她
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.98,1:32:57.44,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,注意了！哦，三号门后面有什么来着， 希德内？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:57.51,1:32:59.24,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 爸爸！ - 噢，别动
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.32,1:33:01.11,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,够了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.18,1:33:04.42,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 看起来我们不再需要这个了 - 是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.49,1:33:07.75,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,还有，哦，看看这个 叮铃铃，叮铃铃，也不需要了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.82,1:33:09.92,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,最后明白了吧，希德？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.99,1:33:12.02,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧，希德内 你想想看，嗯？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.10,1:33:14.86,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你老爹是头号嫌疑犯 我们复制了他的手机
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.93,1:33:16.27,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,所有的证据都在这儿，宝贝
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.27,1:33:18.33,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你老爹最终忍受不了了，会 发生什么事？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:18.40,1:33:19.78,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你妈死去的周年，诱发了你老爹的狂性
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.78,1:33:21.60,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,他于是来了个屠杀纵乐，杀 光了所有的人
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.67,1:33:23.94,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,当然除了比利和我 我俩被认为死了而逃脱了他的魔掌
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.01,1:33:27.14,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,然后他...杀死了你...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.21,1:33:29.87,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,再往自己头上开了一枪
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.95,1:33:32.78,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 完美的结局 - 这是我想到的
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.85,1:33:34.78,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,看这个
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.79,1:33:43.12,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好了吗？ - 是，是的！我准备好了，宝贝！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.19,1:33:47.96,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,对！快来！ 是艾宝贝，快来！快刺！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.80,1:33:55.33,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,不错，哥儿们，天哪
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.41,1:33:57.10,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,噢，天哪
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.17,1:33:59.44,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,该我了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.18,1:34:04.61,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,别忘了，不要太正，也不要太深
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.68,1:34:08.31,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,好的，记住了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.39,1:34:12.82,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,啊他妈的！他妈的！
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.89,1:34:15.36,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,他妈的！你他妈的！斯图！
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.43,1:34:18.45,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起，比利我猜我只是太有点 热心帮你了，嗯？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.53,1:34:21.55,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 把刀给我 - 不
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.63,1:34:24.50,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,把刀给我
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.37,1:34:29.30,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,快！
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.61,1:34:33.82,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你看，希德，除了我和比利
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.82,1:34:36.34,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,所有人都死了除了我们所有人都死了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.41,1:34:39.04,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我们还要继续下去，还要计划续集，
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.12,1:34:43.35,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道吗，宝贝？现在的年代， 续集是必不可少的！
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.12,1:34:48.99,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你们这两个变态杂种 你们看了太多的电影了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.06,1:34:51.55,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,听着，希德，你还敢归咎于电影？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.57,1:34:51.58,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我这儿已经感到很晕了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.63,1:34:55.36,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,电影根本不制造精神变态的人，
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.04,1:35:02.00,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧，好吧 你拿着枪
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.08,1:35:03.98,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我来把这个家伙解开，好吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.39,1:35:10.58,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 快点！ - 是
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.36,1:35:21.96,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,呃...嗯...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.03,1:35:25.70,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我们... 我们有麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,1:35:27.71,1:35:30.30,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？ - 枪，哥们儿那把枪
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.38,1:35:33.97,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我刚才就放在这儿的， 现在它不见了
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.05,1:35:37.31,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他妈的，跑哪儿去了？ - 在这儿，混蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:35:38.92,1:35:40.60,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,老兄，我以为她已经死了
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.60,1:35:42.41,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,她刚才看起来是像死了，老兄
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.49,1:35:45.25,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 现在还一样 - 我来给你们一个结局
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.32,1:35:48.32,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,那个记者因为看起来像死了，所以杀手放过了她
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.39,1:35:50.45,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,她醒后，
Dialogue: 0,1:35:50.53,1:35:52.86,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,发现了真凶是你们两个笨蛋，
Dialogue: 0,1:35:52.93,1:35:55.06,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,她找到了枪，
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.13,1:35:58.86,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,阻止了你们两个的阴谋，扭转了败局
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.94,1:36:01.41,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我喜欢这个结局
Dialogue: 0,1:36:02.74,1:36:04.94,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道一些你不知道的事情
Dialogue: 0,1:36:08.31,1:36:10.98,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,混蛋，不！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.79,1:36:16.08,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,好，哥儿们
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.15,1:36:19.92,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,好噢，太可爱了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.03,1:36:29.52,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,拉开了枪栓，这个才能起作用
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.87,1:36:37.97,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,这是基尔·唯茨，播送到此结束
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.04,1:36:40.41,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,宝贝，你会喜欢这个的！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.71,1:36:44.65,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,他妈的
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.29,1:36:48.22,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.06,1:36:56.49,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,他们跑哪儿去了？ 他们跑哪儿去了？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.56,1:36:58.55,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道， 我伤得很重，哥儿们
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.63,1:37:01.06,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我靠！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.13,1:37:05.59,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,要不要等留言机接？
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.67,1:37:08.44,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 喂？ -  你一个人在家吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:37:08.51,1:37:10.81,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,婊子！你这个婊子！ 你他妈的在哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.88,1:37:13.81,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,不远 我们来玩一个小游戏吧
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.88,1:37:16.55,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,名叫“猜猜看是谁向警察报告了你们
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.55,1:37:18.75,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,这两个可怜的、不要脸的蠢驴”
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.82,1:37:20.57,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,找到她，你这个笨蛋起来
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.57,1:37:22.45,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我不行了，比利你刺得太深了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.52,1:37:26.32,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我猜我会死在这儿，哥儿们
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.39,1:37:29.79,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,跟她讲话，跟她讲话
Dialogue: 0,1:37:36.70,1:37:37.44,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,1:37:37.44,1:37:41.47,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,哦，斯图艾斯图，斯图你的动机是什么呀？
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.54,1:37:43.14,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,比利已有一个了警察就要来了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.15,1:37:44.63,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,等会儿你会怎么告诉他们呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:37:44.71,1:37:47.11,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,纯粹是压力 我太过于敏感了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.18,1:37:49.16,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我要把你撕成碎片，你这个婊子
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.16,1:37:50.64,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,让你像你他妈的老娘一样！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.72,1:37:52.87,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,那你要先找到我才行艾你这个 杂种！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.87,1:37:53.41,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我靠！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:53.49,1:37:56.35,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,唉，你他妈的用电话打我，你个吊
Dialogue: 0,1:37:56.42,1:37:59.05,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,婊子，你在哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:01.23,1:38:04.75,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你这个婊子
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.83,1:38:06.80,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,你真给警察打电话了？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.80,1:38:08.77,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,当然，你这个可怜的蠢猪
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.83,1:38:12.13,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我爸妈会为我疯掉的
Dialogue: 0,1:38:12.20,1:38:15.26,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,啊婊子！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:44.14,1:38:46.43,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.47,1:38:52.17,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.93,1:39:12.16,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:39:12.23,1:39:14.36,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,嗷！我的胳膊！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.34,1:39:23.77,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直对你有好感呢，希德！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.48,1:39:33.04,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,婊子
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.08,1:39:46.01,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起没事了
Dialogue: 0,1:39:46.08,1:39:48.17,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,噢，天哪，兰迪， 我还以为你死了
Dialogue: 0,1:39:48.25,1:39:49.74,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,我可能本来该死，可我是处男
Dialogue: 0,1:39:49.74,1:39:51.24,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,从没想到自己会为此而这么高兴
Dialogue: 0,1:39:51.32,1:39:53.51,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,婊子！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:59.16,1:40:02.13,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,去向你妈问好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:40:08.90,1:40:12.23,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:40:35.76,1:40:37.70,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,没事了
Dialogue: 0,1:40:40.57,1:40:43.43,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,这次应该没忘记打开保险了吧， 你这个杂种
Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.78,1:40:57.72,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,小心
Dialogue: 0,1:40:57.79,1:41:01.41,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,这是本来应该死了的杀手再次复活的时刻...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:01.49,1:41:03.42,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,最后一次惊吓
Dialogue: 0,1:41:07.76,1:41:11.39,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,在我的电影中没有
Dialogue: 0,1:41:15.40,1:41:17.06,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:41:17.14,1:41:19.70,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,兰迪，帮帮我
Dialogue: 0,1:41:23.44,1:41:25.38,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 嗷，啊 - 你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:27.82,1:41:30.55,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧？ - 没事
Dialogue: 0,1:41:32.05,1:41:35.68,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 放在那儿，伙计们 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.76,1:41:37.69,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这儿 - 对不起，孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:41:37.86,1:41:41.95,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,好了，我想这样就可以了，注意跟着我
Dialogue: 0,1:41:42.03,1:41:44.85,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,大家好，这是基尔·唯茨...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:44.90,1:41:49.86,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,独家现场报道这起惊人的爆炸性新闻
Dialogue: 0,1:41:49.94,1:41:52.37,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,几个更多的本地青少年死了...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:52.44,1:41:55.37,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,结束了这起残忍的多重谋杀案，并揭开了其神秘的真相
Dialogue: 0,1:41:55.44,1:41:58.04,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,这起事件使这个安静的小镇笼罩在恐惧之中...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:58.11,1:42:00.81,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,就像是一些恐怖电影里的情节
Dialogue: 0,1:42:00.88,1:42:03.44,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,事件从打给9-1-1电话里的尖叫声开始...
Dialogue: 0,1:42:03.52,1:42:07.78,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,到这场震惊了伍兹士堡小镇的血腥 屠杀结束
Dialogue: 0,1:42:07.86,1:42:10.38,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,屠杀发生在这个平静的农舍里...
Dialogue: 0,1:42:10.46,1:42:13.05,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,这里远离大城市的犯罪和警笛声...
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.13,1:42:15.22,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,是那儿的人们向往的地方
Dialogue: 0,1:42:15.30,1:42:17.96,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,好了，把它拿回去快，快走
Dialogue: 0,1:42:18.03,1:42:20.73,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我的大制作让我们走
